(1350812, 172569, 36299, '<td valign="top">A lovely genuine smile is captured here, reflecting inner happiness.  A few changes I would make are in:  The focus seems a little out, reflection for her skin tones seems over stated, slight halo on upper right part of head and upper left arm, her left.  I bet her eyes are beautiful a closer shot or cropping,  on her right the rail is stealing the focus from her smile.  A different Jacket may of worked better here. 6</td>', 'A lovely genuine smile is captured here, reflecting inner happiness.  A few changes I would make are in:  The focus seems a little out, reflection for her skin tones seems over stated, slight halo on upper right part of head and upper left arm, her left.  I bet her eyes are beautiful a closer shot or cropping,  on her right the rail is stealing the focus from her smile.  A different Jacket may of worked better here. 6', '2005-05-02 01:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
