(1350844, 171048, 36299, '<td valign="top">Very strong, I like it.  A few things, I would of cropped out the bright top of the head or waited for better lighting, Although it is granite the contrast between the two colours is over powering, I would soften it, which would add to the contemplative nature of the photo.  As an artistic touch with DOF, I would have more in focus in the back ground less in the fore ground. 8</td>', 'Very strong, I like it.  A few things, I would of cropped out the bright top of the head or waited for better lighting, Although it is granite the contrast between the two colours is over powering, I would soften it, which would add to the contemplative nature of the photo.  As an artistic touch with DOF, I would have more in focus in the back ground less in the fore ground. 8', '2005-05-02 01:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
