(1350922, 172899, 36299, '<td valign="top">Love the colours in this.  Not sure how to judge emotion in this, but free spirit is a lack there of, err kind-of ;-).  So, good counter point.  There is slight halo between your dark and light colours, which sometimes is caused by the camera and other times from over sharpening.  Black is more associated with anger or negativism, which does not work with free spirit, this photo would work best in negative space.  There is a lot f noise in the clouds, compared to the rest of the photo. 7.</td>', 'Love the colours in this.  Not sure how to judge emotion in this, but free spirit is a lack there of, err kind-of ;-).  So, good counter point.  There is slight halo between your dark and light colours, which sometimes is caused by the camera and other times from over sharpening.  Black is more associated with anger or negativism, which does not work with free spirit, this photo would work best in negative space.  There is a lot f noise in the clouds, compared to the rest of the photo. 7.', '2005-05-02 01:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
