(1351009, 173029, 36299, '<td valign="top">LOVE this shot!  Do I ever remeber those days.  I would of stuck with colour, since the detail is to be the emotion not the picture, per say.  The blackening of the background and the feathering are strong, it would be great if it was just thrown into the hands of th lens.  The out of focus floor seems not needed in the shot either. In my opinion ;-).  7.</td>', 'LOVE this shot!  Do I ever remeber those days.  I would of stuck with colour, since the detail is to be the emotion not the picture, per say.  The blackening of the background and the feathering are strong, it would be great if it was just thrown into the hands of th lens.  The out of focus floor seems not needed in the shot either. In my opinion ;-).  7.', '2005-05-02 01:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351010, 171447, 27894, '<td valign="top">Great shot Librodo you never cease to amaze me!!! keep up the great work.</td>', 'Great shot Librodo you never cease to amaze me!!! keep up the great work.', '2005-05-02 01:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
