(1351021, 170900, 32872, '<td valign="top">Ouch!!!  I would say you captured the mood of ''disturbed'' rather well.  The hard shadows really work to your advantage here.  This is a very unique and gritty image.  Artistic even!<br/></td>', 'Ouch!!!  I would say you captured the mood of ''disturbed'' rather well.  The hard shadows really work to your advantage here.  This is a very unique and gritty image.  Artistic even!', '2005-05-02 01:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351022, 172836, 33182, '<td valign="top">I Love the big smile in the reflection.</td>', 'I Love the big smile in the reflection.', '2005-05-02 01:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351023, 172410, 32108, '<td valign="top">great tones</td>', 'great tones', '2005-05-02 01:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351024, 172869, 33182, '<td valign="top">I can almost feel the itch.</td>', 'I can almost feel the itch.', '2005-05-02 01:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351025, 172881, 327, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge in my mind but I''m not fond of the lighting. Too strong. On my monitor your dog looks a bit blue? Of course that could just be me so take it with a grain of salt. :)</td>', 'This fits the challenge in my mind but I''m not fond of the lighting. Too strong. On my monitor your dog looks a bit blue? Of course that could just be me so take it with a grain of salt. :)', '2005-05-02 01:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351027, 173025, 36299, '<td valign="top">Never a prouder moment.  I like his expression.  Since you cannot see the brides face, I would of put more attention on the other subject.  The rose, tie etc are not as sharp as the back of the ladies head.  The glare from the windows is distracting another angle would of not worked here, but while they danced, they may have moved away from it. 7</td>', 'Never a prouder moment.  I like his expression.  Since you cannot see the brides face, I would of put more attention on the other subject.  The rose, tie etc are not as sharp as the back of the ladies head.  The glare from the windows is distracting another angle would of not worked here, but while they danced, they may have moved away from it. 7', '2005-05-02 01:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351031, 172982, 33182, '<td valign="top">I like how the child(?) is facing AWAY from the camera. the light is a tad harsh, but I like this.</td>', 'I like how the child(?) is facing AWAY from the camera. the light is a tad harsh, but I like this.', '2005-05-02 01:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351032, 172836, 327, '<td valign="top">The reflection is too cute! HAha! Light is a little strong but over all a good shot. It''s humor my escape many.</td>', 'The reflection is too cute! HAha! Light is a little strong but over all a good shot. It''s humor my escape many.', '2005-05-02 01:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351034, 172373, 33182, '<td valign="top">Lovely. I kind of wish the branches weren''t there, but not a lot you can do about that from this angle.</td>', 'Lovely. I kind of wish the branches weren''t there, but not a lot you can do about that from this angle.', '2005-05-02 01:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351037, 172780, 327, '<td valign="top">His pose is very good, natural looking. However that being said the shot is not in focus. Now you may have done this for a reason,,,? Still I think it takes away from the quaility. The shot fits the challenge.</td>', 'His pose is very good, natural looking. However that being said the shot is not in focus. Now you may have done this for a reason,,,? Still I think it takes away from the quaility. The shot fits the challenge.', '2005-05-02 01:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351039, 173061, 33182, '<td valign="top">WOW, talk about nice crisp and vibrant colors!!!! I wish the two boys weren''t looking at the camera though.</td>', 'WOW, talk about nice crisp and vibrant colors!!!! I wish the two boys weren''t looking at the camera though.', '2005-05-02 01:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351040, 172410, 327, '<td valign="top">Is he cute!! Poor thing. I love the ''aged'' feel to the shot. The tones, light!! Well done for the challenge. 9</td>', 'Is he cute!! Poor thing. I love the ''aged'' feel to the shot. The tones, light!! Well done for the challenge. 9', '2005-05-02 01:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351042, 171844, 18349, '<td valign="top">Discraft, honey...you have to get another model so everyone won''t recognize you.  No, wait, scratch that.  We like looking at you!  ;o)  <br/> <br/> Great shot, very reflective of mood and fits the challenge well.  :o)</td>', 'Discraft, honey...you have to get another model so everyone won''t recognize you.  No, wait, scratch that.  We like looking at you!  ;o)    Great shot, very reflective of mood and fits the challenge well.  :o)', '2005-05-02 01:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351043, 171867, 33182, '<td valign="top">Nice. I''d attempt to brightne the sun rays though. Raise the contrast between the dark clouds and the sun. Leaving the rest of the picture alone though. Really nice.</td>', 'Nice. I''d attempt to brightne the sun rays though. Raise the contrast between the dark clouds and the sun. Leaving the rest of the picture alone though. Really nice.', '2005-05-02 01:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351044, 173022, 327, '<td valign="top">Darling little girl and the coloring is lovely. The focus is lacking. I do think you met the challenge.</td>', 'Darling little girl and the coloring is lovely. The focus is lacking. I do think you met the challenge.', '2005-05-02 01:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351046, 171248, 36299, '<td valign="top">Beutiful picture.  The face being totaly in focus works better for me.  Slight washing out of the skin in certan areas seems to be here.  Hair.....  Due to the DOF is out of focus which works well for plants, but I do not like it in portraits....  LOL, but then who am I?  7</td>', 'Beutiful picture.  The face being totaly in focus works better for me.  Slight washing out of the skin in certan areas seems to be here.  Hair.....  Due to the DOF is out of focus which works well for plants, but I do not like it in portraits....  LOL, but then who am I?  7', '2005-05-02 01:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351048, 172141, 33182, '<td valign="top">I like the lip biting, almost want to see more of it. &lt;g&gt; I''d try cropping a little closer on the left though, leaving the negative space on the right.</td>', 'I like the lip biting, almost want to see more of it. <g> I''d try cropping a little closer on the left though, leaving the negative space on the right.', '2005-05-02 01:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351049, 173058, 327, '<td valign="top">10, love her eyes and smile. Pure happy.</td>', '10, love her eyes and smile. Pure happy.', '2005-05-02 01:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351050, 172517, 33182, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, first impression....don''t care for the blue, and the light is a little harsh on his face. the mouth shows sadness, but I just don''t see it in the eyes. Nice use of goggles though.</td>', 'Hmmmm, first impression....don''t care for the blue, and the light is a little harsh on his face. the mouth shows sadness, but I just don''t see it in the eyes. Nice use of goggles though.', '2005-05-02 01:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351052, 170900, 27894, '<td valign="top">great capture, nice use of fishing line or whatever kind of wire used. the eyes tell a lot. GL</td>', 'great capture, nice use of fishing line or whatever kind of wire used. the eyes tell a lot. GL', '2005-05-02 01:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351053, 172203, 327, '<td valign="top">Kind of a sexy feel to this shot. I think you met the challenge, but the shot just looks over works. This is not bad, just my opinion.</td>', 'Kind of a sexy feel to this shot. I think you met the challenge, but the shot just looks over works. This is not bad, just my opinion.', '2005-05-02 01:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351054, 173055, 33182, '<td valign="top">I love the background, except I admit I''d prefer to eithe rhave the person NOT be in the shot, or be looking outward, while standing, or even be holding hands as a couple.</td>', 'I love the background, except I admit I''d prefer to eithe rhave the person NOT be in the shot, or be looking outward, while standing, or even be holding hands as a couple.', '2005-05-02 01:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351055, 172605, 32872, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girl and beautiful, sweet smile.  I like your use of DOF in your image.  Nice detail over-all.<br/></td>', 'Beautiful girl and beautiful, sweet smile.  I like your use of DOF in your image.  Nice detail over-all.', '2005-05-02 01:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351056, 173007, 327, '<td valign="top">A cute shot but lacks any strong focal area. Color is good, composition is good.</td>', 'A cute shot but lacks any strong focal area. Color is good, composition is good.', '2005-05-02 01:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351057, 170488, 33182, '<td valign="top">oooo, lookout, she''s giving you the evil eye. Kind of wish you had the eyes in sharp focus with the rest of it slightly blurred. The eyes are the central draw to this shot.</td>', 'oooo, lookout, she''s giving you the evil eye. Kind of wish you had the eyes in sharp focus with the rest of it slightly blurred. The eyes are the central draw to this shot.', '2005-05-02 01:57:59.000000', NULL, 1);
