(1351066, 172737, 36299, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!  Bassets, love em.  Seems to be a pup, so does not give that full basset blue look.  Some how the focus seems out a bit, and the nose a wee bit to much shine.  Focus loved the lower left though and the paw on the lower right.  Artistically, they eye seems a little dead, red eye maybe? 6.</td>', 'Nice capture!  Bassets, love em.  Seems to be a pup, so does not give that full basset blue look.  Some how the focus seems out a bit, and the nose a wee bit to much shine.  Focus loved the lower left though and the paw on the lower right.  Artistically, they eye seems a little dead, red eye maybe? 6.', '2005-05-02 01:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351067, 172933, 36628, '<td valign="top">Great reflection in the left lens, a closer crop might help accentuate that little detail.</td>', 'Great reflection in the left lens, a closer crop might help accentuate that little detail.', '2005-05-02 01:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
