(1351088, 172846, 33182, '<td valign="top">From an artistic point of view I like this, kind of wish the veil was a little further left though. Showing just a little more of the eye, and the pattern on the veil is distracting.</td>', 'From an artistic point of view I like this, kind of wish the veil was a little further left though. Showing just a little more of the eye, and the pattern on the veil is distracting.', '2005-05-02 02:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
