(1351243, 172746, 36299, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  The surrounding is very nice.  I do not know if meditative, but the outcome of it is the emotion, artistically speaking.  The leaves of the furn seem over saturated with light ( a good thing ;-)?) The subject being more in focus may have yielded better punch, for the photo.  Buddha, is a nice touch, as well as the rock.  The rest of the shot seems to make things cluttered. 6</td>', 'Nice capture.  The surrounding is very nice.  I do not know if meditative, but the outcome of it is the emotion, artistically speaking.  The leaves of the furn seem over saturated with light ( a good thing ;-)?) The subject being more in focus may have yielded better punch, for the photo.  Buddha, is a nice touch, as well as the rock.  The rest of the shot seems to make things cluttered. 6', '2005-05-02 02:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351246, 172751, 34763, '<td valign="top">A tremendous work of art using sharp focus,(yet softness) color of the flowers and the intensity of the friendship. Having the brightness of the flowers really draws the eye to the emotions the girls are showing. Well thought out and super presentation. A winner indeed.</td>', 'A tremendous work of art using sharp focus,(yet softness) color of the flowers and the intensity of the friendship. Having the brightness of the flowers really draws the eye to the emotions the girls are showing. Well thought out and super presentation. A winner indeed.', '2005-05-02 02:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
