(1351707, 172508, 35467, '<td valign="top">Love the contrasts, well done</td>', 'Love the contrasts, well done', '2005-05-02 05:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351710, 172845, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite picture in the challenge. It makes me happy just to see them so happy and having fun!</td>', 'This is my favorite picture in the challenge. It makes me happy just to see them so happy and having fun!', '2005-05-02 05:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351711, 172974, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a nice picture. I love how it captures the joy both of these people feel. Your picture really shows the wonderful quality of the grandparent/grandchild relationship.</td>', 'What a nice picture. I love how it captures the joy both of these people feel. Your picture really shows the wonderful quality of the grandparent/grandchild relationship.', '2005-05-02 05:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351716, 172435, 17507, '<td valign="top">hm... looks like the word that follows is "love." the lacy womens'' garment is what did it for me- nice choice of clothing. it took me a while to figure this out, when I feel like it should have come sooner when the mood is supposed to be clear. i think you might have communicated better with a rose rather than the daisy-like thing (i am no botanist) and the addition of some wine into the picture. the two candles, in their different containers,  seem rather arbitrary. placed high in the frame like that, they pull the eye strongly away from the other elements of the picture.<br/> <br/>technically speaking, the image is evenly sharp, which is a nice thing to see. and the image does meet the challenge, I think, even if the message is not so clear. but technique and being able to stick to a theme are only half of a good image - this is a 5 to me.</td>', 'hm... looks like the word that follows is "love." the lacy womens'' garment is what did it for me- nice choice of clothing. it took me a while to figure this out, when I feel like it should have come sooner when the mood is supposed to be clear. i think you might have communicated better with a rose rather than the daisy-like thing (i am no botanist) and the addition of some wine into the picture. the two candles, in their different containers,  seem rather arbitrary. placed high in the frame like that, they pull the eye strongly away from the other elements of the picture. technically speaking, the image is evenly sharp, which is a nice thing to see. and the image does meet the challenge, I think, even if the message is not so clear. but technique and being able to stick to a theme are only half of a good image - this is a 5 to me.', '2005-05-02 05:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351717, 172398, 35720, '<td valign="top">Great pose and expression. Excellent capture!</td>', 'Great pose and expression. Excellent capture!', '2005-05-02 05:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351719, 172931, 35720, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot. It''s simple and effective with great colours and atmosphere. Good shot!</td>', 'I like this one a lot. It''s simple and effective with great colours and atmosphere. Good shot!', '2005-05-02 05:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351721, 172543, 17507, '<td valign="top">nice colors. focus seems to be more on the knee than the face, and her expression, her eyes, are definitely enigmatic, which makes me want to see as much detail as possible. but when I look for the detailed area, what I get is KNEE! knee is not as interesting, so I as viewer am frustrated! save me from viewer frustration, and show me proper focus! (6)</td>', 'nice colors. focus seems to be more on the knee than the face, and her expression, her eyes, are definitely enigmatic, which makes me want to see as much detail as possible. but when I look for the detailed area, what I get is KNEE! knee is not as interesting, so I as viewer am frustrated! save me from viewer frustration, and show me proper focus! (6)', '2005-05-02 05:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351723, 172713, 35720, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, but on the other hand I do not think it meets the challenge well enough so I''ll give you 7.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, but on the other hand I do not think it meets the challenge well enough so I''ll give you 7.', '2005-05-02 05:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351725, 173055, 17507, '<td valign="top">The balance seems rather right-heavy on this picture.  i think either the crop should be looser on the right, or the crouching figure should be a bit farther left--or a bit of both. Mood is not clear, and the title is not helpful. But the colors are wonderful. (6)</td>', 'The balance seems rather right-heavy on this picture.  i think either the crop should be looser on the right, or the crouching figure should be a bit farther left--or a bit of both. Mood is not clear, and the title is not helpful. But the colors are wonderful. (6)', '2005-05-02 05:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351731, 173050, 33352, '<td valign="top">A Real theme of the present times, sharp image &amp; good colourhelp lift the mood.8</td>', 'A Real theme of the present times, sharp image & good colourhelp lift the mood.8', '2005-05-02 05:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351732, 172746, 17507, '<td valign="top">Post-processing is good, but a bit heavy--if you did it on an adjustment layer, I''d say reduce the opacity 50% for starters, and adjust from there. (6)</td>', 'Post-processing is good, but a bit heavy--if you did it on an adjustment layer, I''d say reduce the opacity 50% for starters, and adjust from there. (6)', '2005-05-02 05:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351735, 171542, 17507, '<td valign="top">mine, too. and I don''t even like tomatoes. I wonder if having one''s mouth water constitutes a mood or an emotion. The emotion of... desire?</td>', 'mine, too. and I don''t even like tomatoes. I wonder if having one''s mouth water constitutes a mood or an emotion. The emotion of... desire?', '2005-05-02 05:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351737, 172324, 33352, '<td valign="top">Great Find,and good use of the light</td>', 'Great Find,and good use of the light', '2005-05-02 05:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351738, 173061, 35467, '<td valign="top">A winner, not sure there is a lot you could do with this, well done</td>', 'A winner, not sure there is a lot you could do with this, well done', '2005-05-02 06:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351741, 172072, 35467, '<td valign="top">Very powerful image, you have done an awesome job of this</td>', 'Very powerful image, you have done an awesome job of this', '2005-05-02 06:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351744, 172932, 35467, '<td valign="top">A picture paints a thousand words.... well done</td>', 'A picture paints a thousand words.... well done', '2005-05-02 06:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351745, 171910, 17507, '<td valign="top">fabulous colors, and I like the darker pallette. still, a bit greater tonal range would have been nice - burn the background, dodge the eyes? <br/> <br/>the mysterious expression is great, and the model lovely. however, "content" is not what I think when I see this - she looks moody and contemplative. the image speaks for itself, and doesn''t need "defining" with a title - so I think in this case the image would have been greatly enhanced with title being a phrase that tells a story. <br/>(7)</td>', 'fabulous colors, and I like the darker pallette. still, a bit greater tonal range would have been nice - burn the background, dodge the eyes?  the mysterious expression is great, and the model lovely. however, "content" is not what I think when I see this - she looks moody and contemplative. the image speaks for itself, and doesn''t need "defining" with a title - so I think in this case the image would have been greatly enhanced with title being a phrase that tells a story. (7)', '2005-05-02 06:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351746, 173057, 33352, '<td valign="top">well composed</td>', 'well composed', '2005-05-02 06:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351748, 172881, 35467, '<td valign="top">For an animal which is not supposed to have any change of expression you have done a pretty good job of capturing one here</td>', 'For an animal which is not supposed to have any change of expression you have done a pretty good job of capturing one here', '2005-05-02 06:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351749, 171944, 36585, '<td valign="top">a little too soft, and pity for the cropped head</td>', 'a little too soft, and pity for the cropped head', '2005-05-02 06:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
