(1351907, 172371, 30018, '<td valign="top">Sometimes I think the titles get in the way.  When I look at this image, I see a very nice image with great detail, and crystal clear focus in the face, with a nice out-of-focus shirt and ear, which helps me concentrate on the wonderful photography of the face.  HOWEVER...without the title, I can look in this man''s face and see sincere passion, or I can see disappointment, or I can see intent listening and concentration.  Whatever the "Mood" is, this is a great image, and deserves a very high score.  I''m starting off with &lt;8&gt;.  I expect to it will be bumped up a bit the second time throough.  Good luck on a great image. &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Sometimes I think the titles get in the way.  When I look at this image, I see a very nice image with great detail, and crystal clear focus in the face, with a nice out-of-focus shirt and ear, which helps me concentrate on the wonderful photography of the face.  HOWEVER...without the title, I can look in this man''s face and see sincere passion, or I can see disappointment, or I can see intent listening and concentration.  Whatever the "Mood" is, this is a great image, and deserves a very high score.  I''m starting off with <8>.  I expect to it will be bumped up a bit the second time throough.  Good luck on a great image. <8>', '2005-05-02 07:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
