(1351915, 172713, 30018, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm...looks like the cover or one of those CD''s you buy in the store with the real peaceful music on it.  It does want me to just kick back and relax as I enjoy the momoent, as I know the moment will be gone before I know it.  This is a very nice silhouette, with some great detail in the sky.  Incredibly warm, and contrasted with the dark mountains.  Nicely done.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Hmmmm...looks like the cover or one of those CD''s you buy in the store with the real peaceful music on it.  It does want me to just kick back and relax as I enjoy the momoent, as I know the moment will be gone before I know it.  This is a very nice silhouette, with some great detail in the sky.  Incredibly warm, and contrasted with the dark mountains.  Nicely done.  <6>', '2005-05-02 07:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
