(1351946, 173055, 30018, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm...looks like the cover or one of those CD''s you buy in the store with the real peaceful music on it.  This one contains Love Songs from the 60''s, probably.  Nice silhouettes and a combinations of both warm and cool colors accent this sunset.  Nice Image.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Hmmmm...looks like the cover or one of those CD''s you buy in the store with the real peaceful music on it.  This one contains Love Songs from the 60''s, probably.  Nice silhouettes and a combinations of both warm and cool colors accent this sunset.  Nice Image.  <5>', '2005-05-02 07:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
