(1351960, 173022, 35467, '<td valign="top">The expression is priceless! I like what you have done with the photo ... might have worked better if photo had been sharper, but that expression was not going to wait.</td>', 'The expression is priceless! I like what you have done with the photo ... might have worked better if photo had been sharper, but that expression was not going to wait.', '2005-05-02 07:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
