(1351963, 172909, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is a very dreamy image.  Takes me back to my childhood, and makes me feel young again.  Very interesting image.  I love the detail and the color in the bubbles, and the little boy who is so out-of-focus in the background, which gives this image the feel of a childhood playground.  Very nicely done.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'This is a very dreamy image.  Takes me back to my childhood, and makes me feel young again.  Very interesting image.  I love the detail and the color in the bubbles, and the little boy who is so out-of-focus in the background, which gives this image the feel of a childhood playground.  Very nicely done.  <7>', '2005-05-02 07:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
