(1351993, 172523, 30018, '<td valign="top">My first thought...what will this teenager think of this picture, 25 or 30 years from now.  This is a great image to do in B&amp;W, as it forces the veiw to concentrate on the details of the lips, eyes, and hair.  Great detial, and skin textures, with a facial expresssion that says it all.  Nice job.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'My first thought...what will this teenager think of this picture, 25 or 30 years from now.  This is a great image to do in B&W, as it forces the veiw to concentrate on the details of the lips, eyes, and hair.  Great detial, and skin textures, with a facial expresssion that says it all.  Nice job.  <6>', '2005-05-02 07:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1351994, 172836, 36585, '<td valign="top">too bad the puppet''s head has been cropped off; plus, doesn''t really tell me pride and joy...</td>', 'too bad the puppet''s head has been cropped off; plus, doesn''t really tell me pride and joy...', '2005-05-02 07:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
