(1352015, 172764, 36585, '<td valign="top">good snapshot</td>', 'good snapshot', '2005-05-02 07:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352016, 171516, 23456, '<td valign="top">What a sweet little girl. This photo caught my eye. You caught an emotion quickly here so no set-up I wouldn''t think. If you could do it all again , I do find the hat distracting from that beautiful face, sharper focus needed and if you have photoshop or similar program, I''d suggest removing some of the blemishes(dirt) from her face but then again it could be the whole appeal of the photo ? Maybe a touch more DOF as well. So with a few general adjustments here and there this would be a fantastic shot ! Keep at it !</td>', 'What a sweet little girl. This photo caught my eye. You caught an emotion quickly here so no set-up I wouldn''t think. If you could do it all again , I do find the hat distracting from that beautiful face, sharper focus needed and if you have photoshop or similar program, I''d suggest removing some of the blemishes(dirt) from her face but then again it could be the whole appeal of the photo ? Maybe a touch more DOF as well. So with a few general adjustments here and there this would be a fantastic shot ! Keep at it !', '2005-05-02 07:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352017, 172688, 36585, '<td valign="top">good snapshot</td>', 'good snapshot', '2005-05-02 07:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352019, 172805, 36585, '<td valign="top">a little staged, but good</td>', 'a little staged, but good', '2005-05-02 07:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352020, 172689, 28299, '<td valign="top">That about says it all - LOL!  Wonderful capture.</td>', 'That about says it all - LOL!  Wonderful capture.', '2005-05-02 07:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352021, 173064, 36585, '<td valign="top">too bad they are not in focus</td>', 'too bad they are not in focus', '2005-05-02 07:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352022, 171447, 30018, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  Wonderful contrast.  Great eye contact.  Beautiful model.  Without looking at the title, this could invoke many different moods for me, including ''interest'', ''sadness'', ''loneliness'', ''sorrow'', as well as many others.  I love the composition, with her hair blowing across her face.  This helps define her face against the white background.  I''m not a fan of white backgrounds, but this works very nicely, and I''m sure this will be haning on someone''s wall, if it is not already.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Beautiful image.  Wonderful contrast.  Great eye contact.  Beautiful model.  Without looking at the title, this could invoke many different moods for me, including ''interest'', ''sadness'', ''loneliness'', ''sorrow'', as well as many others.  I love the composition, with her hair blowing across her face.  This helps define her face against the white background.  I''m not a fan of white backgrounds, but this works very nicely, and I''m sure this will be haning on someone''s wall, if it is not already.  <7>', '2005-05-02 07:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352023, 172735, 28299, '<td valign="top">A little closer would have captured their expressions and dominated the picture.</td>', 'A little closer would have captured their expressions and dominated the picture.', '2005-05-02 07:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
