(1352039, 172940, 30018, '<td valign="top">That''s just how I felt yesterday afternoon.  Nice capture.  Nice idea.  Great color contrasts, with excellent detail and DOF. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'That''s just how I felt yesterday afternoon.  Nice capture.  Nice idea.  Great color contrasts, with excellent detail and DOF. <7>', '2005-05-02 07:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
