(1352057, 173050, 30018, '<td valign="top">I love the over blue colors in this image.  I think however, this would have been a much stronger image, had the bottles, and the pills been photographed on a bedroom stand or a coffee table, rather than set up as a still life.  This to me would have been a much stronger suggestion of a mood or emotion.  This, as it is arranged, really looks more like an advertisement type of image. &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'I love the over blue colors in this image.  I think however, this would have been a much stronger image, had the bottles, and the pills been photographed on a bedroom stand or a coffee table, rather than set up as a still life.  This to me would have been a much stronger suggestion of a mood or emotion.  This, as it is arranged, really looks more like an advertisement type of image. <5>', '2005-05-02 08:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
