(1352249, 172586, 327, '<td valign="top">First think I noticed is the tile. Looks like it was taken in the shower/bathroom. Next the shadow that runs the along his outline. Then the noise.<br/>The tile is a bit bright and although plain it''s surface is reflective and can cause trouble. The shadow..you just have to watch out for them, move your lights or your subject. Last the noise..?ISO if it''s too high it will be there. Personally in many shots I like noise and it can add to a shot.<br/>Finally: This little man is so cute..erh handsome. He could be a model. Your shot is okay but the light is pretty strong. The focus is good and the pose is good.<br/>You on target for the challenge.</td>', 'First think I noticed is the tile. Looks like it was taken in the shower/bathroom. Next the shadow that runs the along his outline. Then the noise.The tile is a bit bright and although plain it''s surface is reflective and can cause trouble. The shadow..you just have to watch out for them, move your lights or your subject. Last the noise..?ISO if it''s too high it will be there. Personally in many shots I like noise and it can add to a shot.Finally: This little man is so cute..erh handsome. He could be a model. Your shot is okay but the light is pretty strong. The focus is good and the pose is good.You on target for the challenge.', '2005-05-02 10:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
