(1352289, 173065, 20018, '<td valign="top">nice photojournalistic type of shot, lacking a bit though in sharpness especially at the center subject maybe your ap was too open</td>', 'nice photojournalistic type of shot, lacking a bit though in sharpness especially at the center subject maybe your ap was too open', '2005-05-02 10:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352292, 172932, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is not the greatest image in the challenge, but it does invoke an emotion.  I was there 7 short years ago, and I know exactly what this feeling is like.  Clearly this is not a controlled photograph (lighting, composition, ect), which allows it to fall into the catagory of a snapshot, but as mentioned above does depict strong emotions which include ''success, happiness, joy, victory,and accomplishment. I may be wrong but I suspect this image will not do real well, but my similiar experience helps me make the connection.    Good luck!  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'This is not the greatest image in the challenge, but it does invoke an emotion.  I was there 7 short years ago, and I know exactly what this feeling is like.  Clearly this is not a controlled photograph (lighting, composition, ect), which allows it to fall into the catagory of a snapshot, but as mentioned above does depict strong emotions which include ''success, happiness, joy, victory,and accomplishment. I may be wrong but I suspect this image will not do real well, but my similiar experience helps me make the connection.    Good luck!  <5>', '2005-05-02 10:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352294, 172141, 20018, '<td valign="top">nice portaiture type shot with beautiful lighting</td>', 'nice portaiture type shot with beautiful lighting', '2005-05-02 10:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352295, 173061, 20018, '<td valign="top">nice capture and image but thtat border and filter really ruin it for me</td>', 'nice capture and image but thtat border and filter really ruin it for me', '2005-05-02 10:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352300, 171163, 20018, '<td valign="top">nice perspective and composition make this a really interesting image</td>', 'nice perspective and composition make this a really interesting image', '2005-05-02 10:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352302, 171632, 20018, '<td valign="top">scary teeth</td>', 'scary teeth', '2005-05-02 10:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352303, 172878, 30018, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I''m lost on this one.  I''m sure your intent was to capture the frustration this person experiences, but in my opinion, I don''t think the image does so.  Only the title does.  &lt;4&gt;</td>', 'Without the title, I''m lost on this one.  I''m sure your intent was to capture the frustration this person experiences, but in my opinion, I don''t think the image does so.  Only the title does.  <4>', '2005-05-02 10:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352308, 172866, 20018, '<td valign="top">nice shot, compositionally and lighting wise, post processing works. the only distracting element is the chain though</td>', 'nice shot, compositionally and lighting wise, post processing works. the only distracting element is the chain though', '2005-05-02 10:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352309, 172924, 20018, '<td valign="top">ok...so where''s the breakfast...now I''m hungry :)</td>', 'ok...so where''s the breakfast...now I''m hungry :)', '2005-05-02 10:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352312, 171851, 20018, '<td valign="top">subject is interesting, but unfortunately the border/effect is very distracting.</td>', 'subject is interesting, but unfortunately the border/effect is very distracting.', '2005-05-02 10:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352314, 172492, 31230, '<td valign="top">Very expressive little boy.  Nice capture</td>', 'Very expressive little boy.  Nice capture', '2005-05-02 10:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352315, 172748, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Well photographed.  I''m curious to find out if your lovely model is made up for a play or for your picture.  Reminds me somewhat of the Comedy and Tragedy masks.  I love the lighting, and the wonderful skin tones, and the beautiful brown eyes which command attention.  I like the fact that the dark hair is lit just enough to seperate if from the black background.  The only flaw with this image is not yours, but your models, and that is the dirty fingernails.  I would however love to hear more about this image.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Very nice image.  Well photographed.  I''m curious to find out if your lovely model is made up for a play or for your picture.  Reminds me somewhat of the Comedy and Tragedy masks.  I love the lighting, and the wonderful skin tones, and the beautiful brown eyes which command attention.  I like the fact that the dark hair is lit just enough to seperate if from the black background.  The only flaw with this image is not yours, but your models, and that is the dirty fingernails.  I would however love to hear more about this image.  <7>', '2005-05-02 10:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352316, 172935, 31230, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of boredom</td>', 'Nice picture of boredom', '2005-05-02 10:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352318, 172689, 327, '<td valign="top">Man I know that look! Good capture. 8</td>', 'Man I know that look! Good capture. 8', '2005-05-02 10:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352320, 173000, 31230, '<td valign="top">Wow, what amazing color and clarity</td>', 'Wow, what amazing color and clarity', '2005-05-02 10:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352324, 172523, 20018, '<td valign="top">lol...that nose ring gauge looks way too small, the lipstick shade or color is probably unflattering I''d stick with flat blacks or blues...btw...lol is that really a nose ring?</td>', 'lol...that nose ring gauge looks way too small, the lipstick shade or color is probably unflattering I''d stick with flat blacks or blues...btw...lol is that really a nose ring?', '2005-05-02 10:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
