(1352334, 172909, 31230, '<td valign="top">I get that the bubbles are the focus, but would have liked to see the child a bit more focused to see his or her reaction to the bubbles.</td>', 'I get that the bubbles are the focus, but would have liked to see the child a bit more focused to see his or her reaction to the bubbles.', '2005-05-02 10:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
