(1352373, 172441, 2170, '<td valign="top">this is a great capture.  did you try to bring his face out just a little bit more?  he''s kind of dominated by the cables on the right (which are great, by the way -- really set the backstage scene)</td>', 'this is a great capture.  did you try to bring his face out just a little bit more?  he''s kind of dominated by the cables on the right (which are great, by the way -- really set the backstage scene)', '2005-05-02 11:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352374, 173058, 31230, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sharp eyes.</td>', 'Beautiful sharp eyes.', '2005-05-02 11:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352375, 172880, 2170, '<td valign="top">pretty dark.  this could have the colors brought up more to really make it pop.</td>', 'pretty dark.  this could have the colors brought up more to really make it pop.', '2005-05-02 11:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352376, 172751, 31230, '<td valign="top">What a great shot.</td>', 'What a great shot.', '2005-05-02 11:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352377, 172525, 30018, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of editing.  This image is very cold, and very still.  Maybe very "solid" would be a better choice of words.  The almost monochromatic tone to his image give it that stone like feel.  Almost like a head stone.   &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Interesting choice of editing.  This image is very cold, and very still.  Maybe very "solid" would be a better choice of words.  The almost monochromatic tone to his image give it that stone like feel.  Almost like a head stone.   <6>', '2005-05-02 11:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352379, 172739, 31230, '<td valign="top">Nice piece of photojournalism</td>', 'Nice piece of photojournalism', '2005-05-02 11:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352381, 172849, 2170, '<td valign="top">great centered composition.  i would crop out the handle on the lower left.  i would also try to bring up the lighting on the face to make it pop a bit more.</td>', 'great centered composition.  i would crop out the handle on the lower left.  i would also try to bring up the lighting on the face to make it pop a bit more.', '2005-05-02 11:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352382, 171514, 31230, '<td valign="top">Nice but wish the whole shot was in focus.</td>', 'Nice but wish the whole shot was in focus.', '2005-05-02 11:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352386, 172200, 2170, '<td valign="top">i''m not sure the dual composition really works here.</td>', 'i''m not sure the dual composition really works here.', '2005-05-02 11:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352388, 173014, 2170, '<td valign="top">i think the focus should be on the other eye, since that is kind of the primary focal point in the composition.  nice crop.</td>', 'i think the focus should be on the other eye, since that is kind of the primary focal point in the composition.  nice crop.', '2005-05-02 11:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352391, 171513, 35352, '<td valign="top">I swear I saw that top candle flicker!!</td>', 'I swear I saw that top candle flicker!!', '2005-05-02 11:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352397, 173061, 31403, '<td valign="top">I''m sure that I''m not the only one that dislikes the frame - great photo though</td>', 'I''m sure that I''m not the only one that dislikes the frame - great photo though', '2005-05-02 11:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352405, 170488, 327, '<td valign="top">8 I love her little face, expression and the headband. I also love the angle you shot this from. I like the background and the light. I do think the focus is soft on her face. The little pink ribbon is more in focus then her eyes. Still it''s over all a nice shot.</td>', '8 I love her little face, expression and the headband. I also love the angle you shot this from. I like the background and the light. I do think the focus is soft on her face. The little pink ribbon is more in focus then her eyes. Still it''s over all a nice shot.', '2005-05-02 11:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352408, 173020, 327, '<td valign="top">Your title is perfect for her. I think maybe too much neat image or something, her skin looks a little plastic to me. She is darling and you really captured ''her''. I love the light. Her pearls or whatever on her dress are a little over exposed. Still it''s over all nice. 8</td>', 'Your title is perfect for her. I think maybe too much neat image or something, her skin looks a little plastic to me. She is darling and you really captured ''her''. I love the light. Her pearls or whatever on her dress are a little over exposed. Still it''s over all nice. 8', '2005-05-02 11:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352411, 172401, 36299, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, the greens have just enough punch to give it variation.  I am not sure about the sweeping effect on the water in the lower part of the picture when it appears that the water is in focus under it.  It also seems that the white is punched a bit due to what looks like two white out spots 2/5 from the bottom, center. 7.</td>', 'Nice photo, the greens have just enough punch to give it variation.  I am not sure about the sweeping effect on the water in the lower part of the picture when it appears that the water is in focus under it.  It also seems that the white is punched a bit due to what looks like two white out spots 2/5 from the bottom, center. 7.', '2005-05-02 11:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352413, 171910, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this. The composition is very nice. ?Better in B&amp;W? Little bit of noise or pixelation but this is a strong 8</td>', 'I like this. The composition is very nice. ?Better in B&W? Little bit of noise or pixelation but this is a strong 8', '2005-05-02 11:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352418, 172737, 327, '<td valign="top">Chubby cheeks. Very cute pup. The shot needs some focus and your light is a bit strong. Also try to have a plain backgroud (print shirt).</td>', 'Chubby cheeks. Very cute pup. The shot needs some focus and your light is a bit strong. Also try to have a plain backgroud (print shirt).', '2005-05-02 11:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352419, 172508, 35998, '<td valign="top">If this was taken from a distance, and left to true color or all BW, then it would be believable... this is not.  It feels very staged, and therefore leaves me with an odd distaste for the photo. <br/> <br/></td>', 'If this was taken from a distance, and left to true color or all BW, then it would be believable... this is not.  It feels very staged, and therefore leaves me with an odd distaste for the photo.  ', '2005-05-02 11:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352420, 172751, 34373, '<td valign="top">That is SO sweet!  Great shot!</td>', 'That is SO sweet!  Great shot!', '2005-05-02 11:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352425, 172838, 327, '<td valign="top">Mabye less of his head and more of her. She is so cute and we don''t see enough of her. I realize he is placing the crown on her head but the composition is weak in this shot. I do like the b&amp;w and the light is also okay.</td>', 'Mabye less of his head and more of her. She is so cute and we don''t see enough of her. I realize he is placing the crown on her head but the composition is weak in this shot. I do like the b&w and the light is also okay.', '2005-05-02 11:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352431, 172373, 34868, '<td valign="top">Very nice image I like the light on the path</td>', 'Very nice image I like the light on the path', '2005-05-02 11:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352433, 173020, 34868, '<td valign="top">Flesh tones look a little (candy) over saturated maybe</td>', 'Flesh tones look a little (candy) over saturated maybe', '2005-05-02 11:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352436, 173029, 34868, '<td valign="top">Now that is a mood very well done</td>', 'Now that is a mood very well done', '2005-05-02 11:34:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1352439, 170900, 34868, '<td valign="top">not getting the mood thing, bit I like the image</td>', 'not getting the mood thing, bit I like the image', '2005-05-02 11:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352440, 172402, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image, with great detail and good tonal quality.  I don''t think the title of your image adds to it.  In fact it is probably doing just the opposite.   The image speaks for itself and one of the true, real, non-posed shots that sends a clear message of emotion.  This, I am sure witll be in someone''s baby album.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'This is a nice image, with great detail and good tonal quality.  I don''t think the title of your image adds to it.  In fact it is probably doing just the opposite.   The image speaks for itself and one of the true, real, non-posed shots that sends a clear message of emotion.  This, I am sure witll be in someone''s baby album.  <6>', '2005-05-02 11:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352445, 173055, 34868, '<td valign="top">very well done sunset strong colors but I wounder what the subject is doing.</td>', 'very well done sunset strong colors but I wounder what the subject is doing.', '2005-05-02 11:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352446, 172364, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image, but to be honest, it really does not seem to depict any emotion, or a sense of mood.  It''s a very fine image, with great detail and wonderful lighting, but for me, it just doesn''t seem to be very interesting.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'This is a very nice image, but to be honest, it really does not seem to depict any emotion, or a sense of mood.  It''s a very fine image, with great detail and wonderful lighting, but for me, it just doesn''t seem to be very interesting.  <5>', '2005-05-02 11:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352450, 171486, 34868, '<td valign="top">Very well done, I like B&amp;W so this hae a leg up to start with. Strong image I can only give it a 10.</td>', 'Very well done, I like B&W so this hae a leg up to start with. Strong image I can only give it a 10.', '2005-05-02 11:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352455, 173038, 30018, '<td valign="top">Great image, with wonderful detail, and nice lighting.  However, like many of the "face shots" in this challenge, I really don''t get a sense of emotion or a mood that has been set. I try not to be influenced by titles and with this one, even the title really doesn''t seem to help me out.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Great image, with wonderful detail, and nice lighting.  However, like many of the "face shots" in this challenge, I really don''t get a sense of emotion or a mood that has been set. I try not to be influenced by titles and with this one, even the title really doesn''t seem to help me out.  <5>', '2005-05-02 11:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352457, 172939, 36299, '<td valign="top">There is an unhappy lad.  Wish it was a larger picture, it makes it hard to critique when it is so small, not that I would get any closer ;-).  Due to this, it makes a tough subject.  All around, everything else looks good, with the exception of size, sharpness and colour punch. 6.</td>', 'There is an unhappy lad.  Wish it was a larger picture, it makes it hard to critique when it is so small, not that I would get any closer ;-).  Due to this, it makes a tough subject.  All around, everything else looks good, with the exception of size, sharpness and colour punch. 6.', '2005-05-02 11:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1352464, 171918, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph, with interesting lighting.  Looks very similiar to the new Victorias Secert ads.  Almost the same exact lighting technique.  Most of the images in this challenge that attempt to capture an emotion or set a mood, have failed.  This one is nice.  I like the very dark mysterious shadows, and the body language says a lot about the mood.  Very nicely done.  Good luck   &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Nice photograph, with interesting lighting.  Looks very similiar to the new Victorias Secert ads.  Almost the same exact lighting technique.  Most of the images in this challenge that attempt to capture an emotion or set a mood, have failed.  This one is nice.  I like the very dark mysterious shadows, and the body language says a lot about the mood.  Very nicely done.  Good luck   <6>', '2005-05-02 11:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
