(1352625, 172846, 34247, '<td valign="top">The first thing that hit me here is the patterning on the scarf, and I think it''s a distraction factor. I also feel there''s too much of the face obscured by the veil, and that a half split, showing more of one eye (clearly) would be very effective. I do like the overall effort, though and am rating a 6, and I feel this could be higher very easily.</td>', 'The first thing that hit me here is the patterning on the scarf, and I think it''s a distraction factor. I also feel there''s too much of the face obscured by the veil, and that a half split, showing more of one eye (clearly) would be very effective. I do like the overall effort, though and am rating a 6, and I feel this could be higher very easily.', '2005-05-02 13:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
