(1352708, 172381, 20168, '<td valign="top">Great sense of mood here!  I too entered a shot with warmth, lighting, and have been commented "does not fit the challenge", or "what mood is this supposed to convey?"  Ignore such comments and enjoy the radiance you''ve captured in this lovely setting.  My only techie crit is the plate area of the photo is a bit dim.  Perhaps some dodge/burn to this area to lighten, to spread the glow across the setting?  All the best.</td>', 'Great sense of mood here!  I too entered a shot with warmth, lighting, and have been commented "does not fit the challenge", or "what mood is this supposed to convey?"  Ignore such comments and enjoy the radiance you''ve captured in this lovely setting.  My only techie crit is the plate area of the photo is a bit dim.  Perhaps some dodge/burn to this area to lighten, to spread the glow across the setting?  All the best.', '2005-05-02 13:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
