(1352721, 171048, 20168, '<td valign="top">A beauty!  I hope the DPC voters welcome this out of the box entry.  I can hear the literalists commenting, "statues don''t have emotions!"  Ignore those voices and enjoy the quiet contemplative mood you''ve captured here.  All the best.</td>', 'A beauty!  I hope the DPC voters welcome this out of the box entry.  I can hear the literalists commenting, "statues don''t have emotions!"  Ignore those voices and enjoy the quiet contemplative mood you''ve captured here.  All the best.', '2005-05-02 13:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
