(1354290, 172968, 35513, '<td valign="top">The background of this shot is gorgeous.  I love the lines in this picture.  It''s a wonderful model, the lighting is fabulous, and this photo really strikes me. 10!!</td>', 'The background of this shot is gorgeous.  I love the lines in this picture.  It''s a wonderful model, the lighting is fabulous, and this photo really strikes me. 10!!', '2005-05-02 23:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354297, 171447, 35513, '<td valign="top">The wisps of hair really make this photo for me.  You''ve found a truly beautiful model, and I think you''ve really captured fragility...yeah...fragility (if that''s a word, but you know what I mean).  The only gripe I have is that the background is so stark white.  A beautiful shot though.  I love the positioning.</td>', 'The wisps of hair really make this photo for me.  You''ve found a truly beautiful model, and I think you''ve really captured fragility...yeah...fragility (if that''s a word, but you know what I mean).  The only gripe I have is that the background is so stark white.  A beautiful shot though.  I love the positioning.', '2005-05-02 23:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354301, 172787, 35513, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!  What a great shot of two kids goofing off.  Wonderful angle, good lighting.  I really like the black and white.  Great job leading the eye and setting up this shot.</td>', 'I love this photo!  What a great shot of two kids goofing off.  Wonderful angle, good lighting.  I really like the black and white.  Great job leading the eye and setting up this shot.', '2005-05-02 23:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354306, 171516, 35513, '<td valign="top">What beautiful eyes!!!  I wish I could give her a hug.  A great job capturing an emotion.  The yellow in the hat really offsets the dark colors of the hair and eyes.  The eyes really jump out in this picture.  I''d be curious to know what editing was done.</td>', 'What beautiful eyes!!!  I wish I could give her a hug.  A great job capturing an emotion.  The yellow in the hat really offsets the dark colors of the hair and eyes.  The eyes really jump out in this picture.  I''d be curious to know what editing was done.', '2005-05-02 23:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354307, 173046, 30669, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo &gt; 8</td>', 'Beautiful photo > 8', '2005-05-03 00:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354324, 170900, 34247, '<td valign="top">Really like the lighting and set up. The eyes grabbed me right away, and that''s what I look for in portraits. 10</td>', 'Really like the lighting and set up. The eyes grabbed me right away, and that''s what I look for in portraits. 10', '2005-05-03 00:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354329, 173066, 34247, '<td valign="top">It''s a happy face allright...but the big question is about whether or not we (humans) truly know what other animals feel despite physical signals they emit. Just because they show tears doesn''t mean they''re said, etc, etc, etc. But I digress, this is a very nice shot and I''ll do it a 10.</td>', 'It''s a happy face allright...but the big question is about whether or not we (humans) truly know what other animals feel despite physical signals they emit. Just because they show tears doesn''t mean they''re said, etc, etc, etc. But I digress, this is a very nice shot and I''ll do it a 10.', '2005-05-03 00:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354335, 171447, 34247, '<td valign="top">Lovely pose and the hair strands are well placed. the lighting is a bit abrupt, imho, particularly around the left cheek. but i like this enough to rate 10, one of five in the challenge</td>', 'Lovely pose and the hair strands are well placed. the lighting is a bit abrupt, imho, particularly around the left cheek. but i like this enough to rate 10, one of five in the challenge', '2005-05-03 00:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354336, 173058, 34247, '<td valign="top">brilliant eyes, and a personal pick to ribbon. 10</td>', 'brilliant eyes, and a personal pick to ribbon. 10', '2005-05-03 00:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354345, 172706, 34247, '<td valign="top">evocative piece, with the pose and the color tones. sight vignet in upper right and left corners are very small flaws here. and were it not for the high contrasty wall, i''d give this a 10. but a 9 for an effort that I feel exceeded 95 percent of the shots entered in the challenge.</td>', 'evocative piece, with the pose and the color tones. sight vignet in upper right and left corners are very small flaws here. and were it not for the high contrasty wall, i''d give this a 10. but a 9 for an effort that I feel exceeded 95 percent of the shots entered in the challenge.', '2005-05-03 00:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354364, 171851, 34247, '<td valign="top">I admire this photo very much. The textures on the walls are gritty, and the foreground status is very nicely placed in the composition. This is one of my 9s, and I know this is being picky (it''s hard to be picky with this shot) but I''d rate this a 10 had the border been simpler. in my humble feelings, this border took away from the awesome shot. sorry.</td>', 'I admire this photo very much. The textures on the walls are gritty, and the foreground status is very nicely placed in the composition. This is one of my 9s, and I know this is being picky (it''s hard to be picky with this shot) but I''d rate this a 10 had the border been simpler. in my humble feelings, this border took away from the awesome shot. sorry.', '2005-05-03 00:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354398, 171965, 20018, '<td valign="top">really simple and clean composition...I wish the sky were a little bluer maybe could be dodged and the face a little sharper but a really nice capture</td>', 'really simple and clean composition...I wish the sky were a little bluer maybe could be dodged and the face a little sharper but a really nice capture', '2005-05-03 00:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
