(1354739, 171248, 27735, '<td valign="top">Great expression...it would be nice if both eyes were in focus.</td>', 'Great expression...it would be nice if both eyes were in focus.', '2005-05-03 02:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354742, 172909, 27735, '<td valign="top">Excellent color in the bubbles. I''ve never seen a shot like this.</td>', 'Excellent color in the bubbles. I''ve never seen a shot like this.', '2005-05-03 02:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354743, 173020, 36299, '<td valign="top">Very pleasant smile.  A bit more focus on the face and colour adjust on the dress, it is a tad bright, plus the light trapped in the eyes works here, due to the dark eyes, but would not of been needed if her face was better lit and in focus. 7.</td>', 'Very pleasant smile.  A bit more focus on the face and colour adjust on the dress, it is a tad bright, plus the light trapped in the eyes works here, due to the dark eyes, but would not of been needed if her face was better lit and in focus. 7.', '2005-05-03 02:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354746, 172679, 27735, '<td valign="top">Was this shot with a polarizer? Excellent action shot. It looks like it is right out of a car commercial. 10</td>', 'Was this shot with a polarizer? Excellent action shot. It looks like it is right out of a car commercial. 10', '2005-05-03 02:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354748, 172929, 27735, '<td valign="top">Very sharp!</td>', 'Very sharp!', '2005-05-03 02:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354749, 172866, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice tones. I think your choice of lighting is interesting but a bit strong over on the right side of the photo. Have you experimented with changing the direction and the intensity? I''m thinking perhaps reducing the intensity and adding a 2nd light or reflector from the left-rear to add a bit of counter illumination. <br/> <br/>As for the pose, hey, whatever does it for you, big guy. :P</td>', 'Nice tones. I think your choice of lighting is interesting but a bit strong over on the right side of the photo. Have you experimented with changing the direction and the intensity? I''m thinking perhaps reducing the intensity and adding a 2nd light or reflector from the left-rear to add a bit of counter illumination.  As for the pose, hey, whatever does it for you, big guy. :P', '2005-05-03 02:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354752, 172554, 36299, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Not sure if serinity is a mood or an emotion?  But, the picture is very peacful and inviting.  A place i would love to escape to.  Only other thing I am drawn to the white spot in the upper left hand corner, would be nicer, to me, if it was not there. 7.</td>', 'Nice.  Not sure if serinity is a mood or an emotion?  But, the picture is very peacful and inviting.  A place i would love to escape to.  Only other thing I am drawn to the white spot in the upper left hand corner, would be nicer, to me, if it was not there. 7.', '2005-05-03 02:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354755, 172508, 22479, '<td valign="top">The addition of the umbrella was a nice touch - adds contrast to one of the focal points of your composition.</td>', 'The addition of the umbrella was a nice touch - adds contrast to one of the focal points of your composition.', '2005-05-03 02:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
