(1354838, 172543, 93, '<td valign="top">A little more work in levels might have helped here.. the blow-out on the shirt sleeve is too distracting for me.  I like the atypical composition though, although your focus seems a little too frontal (the corner of the couch cushion is in more focus than the girl''s face and eyes, which should be the focal point IMO)</td>', 'A little more work in levels might have helped here.. the blow-out on the shirt sleeve is too distracting for me.  I like the atypical composition though, although your focus seems a little too frontal (the corner of the couch cushion is in more focus than the girl''s face and eyes, which should be the focal point IMO)', '2005-05-03 02:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
