(1354846, 172736, 93, '<td valign="top">Personally, the whole idea of this challenge was to show a mood *from* a subject, not try and pull a mood from me.. (which ever good photograph should do anyway).  Your post-processing is very moody, sure, but I just don''t buy it as meeting the challenge to my satisfaction.</td>', 'Personally, the whole idea of this challenge was to show a mood *from* a subject, not try and pull a mood from me.. (which ever good photograph should do anyway).  Your post-processing is very moody, sure, but I just don''t buy it as meeting the challenge to my satisfaction.', '2005-05-03 03:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
