(1354983, 172468, 27482, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Love his expression, really makes this photo work and great lighting too.  Hope your model doesn´t take this the wrong way but that psychotic expression makes me wish he doesn´t have to treat me someday, I mean this as a compliment as it´s great acting on his behalf.<br/> <br/>(on a nitpicking side note, did you misspell the title, shouldn´t it be "It´s alive"?)</td>', 'LOL!  Love his expression, really makes this photo work and great lighting too.  Hope your model doesn´t take this the wrong way but that psychotic expression makes me wish he doesn´t have to treat me someday, I mean this as a compliment as it´s great acting on his behalf. (on a nitpicking side note, did you misspell the title, shouldn´t it be "It´s alive"?)', '2005-05-03 06:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354987, 170900, 27482, '<td valign="top">I find this photo a little bit disturbing if I may be honest, it´s very powerful and I don´t really "like" it in the normal sense but I gave it a very high score due to the fact that it affects me.  Wouldn´t be surprised to see this end up close to the top or even on top.  I especially like the lighting and the composition.</td>', 'I find this photo a little bit disturbing if I may be honest, it´s very powerful and I don´t really "like" it in the normal sense but I gave it a very high score due to the fact that it affects me.  Wouldn´t be surprised to see this end up close to the top or even on top.  I especially like the lighting and the composition.', '2005-05-03 06:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354991, 172931, 8643, '<td valign="top">This is a very moving image - I love the dark brooding feeling, the softness of the water against the hardness of the rocks and the shades of blue and pink work very well.  Well composed. 9</td>', 'This is a very moving image - I love the dark brooding feeling, the softness of the water against the hardness of the rocks and the shades of blue and pink work very well.  Well composed. 9', '2005-05-03 07:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354992, 172974, 8643, '<td valign="top">Lovely expressions - would habe been even better with a less intrusive background but at least that is out of focus.</td>', 'Lovely expressions - would habe been even better with a less intrusive background but at least that is out of focus.', '2005-05-03 07:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1354995, 172608, 8643, '<td valign="top">This is really very clever - took me a while to work out whether the hand was reflected or not.  An interesting study.  Maybe cloning out the top right "stuff" would improve but it is a small matter. 8</td>', 'This is really very clever - took me a while to work out whether the hand was reflected or not.  An interesting study.  Maybe cloning out the top right "stuff" would improve but it is a small matter. 8', '2005-05-03 07:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
