(1356062, 172517, 35804, '<td valign="top">Another "sadness" picture that isn''t all that "sad". This is a really cool picture, but I really don''t see "sad"...silly...goofy...pouty...yes. The blue hue and what look like swimming goggles make this seem very aquatic to me. Sadness and sorrow are really hard emotions to "fake" ...they seem to be emotions that must rise from the pits of our souls to appear genuine.</td>', 'Another "sadness" picture that isn''t all that "sad". This is a really cool picture, but I really don''t see "sad"...silly...goofy...pouty...yes. The blue hue and what look like swimming goggles make this seem very aquatic to me. Sadness and sorrow are really hard emotions to "fake" ...they seem to be emotions that must rise from the pits of our souls to appear genuine.', '2005-05-03 16:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356104, 171851, 34659, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo - nice work.  I really like the inner box focus/outer box out of focus effect.  I''m not sure how well it fits the theme, but otherwise excellent job.  I like the colors, the clarity, and the ominous air it has about it.  (8)</td>', 'Stunning photo - nice work.  I really like the inner box focus/outer box out of focus effect.  I''m not sure how well it fits the theme, but otherwise excellent job.  I like the colors, the clarity, and the ominous air it has about it.  (8)', '2005-05-03 17:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356107, 172514, 4226, '<td valign="top">doesn''t look like jumping, but may be standing somewhere.. looking at the two legs, I doubt a jump-action here ...<br/>I would like to see more light on the face and a little sharpness as you can possibly use faster shutter during day conditions... 5</td>', 'doesn''t look like jumping, but may be standing somewhere.. looking at the two legs, I doubt a jump-action here ...I would like to see more light on the face and a little sharpness as you can possibly use faster shutter during day conditions... 5', '2005-05-03 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
