(1356113, 173061, 34659, '<td valign="top">Fantastic action shot!!  Well done!  I''d have scored it much higher if you hadn''t included the red border.  I like the soft edge effect, but the border is really distracting. (8)</td>', 'Fantastic action shot!!  Well done!  I''d have scored it much higher if you hadn''t included the red border.  I like the soft edge effect, but the border is really distracting. (8)', '2005-05-03 17:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
