(1356117, 173028, 93, '<td valign="top">IMO, the challenge was meant to give you a chance to evoke a mood from a subject, not induce a mood in the viewer.  This, to me, does the latter (or tries to).  That''s not to take away from a great abstract photograph, but it just doesn''t work this time.</td>', 'IMO, the challenge was meant to give you a chance to evoke a mood from a subject, not induce a mood in the viewer.  This, to me, does the latter (or tries to).  That''s not to take away from a great abstract photograph, but it just doesn''t work this time.', '2005-05-03 17:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356118, 172525, 34659, '<td valign="top">Image is grainy.  It''s a great close-up otherwise, but it''s noise &amp; lack of clarity are distractions.  (5)</td>', 'Image is grainy.  It''s a great close-up otherwise, but it''s noise & lack of clarity are distractions.  (5)', '2005-05-03 17:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356121, 172324, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think this is the best shot I''ve ever seen of the City of Brotherly Love''s sculpture!  Excellent work - the lighting is supurb! (9)</td>', 'I think this is the best shot I''ve ever seen of the City of Brotherly Love''s sculpture!  Excellent work - the lighting is supurb! (9)', '2005-05-03 17:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356122, 173066, 34659, '<td valign="top">At first, I thought "great...  another insect shot", but upon closer examination it really does look like he''s smiling!  LOL  Exceptional clarity &amp; content.  Talk about an eye for detail!  VERY well done!  (9)</td>', 'At first, I thought "great...  another insect shot", but upon closer examination it really does look like he''s smiling!  LOL  Exceptional clarity & content.  Talk about an eye for detail!  VERY well done!  (9)', '2005-05-03 17:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356125, 172417, 93, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing, the english language.  One word can evoke 4 different expressions in one challenge, and 5 photographs.   However, for me, pensive means a hesitant discomfort or fear.. as in a child''s first encounter with petting a tame snake.. or similar circumstance.  The mood I am feeling from this subject is one of contemplative anger, or frustration. More along the lines of angst, if you will.   However, this is merely something for you as a photographer to consider for the future, and doesn''t affect my scoring.<br/> <br/>Now to what does..   I like the lighting, but the shadow on the eye is a little to strong.  Perhaps were there less shadow there, the "frustration/anger" that I am getting wouldn''t be so prominent.  The furrowed brow as well, is more angry than hesitant or fearful, and this is made more prominent by the lighting also.    The photo also seems a little over-sharpened, and pixelated.   Personally, I would have loved to have seen a more "grainy" element to this shot, but I realize that would mean disaster in a DPC challenge, so I don''t begrudge you that.  <br/> <br/>A nice portraiture overall, good blacks, a decent tonal range.  A little mre work with getting the facial expression right in this lighting would have done wonders.</td>', 'It''s amazing, the english language.  One word can evoke 4 different expressions in one challenge, and 5 photographs.   However, for me, pensive means a hesitant discomfort or fear.. as in a child''s first encounter with petting a tame snake.. or similar circumstance.  The mood I am feeling from this subject is one of contemplative anger, or frustration. More along the lines of angst, if you will.   However, this is merely something for you as a photographer to consider for the future, and doesn''t affect my scoring. Now to what does..   I like the lighting, but the shadow on the eye is a little to strong.  Perhaps were there less shadow there, the "frustration/anger" that I am getting wouldn''t be so prominent.  The furrowed brow as well, is more angry than hesitant or fearful, and this is made more prominent by the lighting also.    The photo also seems a little over-sharpened, and pixelated.   Personally, I would have loved to have seen a more "grainy" element to this shot, but I realize that would mean disaster in a DPC challenge, so I don''t begrudge you that.   A nice portraiture overall, good blacks, a decent tonal range.  A little mre work with getting the facial expression right in this lighting would have done wonders.', '2005-05-03 17:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356127, 172982, 34659, '<td valign="top">Amazing staging!  WOW what that must have felt like!  LOL  Nice job, although I feel like the image is upside down.  I (personally) think it would exhibit more quickly and clearly if the face were "right side up". (7)</td>', 'Amazing staging!  WOW what that must have felt like!  LOL  Nice job, although I feel like the image is upside down.  I (personally) think it would exhibit more quickly and clearly if the face were "right side up". (7)', '2005-05-03 17:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356128, 173028, 34659, '<td valign="top">I know what you''ve been doing...  ;-)  LOL<br/> <br/>Fantastic surreal representation. (8)</td>', 'I know what you''ve been doing...  ;-)  LOL Fantastic surreal representation. (8)', '2005-05-03 17:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356130, 172508, 93, '<td valign="top">A little too much desaturation/saturation work here ruins the effect for me.  The colors in her skin tones (especially the foot), are harsh and unnatural.. the bright flowers are anti-sorrowful, and the model almost looks like she''s got a bit of a smile.   Put these all together, and the only sorrow I feel from the subject is the fact that she has to lug around that umbrella.</td>', 'A little too much desaturation/saturation work here ruins the effect for me.  The colors in her skin tones (especially the foot), are harsh and unnatural.. the bright flowers are anti-sorrowful, and the model almost looks like she''s got a bit of a smile.   Put these all together, and the only sorrow I feel from the subject is the fact that she has to lug around that umbrella.', '2005-05-03 17:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356131, 172754, 34459, '<td valign="top">I know how he feels ! Definitely captures the mood - maybe too bright through the window, distracts a bit.</td>', 'I know how he feels ! Definitely captures the mood - maybe too bright through the window, distracts a bit.', '2005-05-03 17:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356134, 172373, 93, '<td valign="top">I''m looking more for moods from the subject in the photo itself.. not in the mood the photographer is trying to get the viewer to feel..   and, to be honest, a raging waterfall, as a subject, is one of the least tranquil things I can think of.</td>', 'I''m looking more for moods from the subject in the photo itself.. not in the mood the photographer is trying to get the viewer to feel..   and, to be honest, a raging waterfall, as a subject, is one of the least tranquil things I can think of.', '2005-05-03 17:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356137, 172695, 34459, '<td valign="top">nicely framed but focus not quite right ?</td>', 'nicely framed but focus not quite right ?', '2005-05-03 17:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356138, 172836, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great use of reflection...  (7)</td>', 'Great use of reflection...  (7)', '2005-05-03 17:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356143, 172525, 93, '<td valign="top">This is quite a nice "old-time" photograph, and the expression is wonderful.  I applaud your courage in submitting a photograph of this type into the DPC "NeatImage wins Ribbons!" world.  The subtle intensity in this photo plays well with your title, but it would work just as well with an "untitled", as the mood shines through, and one can''t help but imagine what this man is thinking.   Great job.. one of the better photos I''ve seen.  Good luck staying out of the 4s.</td>', 'This is quite a nice "old-time" photograph, and the expression is wonderful.  I applaud your courage in submitting a photograph of this type into the DPC "NeatImage wins Ribbons!" world.  The subtle intensity in this photo plays well with your title, but it would work just as well with an "untitled", as the mood shines through, and one can''t help but imagine what this man is thinking.   Great job.. one of the better photos I''ve seen.  Good luck staying out of the 4s.', '2005-05-03 17:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356145, 171780, 34659, '<td valign="top">Stunningly beautiful use of the water reflection.  Nice work!  I feel the mood that this piece represents - despite the fact that no "faces" are present. (9)</td>', 'Stunningly beautiful use of the water reflection.  Nice work!  I feel the mood that this piece represents - despite the fact that no "faces" are present. (9)', '2005-05-03 17:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356146, 173050, 35357, '<td valign="top">A quality photo.  I like the blue tone and the reflective surface.  I gotta get myself one of those reflective surfaces!  Very nicely lit, a pro job.</td>', 'A quality photo.  I like the blue tone and the reflective surface.  I gotta get myself one of those reflective surfaces!  Very nicely lit, a pro job.', '2005-05-03 17:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356148, 170880, 34659, '<td valign="top">I haven''t been going for the animal shots in the Mood category, but a few stand out - this is one of them.  It really appears as though the lizard is amazingly content &amp; happy sleeping there in the sun on the rock.  Nice capture.  (7)</td>', 'I haven''t been going for the animal shots in the Mood category, but a few stand out - this is one of them.  It really appears as though the lizard is amazingly content & happy sleeping there in the sun on the rock.  Nice capture.  (7)', '2005-05-03 17:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356150, 172787, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like this pose, I''m going to have to try it with my girls if they can hold still long enough.</td>', 'I like this pose, I''m going to have to try it with my girls if they can hold still long enough.', '2005-05-03 17:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356151, 173055, 93, '<td valign="top">A really nice sunset photograph.. but to my thoughts, it is in the wrong challenge.  I''m not looking to have *my* mood affected by an image in this challenge, but to see how photographers capture the moods of their subjects.  You have two subjects here, and neither one of them are emoting any kind of mood to me.  I may feel something, but I don''t see your subjects feeling anything, and this is where I think the challenge was trying to get to.  Having the human subject in some other, emotive, pose.. would have been much, much stronger.</td>', 'A really nice sunset photograph.. but to my thoughts, it is in the wrong challenge.  I''m not looking to have *my* mood affected by an image in this challenge, but to see how photographers capture the moods of their subjects.  You have two subjects here, and neither one of them are emoting any kind of mood to me.  I may feel something, but I don''t see your subjects feeling anything, and this is where I think the challenge was trying to get to.  Having the human subject in some other, emotive, pose.. would have been much, much stronger.', '2005-05-03 17:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356156, 171844, 34459, '<td valign="top">like the square crop</td>', 'like the square crop', '2005-05-03 17:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356158, 172759, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think I know what you were going for, but it just doesn''t work (in my humble opinion).  The added effects of graininess to apparently preserve anonymity are too contrived.  Don''t get me wrong, I like the finger gesture and the fact that the model covered his/her face, but it lost its appeal due to the added effects.  Sorry (4).</td>', 'I think I know what you were going for, but it just doesn''t work (in my humble opinion).  The added effects of graininess to apparently preserve anonymity are too contrived.  Don''t get me wrong, I like the finger gesture and the fact that the model covered his/her face, but it lost its appeal due to the added effects.  Sorry (4).', '2005-05-03 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356159, 172866, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting a lot.  The subject and title make me a little uncomfortable, so I suppose the chicks will like it. ;-)</td>', 'I like the lighting a lot.  The subject and title make me a little uncomfortable, so I suppose the chicks will like it. ;-)', '2005-05-03 17:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356160, 172940, 34659, '<td valign="top">Clever title...</td>', 'Clever title...', '2005-05-03 17:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356166, 171885, 34659, '<td valign="top">WHAT IS THAT???  LOL  I have to give you points for originality and composition.  It''s well photographed and uses shadows well.  But, what the **** is that?  LOL  (It reminds me of the old SNL comedy sketch with Steve Martin...)  (7)</td>', 'WHAT IS THAT???  LOL  I have to give you points for originality and composition.  It''s well photographed and uses shadows well.  But, what the **** is that?  LOL  (It reminds me of the old SNL comedy sketch with Steve Martin...)  (7)', '2005-05-03 17:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356167, 172891, 34459, '<td valign="top">awww ! he looks so sad !   Nice tight crop.</td>', 'awww ! he looks so sad !   Nice tight crop.', '2005-05-03 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356171, 171780, 35357, '<td valign="top">Dark, blue, &amp; calm.  Very nice.</td>', 'Dark, blue, & calm.  Very nice.', '2005-05-03 17:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356172, 172885, 34459, '<td valign="top">Wow! Very bright colour. Like the way the tulips lead your eye to the statue.</td>', 'Wow! Very bright colour. Like the way the tulips lead your eye to the statue.', '2005-05-03 17:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356177, 173038, 34459, '<td valign="top">Nice expression, but I would''ve liked his eyes to be sharper focus rather than his eyebrows.</td>', 'Nice expression, but I would''ve liked his eyes to be sharper focus rather than his eyebrows.', '2005-05-03 17:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356179, 172899, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, nice silhouette. I''d have prefered the horse higher or lower in the frame. Colours could do with being a bit more vibrant, with help from PS.</td>', 'Lovely shot, nice silhouette. I''d have prefered the horse higher or lower in the frame. Colours could do with being a bit more vibrant, with help from PS.', '2005-05-03 17:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356181, 172586, 35357, '<td valign="top">Nice composition &amp; cute pose.  It looks grainy to me though.  I''d also suggest moving the subject away from the background or find another way to avoid the shadow.</td>', 'Nice composition & cute pose.  It looks grainy to me though.  I''d also suggest moving the subject away from the background or find another way to avoid the shadow.', '2005-05-03 17:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356182, 172746, 34659, '<td valign="top">Too posed &amp; superficial...  Sorry (5).</td>', 'Too posed & superficial...  Sorry (5).', '2005-05-03 17:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356183, 173032, 8522, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t create a mood for me, and I don''t see anxiety.</td>', 'Doesn''t create a mood for me, and I don''t see anxiety.', '2005-05-03 17:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356184, 171514, 34459, '<td valign="top">beautiful colour but I find the out of focus foreground a bit distracting</td>', 'beautiful colour but I find the out of focus foreground a bit distracting', '2005-05-03 17:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356185, 171918, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice classic shot. Great lighting.</td>', 'Very nice classic shot. Great lighting.', '2005-05-03 17:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356188, 172401, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice shot with a title that really doesn''t fit. Foliage really makes this shot. Good shutter speed. Well composed.</td>', 'Nice shot with a title that really doesn''t fit. Foliage really makes this shot. Good shutter speed. Well composed.', '2005-05-03 17:59:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1356190, 171965, 34659, '<td valign="top">I want to see the model''s mouth...  The eyes are wonderfully expressive, but there is a white line (perhaps hair?) over the right eye and I think adding more of the pic would bring more emotion to the shot. (6)</td>', 'I want to see the model''s mouth...  The eyes are wonderfully expressive, but there is a white line (perhaps hair?) over the right eye and I think adding more of the pic would bring more emotion to the shot. (6)', '2005-05-03 17:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356192, 172536, 35357, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Looks like fun!  I think the hidden bonus is that the fence makes a nifty transition to background.  I''m going to have to remember that.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Looks like fun!  I think the hidden bonus is that the fence makes a nifty transition to background.  I''m going to have to remember that.  Good job.', '2005-05-03 17:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356195, 172960, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not sure what mood you''re trying to create here. Wonky horizon doesn''t work. Looks too much like a snapshot with a zoom blur added in PS.</td>', 'Not sure what mood you''re trying to create here. Wonky horizon doesn''t work. Looks too much like a snapshot with a zoom blur added in PS.', '2005-05-03 18:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356197, 171844, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting. Good model. Not sure about the composition and the square crop.</td>', 'Very nice lighting. Good model. Not sure about the composition and the square crop.', '2005-05-03 18:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356202, 172735, 35357, '<td valign="top">Nice candid.  I like the setting and placement of the couple.  It looks like there was some manual smudging on the tree around the girl &amp; other parts of the background, rather than depth of field, odd.</td>', 'Nice candid.  I like the setting and placement of the couple.  It looks like there was some manual smudging on the tree around the girl & other parts of the background, rather than depth of field, odd.', '2005-05-03 18:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356203, 171048, 34659, '<td valign="top">The black dots on the statue are distracting...  It''s a nice photo of a statue, but it doesn''t really convey purety or holiness or motherly love because of the black dots.  (6)</td>', 'The black dots on the statue are distracting...  It''s a nice photo of a statue, but it doesn''t really convey purety or holiness or motherly love because of the black dots.  (6)', '2005-05-03 18:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356204, 171516, 36060, '<td valign="top">Great expression, fits the challenge well,....10</td>', 'Great expression, fits the challenge well,....10', '2005-05-03 18:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356205, 171447, 36060, '<td valign="top">Great expression, wonderful pose....10</td>', 'Great expression, wonderful pose....10', '2005-05-03 18:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356206, 172482, 34659, '<td valign="top">Too posed...  There''s obviously something behind the eyes, but it appears so posed, that the emotion/mood is lost.  (6)</td>', 'Too posed...  There''s obviously something behind the eyes, but it appears so posed, that the emotion/mood is lost.  (6)', '2005-05-03 18:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356207, 173066, 34459, '<td valign="top">Fantastic ! Best pic I''ve seen so far, great colour &amp; focus on the head and it really does capture a mood.</td>', 'Fantastic ! Best pic I''ve seen so far, great colour & focus on the head and it really does capture a mood.', '2005-05-03 18:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356208, 172968, 36060, '<td valign="top">Great expression, wonderful pose, I like it a lot.</td>', 'Great expression, wonderful pose, I like it a lot.', '2005-05-03 18:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356210, 171486, 34659, '<td valign="top">Too posed &amp; too close...  (In my humble opinion.)  I like the subject &amp; subject matter, it''s just not presented as effectively as it could be - i.e., if it were taken more candidly.  (6)</td>', 'Too posed & too close...  (In my humble opinion.)  I like the subject & subject matter, it''s just not presented as effectively as it could be - i.e., if it were taken more candidly.  (6)', '2005-05-03 18:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356213, 172972, 93, '<td valign="top">I just don''t feel "depression" from these trees.. it looks like natural deadfall, and not some kind of depressing situation..  and for me, the challenge is about showing moods from your subjects, not evoking moods from the viewer.</td>', 'I just don''t feel "depression" from these trees.. it looks like natural deadfall, and not some kind of depressing situation..  and for me, the challenge is about showing moods from your subjects, not evoking moods from the viewer.', '2005-05-03 18:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356214, 172931, 34459, '<td valign="top">at last a pic that meets the challenge exactly !</td>', 'at last a pic that meets the challenge exactly !', '2005-05-03 18:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356217, 172845, 34659, '<td valign="top">great candid capture...</td>', 'great candid capture...', '2005-05-03 18:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356218, 172864, 34659, '<td valign="top">Too posed...  It doesn''t look candid or real. (5)</td>', 'Too posed...  It doesn''t look candid or real. (5)', '2005-05-03 18:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356219, 172789, 93, '<td valign="top">A good showing of a mood, however, the photograph suffers from a few elements. <br/>1. It is rather noisy<br/>2. Color is flat and uninspiring<br/>3. focus is a touch soft in the eyes and upper facial area.<br/>4. Contrast seems harsher than it is because of the flat color.<br/> <br/></td>', 'A good showing of a mood, however, the photograph suffers from a few elements. 1. It is rather noisy2. Color is flat and uninspiring3. focus is a touch soft in the eyes and upper facial area.4. Contrast seems harsher than it is because of the flat color. ', '2005-05-03 18:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356224, 171926, 93, '<td valign="top">A nicely captured photograph of "joy".  A little blown out in the highlights, could have used a stop or two lower, and then fixed with levels, or used more diffuse light.   Colors also seem muted.</td>', 'A nicely captured photograph of "joy".  A little blown out in the highlights, could have used a stop or two lower, and then fixed with levels, or used more diffuse light.   Colors also seem muted.', '2005-05-03 18:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356226, 172930, 93, '<td valign="top">The focal point of this photograph is too mired in shadows to be entirely useful.  The sepia is also a little too strong,  and doesn''t mesh with the mood that is trying to be displayed, in my opinion.</td>', 'The focal point of this photograph is too mired in shadows to be entirely useful.  The sepia is also a little too strong,  and doesn''t mesh with the mood that is trying to be displayed, in my opinion.', '2005-05-03 18:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356230, 172812, 34659, '<td valign="top">Wow...  Did this one take me by surprise!  Nicely done - I''m not a big fan of guns, but I think you definitely got your point across - and I even like it.  :-)  Actually, it''s a very good macro photo.  Hats off to you for not only being original, but for pulling it off too!   (9)</td>', 'Wow...  Did this one take me by surprise!  Nicely done - I''m not a big fan of guns, but I think you definitely got your point across - and I even like it.  :-)  Actually, it''s a very good macro photo.  Hats off to you for not only being original, but for pulling it off too!   (9)', '2005-05-03 18:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356231, 173004, 34459, '<td valign="top">nicely cropped, perfect focus. I like this one, meets the challenge very well.</td>', 'nicely cropped, perfect focus. I like this one, meets the challenge very well.', '2005-05-03 18:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356233, 172968, 34659, '<td valign="top">Although obviously posed, this portrays an enormous amount of emotion and you were able to capture that spirit.  Very well done. (9)</td>', 'Although obviously posed, this portrays an enormous amount of emotion and you were able to capture that spirit.  Very well done. (9)', '2005-05-03 18:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356235, 172771, 93, '<td valign="top">Owls are certainly "moody" birds, and these ones do emote very well.  A nice capture.  It''s a bit busy, but wildlife shooting isn''t exactly set up for being able to much about that :)</td>', 'Owls are certainly "moody" birds, and these ones do emote very well.  A nice capture.  It''s a bit busy, but wildlife shooting isn''t exactly set up for being able to much about that :)', '2005-05-03 18:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356237, 172974, 93, '<td valign="top">Cute kid, and great expressions.  I''m not entirely convinced with the cropping you''ve done however, as it seems to have killed some of the dynamic.  This begs for a portrait orientation.</td>', 'Cute kid, and great expressions.  I''m not entirely convinced with the cropping you''ve done however, as it seems to have killed some of the dynamic.  This begs for a portrait orientation.', '2005-05-03 18:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356239, 172554, 34459, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the bridge leads the eye to the centre, but I find the colours too saturated.</td>', 'I like the composition, the bridge leads the eye to the centre, but I find the colours too saturated.', '2005-05-03 18:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356240, 170900, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very ingenious &amp; well done...  The offset subject and b/w shadows really emphasize the feeling. (9)</td>', 'Very ingenious & well done...  The offset subject and b/w shadows really emphasize the feeling. (9)', '2005-05-03 18:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356241, 172679, 93, '<td valign="top">Is the car having fun here?  I''d have liked to have seen a shot of the car closer up, with the driver preferrably in the photo showing an expression.</td>', 'Is the car having fun here?  I''d have liked to have seen a shot of the car closer up, with the driver preferrably in the photo showing an expression.', '2005-05-03 18:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356245, 172569, 34459, '<td valign="top">Would have been nicer if her face was in sharper focus.</td>', 'Would have been nicer if her face was in sharper focus.', '2005-05-03 18:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356246, 170803, 93, '<td valign="top">He does look peaceful.  Seems to be a little bit of over-saturation here, and there are odd burn marks in the sky..   overall, while it''s a great composition, the colors, contrast, saturation, and other elements, don''t add up.</td>', 'He does look peaceful.  Seems to be a little bit of over-saturation here, and there are odd burn marks in the sky..   overall, while it''s a great composition, the colors, contrast, saturation, and other elements, don''t add up.', '2005-05-03 18:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356249, 172412, 4411, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Looks like he was on the losing side? Never mind, there''s always the next game.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Looks like he was on the losing side? Never mind, there''s always the next game.', '2005-05-03 18:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356250, 172843, 34459, '<td valign="top">very nicely done, nice group of figures, fantastic sunset, very good.</td>', 'very nicely done, nice group of figures, fantastic sunset, very good.', '2005-05-03 18:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356251, 172735, 93, '<td valign="top">This photo is far too smooth looking, destroying it''s natural feel, and the couple are just too far out of being a focal point for them to be interesting, or integral to the shot.  Too much going on here.</td>', 'This photo is far too smooth looking, destroying it''s natural feel, and the couple are just too far out of being a focal point for them to be interesting, or integral to the shot.  Too much going on here.', '2005-05-03 18:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356258, 173022, 93, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, but focus is off.  This has the feel of a long-zoom being hand held with too slow a sutter speed.   The desat is also a little off-putting in this case.  I think keeping a little more green in the trees might have helped?</td>', 'Cute shot, but focus is off.  This has the feel of a long-zoom being hand held with too slow a sutter speed.   The desat is also a little off-putting in this case.  I think keeping a little more green in the trees might have helped?', '2005-05-03 18:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356259, 172849, 34459, '<td valign="top">Poor soul ! One of the better shots of children in this challenge, nice.</td>', 'Poor soul ! One of the better shots of children in this challenge, nice.', '2005-05-03 18:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356261, 171542, 93, '<td valign="top">A little too over-exposed.  Needed a couple of stops lower and/or  more diffuse lighting.  A sheet over the window,  for example.   Also, IMO, this has nothing to do with showing a subject''s mood.</td>', 'A little too over-exposed.  Needed a couple of stops lower and/or  more diffuse lighting.  A sheet over the window,  for example.   Also, IMO, this has nothing to do with showing a subject''s mood.', '2005-05-03 18:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356265, 172885, 93, '<td valign="top">Not sure that "creativity" is a mood..  A nice dark filter would have helped here as well, or shooting at a different time of day.  Lighting is harsh, and kind of painful for light-sensitive eyes.  It''s good to see people taking different approaches, but this one falls a little short.</td>', 'Not sure that "creativity" is a mood..  A nice dark filter would have helped here as well, or shooting at a different time of day.  Lighting is harsh, and kind of painful for light-sensitive eyes.  It''s good to see people taking different approaches, but this one falls a little short.', '2005-05-03 18:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356268, 173035, 34459, '<td valign="top">Ah, a nice change from shots of children..... Very good, spot on framing/composition. Well done.</td>', 'Ah, a nice change from shots of children..... Very good, spot on framing/composition. Well done.', '2005-05-03 18:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356269, 172741, 34659, '<td valign="top">Absolutely great shot - I just wish there was more of the cycler to see.  It seems a bit abbreviated (the way you have cropped it) - I would have scored it higher if there were more of the subject visible...  (8)</td>', 'Absolutely great shot - I just wish there was more of the cycler to see.  It seems a bit abbreviated (the way you have cropped it) - I would have scored it higher if there were more of the subject visible...  (8)', '2005-05-03 18:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356273, 171632, 34659, '<td valign="top">Wow - what a powerful image.  This really stands out in the crowd of entries.  Superbly done - nice job!  (10)  (Only the 3rd time I''ve ever given a 10...)</td>', 'Wow - what a powerful image.  This really stands out in the crowd of entries.  Superbly done - nice job!  (10)  (Only the 3rd time I''ve ever given a 10...)', '2005-05-03 18:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356275, 172072, 34659, '<td valign="top">I normally don''t like negative images and I don''t like the title, but this photo is exceptionally engaging.  You can literally see the emotion &amp; feeling of the model and I commend you on choosing a negative image for this (as I imagine the positive image is much less exceptional).  You''ve used the tools available &amp; lighting to make a stunningly beautiful statement.  Very nice work.  (10)  (Only the 4th time I''ve ever given a 10.)</td>', 'I normally don''t like negative images and I don''t like the title, but this photo is exceptionally engaging.  You can literally see the emotion & feeling of the model and I commend you on choosing a negative image for this (as I imagine the positive image is much less exceptional).  You''ve used the tools available & lighting to make a stunningly beautiful statement.  Very nice work.  (10)  (Only the 4th time I''ve ever given a 10.)', '2005-05-03 18:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356277, 172402, 34659, '<td valign="top">I must say that this certainly satisfies the category''s requirements.  I can hear him/her now...  (9)</td>', 'I must say that this certainly satisfies the category''s requirements.  I can hear him/her now...  (9)', '2005-05-03 18:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356279, 172933, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very cool reflection... (7)</td>', 'Very cool reflection... (7)', '2005-05-03 18:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356282, 171447, 36688, '<td valign="top">beautiful girl as well as a beautiful image.  I like the slightly hidden face and how she is stuck in the corner of the picture is if fearful of injury due to her fragility.  Great.</td>', 'beautiful girl as well as a beautiful image.  I like the slightly hidden face and how she is stuck in the corner of the picture is if fearful of injury due to her fragility.  Great.', '2005-05-03 18:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356283, 171540, 93, '<td valign="top">I''m looking at this challenge as being one that is trying to get a photographer to show a mood *from* his subject, not trying to evoke a mood *for* the subject from the viewer.  You''ve set out to do the latter here.  The scene may be tranquil for someone, but I don''t seen anyone actually *being* tranquil here.</td>', 'I''m looking at this challenge as being one that is trying to get a photographer to show a mood *from* his subject, not trying to evoke a mood *for* the subject from the viewer.  You''ve set out to do the latter here.  The scene may be tranquil for someone, but I don''t seen anyone actually *being* tranquil here.', '2005-05-03 18:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356287, 173016, 36688, '<td valign="top">i would have liked to see a less grainy, more sharply focused face. But a do like the cool colors and interesting shadows</td>', 'i would have liked to see a less grainy, more sharply focused face. But a do like the cool colors and interesting shadows', '2005-05-03 18:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356291, 172888, 34659, '<td valign="top">An absolutely brilliant &amp; beautiful image; however, I don''t see what it has to do with the topic of Moods, so I had to deduct accordingly.  (4)</td>', 'An absolutely brilliant & beautiful image; however, I don''t see what it has to do with the topic of Moods, so I had to deduct accordingly.  (4)', '2005-05-03 18:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356296, 172870, 93, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured your subject''s mood, but next time, perhaps capturing it with the subject in a better composition would make a stronger photograph.  There is too much unnecessary negative space here, and the object(s) in the upper corner are very distracting.  It''s a great, emotive snapshot, but DPC generally demands much more for a higher score..  however, of course, high scores on DPC aren''t exactly the end all and be all either, but I must, as a commenter, take the stance that it is what a submitter is striving for.</td>', 'You''ve captured your subject''s mood, but next time, perhaps capturing it with the subject in a better composition would make a stronger photograph.  There is too much unnecessary negative space here, and the object(s) in the upper corner are very distracting.  It''s a great, emotive snapshot, but DPC generally demands much more for a higher score..  however, of course, high scores on DPC aren''t exactly the end all and be all either, but I must, as a commenter, take the stance that it is what a submitter is striving for.', '2005-05-03 18:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356298, 171632, 36688, '<td valign="top">Really neat! Pretty powerful image of anger.  I love the darkness associated with the image and the apparent manipulation to make the eyes direct towards the face.</td>', 'Really neat! Pretty powerful image of anger.  I love the darkness associated with the image and the apparent manipulation to make the eyes direct towards the face.', '2005-05-03 18:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356302, 172834, 36688, '<td valign="top">cute, but not really anything but a snap shot.  Pretty girl nonetheless.</td>', 'cute, but not really anything but a snap shot.  Pretty girl nonetheless.', '2005-05-03 18:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356311, 172398, 36688, '<td valign="top">Dark skin and black and white photos are such a beautiful combination.  I would like to see the hands perhaps covering the face more for a better look of despair.  To me this looks more contemplative.</td>', 'Dark skin and black and white photos are such a beautiful combination.  I would like to see the hands perhaps covering the face more for a better look of despair.  To me this looks more contemplative.', '2005-05-03 18:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356313, 172746, 93, '<td valign="top">Although I suspect the dodge/burn job you''ve done here was entirely intentional,  I feel the need to tell you that I personally find it far too strong.  The halo around the head is inventive, and I kind of like that.. but the rest of it seems arbitrary and unnecessary.  With a little more forethought into levels work, time of day lighting, and bracketing, you could have achieved a much more ethereally natural effect.  Still, it''s always good to experiment, and you never learn by not doing.    <br/> <br/>Post-processing aside, I really like the composition of this piece, and your subject does seem very serene and meditative.</td>', 'Although I suspect the dodge/burn job you''ve done here was entirely intentional,  I feel the need to tell you that I personally find it far too strong.  The halo around the head is inventive, and I kind of like that.. but the rest of it seems arbitrary and unnecessary.  With a little more forethought into levels work, time of day lighting, and bracketing, you could have achieved a much more ethereally natural effect.  Still, it''s always good to experiment, and you never learn by not doing.     Post-processing aside, I really like the composition of this piece, and your subject does seem very serene and meditative.', '2005-05-03 18:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356316, 172940, 93, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t work for me.  A photo of a subject *holding* the ruined broom, and emoting "exhaustiveness" would have been much more connected to the challenge.  This just seems a little hurried and shoehorned.</td>', 'This just doesn''t work for me.  A photo of a subject *holding* the ruined broom, and emoting "exhaustiveness" would have been much more connected to the challenge.  This just seems a little hurried and shoehorned.', '2005-05-03 18:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356320, 172899, 34459, '<td valign="top">Lovely sky, nice silhouette, captured movement too. Very nice.</td>', 'Lovely sky, nice silhouette, captured movement too. Very nice.', '2005-05-03 18:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356325, 172525, 34459, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect but he''s lost the end of his nose. Well captured expression though.</td>', 'Interesting effect but he''s lost the end of his nose. Well captured expression though.', '2005-05-03 18:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356326, 171048, 93, '<td valign="top">I just don''t read any real mood or emotion from this. It seems hurried and there''s no supporting elements to really sell the expressiveness that this sculpture is capable of.</td>', 'I just don''t read any real mood or emotion from this. It seems hurried and there''s no supporting elements to really sell the expressiveness that this sculpture is capable of.', '2005-05-03 18:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356332, 172437, 34459, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, would have been better if the model was centred under the poster &amp; then shot squarely on rather than at a slight angle.</td>', 'Nice idea, would have been better if the model was centred under the poster & then shot squarely on rather than at a slight angle.', '2005-05-03 18:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356334, 172970, 93, '<td valign="top">That cat definitely looks a little perturbed.  A nice shot.  Focus is off, and there isn''t a lot of detail in the fur.  More light directly on the subject would have helped a lot, and shooting against a bright background with a dark subject is inviting trouble.</td>', 'That cat definitely looks a little perturbed.  A nice shot.  Focus is off, and there isn''t a lot of detail in the fur.  More light directly on the subject would have helped a lot, and shooting against a bright background with a dark subject is inviting trouble.', '2005-05-03 18:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356336, 172869, 93, '<td valign="top">A great candid shot of an animal enjoying life.  Those rolls in the grass must feel great to a dog.  Good detail, crisp focus where needed, good emotion.</td>', 'A great candid shot of an animal enjoying life.  Those rolls in the grass must feel great to a dog.  Good detail, crisp focus where needed, good emotion.', '2005-05-03 18:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356362, 172805, 34459, '<td valign="top">I like this - you have captured the moment of bored youngster stuck in an adult discussion. I like the way you''ve shot this low &amp; got the daisies in the foreground. Nice shot.</td>', 'I like this - you have captured the moment of bored youngster stuck in an adult discussion. I like the way you''ve shot this low & got the daisies in the foreground. Nice shot.', '2005-05-03 18:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356368, 173028, 34459, '<td valign="top">at last ! an abstract image capturing a mood. Very vibrant.</td>', 'at last ! an abstract image capturing a mood. Very vibrant.', '2005-05-03 18:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
