(1356395, 173000, 34459, '<td valign="top">great colour in the reflection and I love the ripples - almost didn''t see the bird ! Almost a shame that the other object is there (is it an otter ?) - I wonder what the shot would''ve looked like without it &amp; a fraction later when the bird had cleared the reflection of the towers but was still in the picture ? Nice try.</td>', 'great colour in the reflection and I love the ripples - almost didn''t see the bird ! Almost a shame that the other object is there (is it an otter ?) - I wonder what the shot would''ve looked like without it & a fraction later when the bird had cleared the reflection of the towers but was still in the picture ? Nice try.', '2005-05-03 18:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
