(1356724, 172569, 93, '<td valign="top">I think, had this shot been taken from the other side, that you may have gotten better lighting for her face.  It''s a nice candid portrait, but there are just too many shadows in the face, and too much detail is lost.</td>', 'I think, had this shot been taken from the other side, that you may have gotten better lighting for her face.  It''s a nice candid portrait, but there are just too many shadows in the face, and too much detail is lost.', '2005-05-03 20:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1356727, 172838, 93, '<td valign="top">Focus is a little off, and I suspect a bit of motion blur.   A slightly wider angle, and more perspective, showing the little girl, would have made this photo much better IMO.</td>', 'Focus is a little off, and I suspect a bit of motion blur.   A slightly wider angle, and more perspective, showing the little girl, would have made this photo much better IMO.', '2005-05-03 20:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
