(1358450, 173016, 22011, '<td valign="top">The point of focus appears to be on her knees, which is slightly distracting, but a nice shot..  Was this posed?  I''d be interested to know..  7</td>', 'The point of focus appears to be on her knees, which is slightly distracting, but a nice shot..  Was this posed?  I''d be interested to know..  7', '2005-05-04 07:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358467, 173032, 23458, '<td valign="top">Really like the composition and dof here - I even think the blown out window works well - add''s to the mystery associated with whatever it is she''s excitedly/anxiously waiting for. Good work!</td>', 'Really like the composition and dof here - I even think the blown out window works well - add''s to the mystery associated with whatever it is she''s excitedly/anxiously waiting for. Good work!', '2005-05-04 07:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358473, 171851, 23458, '<td valign="top">Don''t know about emotion, but this is certainly a very moody shot - so I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt, though I have to say (and I''m sure others have too) that I think the border detracts from what is otherwise an excellent composition. 7</td>', 'Don''t know about emotion, but this is certainly a very moody shot - so I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt, though I have to say (and I''m sure others have too) that I think the border detracts from what is otherwise an excellent composition. 7', '2005-05-04 07:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358480, 172554, 23458, '<td valign="top">Really great processing here. I''ve got to teach myself how to do this gaussian blur/mystical effect type thing one day... you obviously have it down pat.</td>', 'Really great processing here. I''ve got to teach myself how to do this gaussian blur/mystical effect type thing one day... you obviously have it down pat.', '2005-05-04 07:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358488, 172739, 23458, '<td valign="top">I love the expression on the guys face - great capture .... I can see it now ''Uhh...umm...dad.....you know that car you just bought me....''</td>', 'I love the expression on the guys face - great capture .... I can see it now ''Uhh...umm...dad.....you know that car you just bought me....''', '2005-05-04 07:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358496, 170900, 23458, '<td valign="top">You win... I quit :).....<br/> <br/>Fantastic shot... terrific lighting and use of negative space, in all serious, this is probably a little TOO disturbing to win over the masses and the blue, but you''ve got my first ten of the challenge.<br/></td>', 'You win... I quit :)..... Fantastic shot... terrific lighting and use of negative space, in all serious, this is probably a little TOO disturbing to win over the masses and the blue, but you''ve got my first ten of the challenge.', '2005-05-04 07:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358498, 172072, 23458, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the title, and I usually don''t like gaudy special effects, but for some reason I find this quite appealing... great pose.7</td>', 'I don''t like the title, and I usually don''t like gaudy special effects, but for some reason I find this quite appealing... great pose.7', '2005-05-04 07:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358505, 172812, 23458, '<td valign="top">Now this is the way a shallow DOF should be used. I''m willing to overlook the fact that ''predominance'' is not an emotion but rather more of a state of affairs, because I''m pretty sure that whatever drives someone to point a gun at someone else is emotional in itself. 8</td>', 'Now this is the way a shallow DOF should be used. I''m willing to overlook the fact that ''predominance'' is not an emotion but rather more of a state of affairs, because I''m pretty sure that whatever drives someone to point a gun at someone else is emotional in itself. 8', '2005-05-04 07:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358509, 171540, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the composition a lot, but find the green to be a bit too saturated.</td>', 'I like the composition a lot, but find the green to be a bit too saturated.', '2005-05-04 07:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358511, 172736, 23458, '<td valign="top">Heheheheh.... is that terje up there ? <br/> <br/>Great location and excellent composition. 8</td>', 'Heheheheh.... is that terje up there ?  Great location and excellent composition. 8', '2005-05-04 07:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358518, 172936, 23458, '<td valign="top">Is it just me, or is it kinda odd that the guy is on tip toes.... I mean those are some decent sized heels, but come on :P! If it was a deliberate role reversal I like your sense of humour, if not, I like your sense of timing. Good shot!</td>', 'Is it just me, or is it kinda odd that the guy is on tip toes.... I mean those are some decent sized heels, but come on :P! If it was a deliberate role reversal I like your sense of humour, if not, I like your sense of timing. Good shot!', '2005-05-04 07:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358523, 172118, 23458, '<td valign="top">It might just be me, but I think to appropriately convey gloom you would have to push the processing here a bit more - perhaps convert to black and white, and do a bit of Heidering on that sky. I do like the composition though. 6</td>', 'It might just be me, but I think to appropriately convey gloom you would have to push the processing here a bit more - perhaps convert to black and white, and do a bit of Heidering on that sky. I do like the composition though. 6', '2005-05-04 07:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358530, 173035, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is a flat out brilliant photograph. Might not ''capture an emotion'' but it couldn''t be much moodier if it tried. Excellent processing and use of black and white.</td>', 'This is a flat out brilliant photograph. Might not ''capture an emotion'' but it couldn''t be much moodier if it tried. Excellent processing and use of black and white.', '2005-05-04 07:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358539, 172706, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very raw, emotional image.... the teddy bear adds a nice dimension.</td>', 'Very raw, emotional image.... the teddy bear adds a nice dimension.', '2005-05-04 07:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358551, 173066, 23458, '<td valign="top">Hehehehe, I was about to discard this one as just another ''shoehorned into the challenge shots'' but then I caught this guys expression - You can''t see that and not smile. Happyness indeed. I wish the block thing wasn''t there to interfere with the composition, but this is still a solid 8.</td>', 'Hehehehe, I was about to discard this one as just another ''shoehorned into the challenge shots'' but then I caught this guys expression - You can''t see that and not smile. Happyness indeed. I wish the block thing wasn''t there to interfere with the composition, but this is still a solid 8.', '2005-05-04 07:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358575, 172706, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones and I really like the pose of your model but I''m not sure that cutting off her legs was the right thing to do. Looks like your lighting did not cover the entire image area and left a couple of dark spots in the upper corners.  I''m sure the teddy bear has some symbolic meaning, but for me, it''s inclusion in the photo makes the image less poignant and reduces it''s impact.</td>', 'Wonderful tones and I really like the pose of your model but I''m not sure that cutting off her legs was the right thing to do. Looks like your lighting did not cover the entire image area and left a couple of dark spots in the upper corners.  I''m sure the teddy bear has some symbolic meaning, but for me, it''s inclusion in the photo makes the image less poignant and reduces it''s impact.', '2005-05-04 07:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358586, 172891, 5822, '<td valign="top">Though technically lacking (high noise, near hot spots, white balance off) I like the capture of your subject in its relation to the challenge theme.  Focus, imo, should be on the eyes, and not on the nose.  Looks to be perspective distortion as well, maybe from using a wide angle too close to the subject?</td>', 'Though technically lacking (high noise, near hot spots, white balance off) I like the capture of your subject in its relation to the challenge theme.  Focus, imo, should be on the eyes, and not on the nose.  Looks to be perspective distortion as well, maybe from using a wide angle too close to the subject?', '2005-05-04 07:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358595, 172492, 16241, '<td valign="top">gorgeous</td>', 'gorgeous', '2005-05-04 07:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358596, 172820, 5822, '<td valign="top">A bit too contrasty and harsh lighting (dark shadows) for an amused look, imo, but a good technical capture nonetheless. Maybe could use a hairlight for added definition of your model''s head.  Meets the challenge theme well.</td>', 'A bit too contrasty and harsh lighting (dark shadows) for an amused look, imo, but a good technical capture nonetheless. Maybe could use a hairlight for added definition of your model''s head.  Meets the challenge theme well.', '2005-05-04 07:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358603, 172373, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful scene but I''m not sure it says tranquility to me with the waterfall.  You did a great job on capturing the waterfall except I don''t like the tree branches that sticks out into it. Also, the hot spot in the lower left and the less obvious darker branches in the lower right could have all been cloned out.  Other than that, a really terrific image.</td>', 'Very beautiful scene but I''m not sure it says tranquility to me with the waterfall.  You did a great job on capturing the waterfall except I don''t like the tree branches that sticks out into it. Also, the hot spot in the lower left and the less obvious darker branches in the lower right could have all been cloned out.  Other than that, a really terrific image.', '2005-05-04 08:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358607, 171163, 5822, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I see emotion here, but I think you did a very good job on capturing this lone sliding pond. The image is almost surreal with the dull grey surrounding the bright colors of your subjects.</td>', 'I''m not sure I see emotion here, but I think you did a very good job on capturing this lone sliding pond. The image is almost surreal with the dull grey surrounding the bright colors of your subjects.', '2005-05-04 08:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358627, 173032, 30018, '<td valign="top">I''ve come back to this image about 8 times.  I like the image a lot.  I''m just not sure how it is conveying a mood or feeling.  The shallow DOF used here is effective.  But honestly, this angle of the image, does not convey enough information.  She could be anxious, or she could be sleeping, or reaching for something; it''s just not clear.  I''m going to score this, giving you the benefit of the doubt, but I had to share my thoughts on this one.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'I''ve come back to this image about 8 times.  I like the image a lot.  I''m just not sure how it is conveying a mood or feeling.  The shallow DOF used here is effective.  But honestly, this angle of the image, does not convey enough information.  She could be anxious, or she could be sleeping, or reaching for something; it''s just not clear.  I''m going to score this, giving you the benefit of the doubt, but I had to share my thoughts on this one.  <6>', '2005-05-04 08:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358632, 172931, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, clean long exposure image. Like the colors alot and the silhouette.</td>', 'Beautiful, clean long exposure image. Like the colors alot and the silhouette.', '2005-05-04 08:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358664, 171632, 5822, '<td valign="top">Exquisite image capture and pp that borders on digital art.  I really like how the teeth are bright and the lines made by zoom during exposure (which was done perfectly without excess).  Very well done.</td>', 'Exquisite image capture and pp that borders on digital art.  I really like how the teeth are bright and the lines made by zoom during exposure (which was done perfectly without excess).  Very well done.', '2005-05-04 08:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358711, 173051, 19010, '<td valign="top">Very emotional photo that fits the challenge perfectly. I must admit however that I don''t care for the bizzare lines in the girls skin. I assume this is some type of lighting effect. Asside from the lines this is a wonderfull image. hmm after looking at it a bit more I notice what apears to be a reflected face in around on the chin of the guy in the shot. was this shot through a window? Was this intentional? are two questions that run through my mind when voting on this shot.</td>', 'Very emotional photo that fits the challenge perfectly. I must admit however that I don''t care for the bizzare lines in the girls skin. I assume this is some type of lighting effect. Asside from the lines this is a wonderfull image. hmm after looking at it a bit more I notice what apears to be a reflected face in around on the chin of the guy in the shot. was this shot through a window? Was this intentional? are two questions that run through my mind when voting on this shot.', '2005-05-04 08:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358714, 171999, 19010, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image and a great capture. I don''t feel however that this fits the challenge. You photographed somthing that inspires emotion. You did not photograph the emotion itself. This is still a nice image so i''ll still give a generous score. and as for not fitting the challenge this one is close enough to be subjecgtive.</td>', 'This is a very nice image and a great capture. I don''t feel however that this fits the challenge. You photographed somthing that inspires emotion. You did not photograph the emotion itself. This is still a nice image so i''ll still give a generous score. and as for not fitting the challenge this one is close enough to be subjecgtive.', '2005-05-04 08:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358718, 171048, 19010, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and texture. The B&amp;W works very well for this shot. But you may get hammered a bit on not fitting the challenge. Statues don''t have moods. As for my vote. The statue portays emotion very well the artist manages to convey emotions through the sculpture often better than  many people can naturaly. Nice job</td>', 'Great DOF and texture. The B&W works very well for this shot. But you may get hammered a bit on not fitting the challenge. Statues don''t have moods. As for my vote. The statue portays emotion very well the artist manages to convey emotions through the sculpture often better than  many people can naturaly. Nice job', '2005-05-04 08:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358758, 172482, 25355, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better in black  and white, even though I''m not really a huge fan of black and white.</td>', 'I think this would have been better in black  and white, even though I''m not really a huge fan of black and white.', '2005-05-04 09:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358771, 172805, 25355, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.', '2005-05-04 09:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358779, 173066, 25355, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot; you should be very happy with it.</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot; you should be very happy with it.', '2005-05-04 09:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358787, 172141, 25355, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait - beautiful face - but the light column on the right is quite distracting and keeps drawing the eye away from the subject. Perhaps a bit of judicious cropping or just darkening  it . Bumped up to 10</td>', 'This is a great portrait - beautiful face - but the light column on the right is quite distracting and keeps drawing the eye away from the subject. Perhaps a bit of judicious cropping or just darkening  it . Bumped up to 10', '2005-05-04 09:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358790, 173060, 25355, '<td valign="top">The best one with this title, because it actually shows a person. 10</td>', 'The best one with this title, because it actually shows a person. 10', '2005-05-04 09:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358822, 170900, 7289, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and superbly executed. Scary.</td>', 'Excellent idea and superbly executed. Scary.', '2005-05-04 09:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358828, 172936, 7289, '<td valign="top">Great idea that works well, there is a lot of information implied with good choice of costume and pose.</td>', 'Great idea that works well, there is a lot of information implied with good choice of costume and pose.', '2005-05-04 09:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358835, 172746, 7289, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.</td>', 'Very nice composition.', '2005-05-04 09:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358840, 171918, 7289, '<td valign="top">An excellent shot wonderfully lit.</td>', 'An excellent shot wonderfully lit.', '2005-05-04 09:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358843, 171447, 7289, '<td valign="top">A beautiful, simple shot, very effective.</td>', 'A beautiful, simple shot, very effective.', '2005-05-04 09:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358850, 172141, 7289, '<td valign="top">A beautiful, simple shot, very effective.</td>', 'A beautiful, simple shot, very effective.', '2005-05-04 09:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358882, 171068, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not sure this evokes a mood for me... this is quite hard to achieve in an urban setting IMO. Shutter speed is a tad too slow, I''d have liked the cyclist sharper. Not bad at this speed though. Composition a little too cluttered.</td>', 'Not sure this evokes a mood for me... this is quite hard to achieve in an urban setting IMO. Shutter speed is a tad too slow, I''d have liked the cyclist sharper. Not bad at this speed though. Composition a little too cluttered.', '2005-05-04 10:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358886, 172381, 8522, '<td valign="top">A promising setting for a mood challenge, but the table is wonky, colour balance is too yellow and composition is unbalanced. Too much glare off the plate.</td>', 'A promising setting for a mood challenge, but the table is wonky, colour balance is too yellow and composition is unbalanced. Too much glare off the plate.', '2005-05-04 10:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358892, 171780, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, nice shades of blue. Composition is not bad, but not clear enough to make a shot with real impact.</td>', 'Lovely shot, nice shades of blue. Composition is not bad, but not clear enough to make a shot with real impact.', '2005-05-04 10:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358895, 172412, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, dof works well. Composition seems unimaginative though. Perhaps if the boy was on the right edge of the frame and a bit higher?</td>', 'Nice shot, dof works well. Composition seems unimaginative though. Perhaps if the boy was on the right edge of the frame and a bit higher?', '2005-05-04 10:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358899, 172771, 8522, '<td valign="top">Cardinal sin of animal photography... subject too similar in colour and texture to background. Nice collection of subjects though.</td>', 'Cardinal sin of animal photography... subject too similar in colour and texture to background. Nice collection of subjects though.', '2005-05-04 10:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358904, 172388, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not very sharp... did this have a run in USM? Some strange textures in the hair, not sure what caused this. His right eye needs a catchlight and although the smile is nice, I''d have tried a few more shots to get a slightly better expression in his eyes.</td>', 'Not very sharp... did this have a run in USM? Some strange textures in the hair, not sure what caused this. His right eye needs a catchlight and although the smile is nice, I''d have tried a few more shots to get a slightly better expression in his eyes.', '2005-05-04 10:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358908, 172972, 8522, '<td valign="top">I like the mood, graduated sky works well. Composition is a little haphazard for this to get a high score.</td>', 'I like the mood, graduated sky works well. Composition is a little haphazard for this to get a high score.', '2005-05-04 10:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358916, 172932, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice moment, but photo is not sharp, onboard flash looks terrible and has cast ugly shadows, face is cut in half by background line and face looks very splotchy due to harsh light and too much purple/red saturation.</td>', 'Nice moment, but photo is not sharp, onboard flash looks terrible and has cast ugly shadows, face is cut in half by background line and face looks very splotchy due to harsh light and too much purple/red saturation.', '2005-05-04 10:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358919, 172881, 8522, '<td valign="top">Background really doesn''t look good, and onboard flash has resulted in very harsh light with unappealing shadows.</td>', 'Background really doesn''t look good, and onboard flash has resulted in very harsh light with unappealing shadows.', '2005-05-04 10:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358924, 172833, 8522, '<td valign="top">Subject is not sharp, too many textures make point of focus uncertain and composition is unimaginative, centered subjects usually don''t work too well. Shadow across face is not good.</td>', 'Subject is not sharp, too many textures make point of focus uncertain and composition is unimaginative, centered subjects usually don''t work too well. Shadow across face is not good.', '2005-05-04 10:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358929, 172468, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame the shot has been slightly overexposed and face has a little too much glare, otherwise a great photo and great model. Good detail.</td>', 'Shame the shot has been slightly overexposed and face has a little too much glare, otherwise a great photo and great model. Good detail.', '2005-05-04 10:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358934, 173060, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely, shame the face is a little dark... perhaps some fill-in flash could have helped. Very effective dof. Good composition.</td>', 'Lovely, shame the face is a little dark... perhaps some fill-in flash could have helped. Very effective dof. Good composition.', '2005-05-04 10:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358936, 171513, 8522, '<td valign="top">Needs more dof to my eyes.</td>', 'Needs more dof to my eyes.', '2005-05-04 10:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358939, 170803, 8522, '<td valign="top">Usually not good when a background element has a line that goes through the subject''s face. Colour balance looks a tad off. Bridge isn''t sharp, needs a little more dof. Composition doesn''t quite feel balanced.</td>', 'Usually not good when a background element has a line that goes through the subject''s face. Colour balance looks a tad off. Bridge isn''t sharp, needs a little more dof. Composition doesn''t quite feel balanced.', '2005-05-04 10:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358944, 172608, 19010, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. I thought she was lying on snow at first until I noticed the reflection. Very crisp image, wonderfull composition. I think a bit more of a smile would have been nice but this works very well as it is. Nice job!!</td>', 'Interesting image. I thought she was lying on snow at first until I noticed the reflection. Very crisp image, wonderfull composition. I think a bit more of a smile would have been nice but this works very well as it is. Nice job!!', '2005-05-04 10:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358948, 170488, 8522, '<td valign="top">Can''t see anywhere in the photo that is in focus. The eyes at least should be razor sharp. Nice shot, although I''d have prefered a less square crop. Lighting is not bad, although the onboard flash has cast an unappealing shadow under the chin. Try bouncing an offboard flash next time.</td>', 'Can''t see anywhere in the photo that is in focus. The eyes at least should be razor sharp. Nice shot, although I''d have prefered a less square crop. Lighting is not bad, although the onboard flash has cast an unappealing shadow under the chin. Try bouncing an offboard flash next time.', '2005-05-04 10:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358953, 172986, 8522, '<td valign="top">Background doesn''t create much of a mood, lighting has not been flattering to man''s skin tone.</td>', 'Background doesn''t create much of a mood, lighting has not been flattering to man''s skin tone.', '2005-05-04 10:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358954, 173055, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but wish something was in focus and silhouette was clearer with more impact.</td>', 'Very nice, but wish something was in focus and silhouette was clearer with more impact.', '2005-05-04 10:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358957, 172736, 19010, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge as has an intereting and rather unique composition. I feel the darkness of the photo works well with the mood you are trying to portray. The water looks a little ackward to to me, and the model could use a bit more light. As it is the model is easy to overlook. Overall a pretty nice shot.</td>', 'This fits the challenge as has an intereting and rather unique composition. I feel the darkness of the photo works well with the mood you are trying to portray. The water looks a little ackward to to me, and the model could use a bit more light. As it is the model is easy to overlook. Overall a pretty nice shot.', '2005-05-04 10:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358959, 172931, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow! It bothers me though that the horizon bisects the figure... could you have got lower down? Don''t like the centered horizon. Lovely textures in sea.</td>', 'Wow! It bothers me though that the horizon bisects the figure... could you have got lower down? Don''t like the centered horizon. Lovely textures in sea.', '2005-05-04 10:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358963, 172739, 8522, '<td valign="top">An opportune capture, but not convinced by your composiion which strikes me as unimaginative.</td>', 'An opportune capture, but not convinced by your composiion which strikes me as unimaginative.', '2005-05-04 10:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358970, 172780, 19010, '<td valign="top">I bet your getting hammered with OOF comments. Personaly I like the look you acheived it looks more like a graphite scetch than a photo. Theres a very unique feel to this photo. My only complaint would be that I would lie to have seen it with a little more light. Great job!!</td>', 'I bet your getting hammered with OOF comments. Personaly I like the look you acheived it looks more like a graphite scetch than a photo. Theres a very unique feel to this photo. My only complaint would be that I would lie to have seen it with a little more light. Great job!!', '2005-05-04 10:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358971, 173067, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, don''t think your title works too well though. Perhaps a little underexposed, I''d have metered off the boy rather than the background. Good shutter speed.</td>', 'Lovely shot, don''t think your title works too well though. Perhaps a little underexposed, I''d have metered off the boy rather than the background. Good shutter speed.', '2005-05-04 10:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358974, 173014, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nothing, particularly the eye is sharp enough. Composition feels unbalanced. Skin tone a little red.</td>', 'Nothing, particularly the eye is sharp enough. Composition feels unbalanced. Skin tone a little red.', '2005-05-04 10:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358976, 172475, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not very appealing snapshot. Textures really let this photo down, also no clear point of focus and bad light.</td>', 'Not very appealing snapshot. Textures really let this photo down, also no clear point of focus and bad light.', '2005-05-04 10:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358981, 172836, 8522, '<td valign="top">A bit too silly for my taste. Colour balance seems a little off. Not really creating a mood for me.</td>', 'A bit too silly for my taste. Colour balance seems a little off. Not really creating a mood for me.', '2005-05-04 10:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358985, 172741, 8522, '<td valign="top">Face is way too dark, and is what should have been metered for. Not enough sense of speed... perhaps a much slower shutter speed and some panning? Light is too harsh, background too cluttered.</td>', 'Face is way too dark, and is what should have been metered for. Not enough sense of speed... perhaps a much slower shutter speed and some panning? Light is too harsh, background too cluttered.', '2005-05-04 10:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358989, 172684, 8522, '<td valign="top">Background doesn''t help to create a mood. Composition doesn''t feel thought out enough for this to not feel like a snapshot.</td>', 'Background doesn''t help to create a mood. Composition doesn''t feel thought out enough for this to not feel like a snapshot.', '2005-05-04 10:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358993, 171408, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great moment, good face. Reflection of flash on left immediately lets it down though, as well as bad light and shadows caused by onboard flash.</td>', 'Great moment, good face. Reflection of flash on left immediately lets it down though, as well as bad light and shadows caused by onboard flash.', '2005-05-04 10:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358996, 172608, 8522, '<td valign="top">Intriguing photo and model. Great expression in the eyes. Good shirt. Not convinced by square crop though.</td>', 'Intriguing photo and model. Great expression in the eyes. Good shirt. Not convinced by square crop though.', '2005-05-04 10:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359003, 172706, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice collection of browns, but something about it feels too setup rather than pulling us in to a shot making us ask what has happened. The overblown highlights don''t quite work for me, although it does almost look deliberate.</td>', 'Nice collection of browns, but something about it feels too setup rather than pulling us in to a shot making us ask what has happened. The overblown highlights don''t quite work for me, although it does almost look deliberate.', '2005-05-04 10:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
