(1359010, 172569, 8522, '<td valign="top">Colour balance is way too purple, and shot has been underexposed. Face isn''t sharp. Composition is unbalanced. Lovely background though. Border is overdone for a simple snapshot.</td>', 'Colour balance is way too purple, and shot has been underexposed. Face isn''t sharp. Composition is unbalanced. Lovely background though. Border is overdone for a simple snapshot.', '2005-05-04 10:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
