(1359023, 173022, 8522, '<td valign="top">Selective desat looks like an attempt to rescue a mediocre photo. Grey face is very unappealing. Background is sharper than girl.</td>', 'Selective desat looks like an attempt to rescue a mediocre photo. Grey face is very unappealing. Background is sharper than girl.', '2005-05-04 10:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
