(1359998, 172413, 19010, '<td valign="top">photo is a bit to dark while it may add to the atmospher and mood of the photo, it makes it difficult for me to see what he is doing. Very crisp image with lots of lines, details and contrast. Nice job.</td>', 'photo is a bit to dark while it may add to the atmospher and mood of the photo, it makes it difficult for me to see what he is doing. Very crisp image with lots of lines, details and contrast. Nice job.', '2005-05-04 14:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
