(1361029, 172072, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh man. . . . you did a GREAT job of depiciting that awful feeling!!    I almost felt it again just looking at this -- and it''s been a hundred years since I felt it.   :)   Good job.</td>', 'Oh man. . . . you did a GREAT job of depiciting that awful feeling!!    I almost felt it again just looking at this -- and it''s been a hundred years since I felt it.   :)   Good job.', '2005-05-04 19:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
