(1361045, 171516, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwwwwww. . . . how can you stand it!    Those tears broke my heart the minute I saw them!!    She is so cute, and I''m going to comfort myself by knowing that she has surely been kissed and hugged and that there are no more tears on that beautiful face.   You did a GREAT job of conveying emotion.   This may be my favorite one in the whole challenge, and I''m almost done voting!!   I''d vote ribbon for this one!!!   10</td>', 'Awwwwwwwwww. . . . how can you stand it!    Those tears broke my heart the minute I saw them!!    She is so cute, and I''m going to comfort myself by knowing that she has surely been kissed and hugged and that there are no more tears on that beautiful face.   You did a GREAT job of conveying emotion.   This may be my favorite one in the whole challenge, and I''m almost done voting!!   I''d vote ribbon for this one!!!   10', '2005-05-04 19:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361050, 172941, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great job!!!   This is such a professional looking portrait, and her face does radiate glee!!  I love it!!!!   I love her vintage look with that hat!</td>', 'Great job!!!   This is such a professional looking portrait, and her face does radiate glee!!  I love it!!!!   I love her vintage look with that hat!', '2005-05-04 19:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361052, 173063, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo!   BEAUTIFUL!!!!</td>', 'Beautiful photo!   BEAUTIFUL!!!!', '2005-05-04 19:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361062, 172864, 93, '<td valign="top">She does look a little perturbed here.. but also thoughtful.. as if she''s thinking not only that brothers are a pain in the ass.. but how to effectively get rid of them and hide the bodies.<br/> <br/>This is a pretty good candid portrait, but the color seems a little flat to me.. more DOF would have been nice (assuming it''s possible), but I understand that it can''t always be achieved.  Love the wispy hair..   Just a few tweaks on lighting and color, and you''d have a winner.</td>', 'She does look a little perturbed here.. but also thoughtful.. as if she''s thinking not only that brothers are a pain in the ass.. but how to effectively get rid of them and hide the bodies. This is a pretty good candid portrait, but the color seems a little flat to me.. more DOF would have been nice (assuming it''s possible), but I understand that it can''t always be achieved.  Love the wispy hair..   Just a few tweaks on lighting and color, and you''d have a winner.', '2005-05-04 19:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361064, 173050, 24976, '<td valign="top">nice idea and shot. to improve it i think you might move the object further up from the wall so their shadows arent visible on it. also maybe add some whites. but i like the refelction and tone.</td>', 'nice idea and shot. to improve it i think you might move the object further up from the wall so their shadows arent visible on it. also maybe add some whites. but i like the refelction and tone.', '2005-05-04 19:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361068, 173035, 24976, '<td valign="top">i love the contrasts in your b/w tones. nicely done.</td>', 'i love the contrasts in your b/w tones. nicely done.', '2005-05-04 19:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361069, 172618, 93, '<td valign="top">taken from the POV of the rodent the raptor is about to consume? <br/> <br/>Sky is a bit distractingly noisy, and the shot is a little too contrasty.</td>', 'taken from the POV of the rodent the raptor is about to consume?  Sky is a bit distractingly noisy, and the shot is a little too contrasty.', '2005-05-04 19:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361074, 172972, 24976, '<td valign="top">very evokative. (is that a word? evoke + ative...) but yeah i like it. 9</td>', 'very evokative. (is that a word? evoke + ative...) but yeah i like it. 9', '2005-05-04 19:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361076, 172402, 24976, '<td valign="top">i like the close cropping, really strong and direct. good job.</td>', 'i like the close cropping, really strong and direct. good job.', '2005-05-04 19:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361078, 172689, 93, '<td valign="top">One gripe I have about this is the fact that Puberty itself isn''t a mood ;)  Tiny gripe though.. nitpickiness at its best.   Fantastic focus on the face, but perhaps a little too contrasty.  The darkness is a good complement to the mood, but the contrast brings out the sharpness to a point where it''s almost over-sharp.</td>', 'One gripe I have about this is the fact that Puberty itself isn''t a mood ;)  Tiny gripe though.. nitpickiness at its best.   Fantastic focus on the face, but perhaps a little too contrasty.  The darkness is a good complement to the mood, but the contrast brings out the sharpness to a point where it''s almost over-sharp.', '2005-05-04 19:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361080, 172374, 24976, '<td valign="top">the contrast is a bit too harsh imo.</td>', 'the contrast is a bit too harsh imo.', '2005-05-04 19:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361082, 172924, 93, '<td valign="top">This photo is a little small. It''s a bit contrasty as well.. would have benefitted from a little brighter lighting.. some a little more "spring" like.  I get a very wintery feel from this.</td>', 'This photo is a little small. It''s a bit contrasty as well.. would have benefitted from a little brighter lighting.. some a little more "spring" like.  I get a very wintery feel from this.', '2005-05-04 19:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361086, 172684, 93, '<td valign="top">a little bit of over-exposure on the foreground dog.. composition is nice though, and a little more DOF and tighter shot on the foreground dog could have made this that much better.</td>', 'a little bit of over-exposure on the foreground dog.. composition is nice though, and a little more DOF and tighter shot on the foreground dog could have made this that much better.', '2005-05-04 19:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361087, 172737, 24976, '<td valign="top">slightly out of focus imo. looks like a snap shot.</td>', 'slightly out of focus imo. looks like a snap shot.', '2005-05-04 19:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361089, 171486, 93, '<td valign="top">Hulk Smash! ;)</td>', 'Hulk Smash! ;)', '2005-05-04 19:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
