(1361096, 172737, 93, '<td valign="top">Your focus is a little off here. I don''t know if you were going for a "soft focus" effect, or if the camera just missed the focus (the material the dog is laying on seems more in focus), but it''s not working.</td>', 'Your focus is a little off here. I don''t know if you were going for a "soft focus" effect, or if the camera just missed the focus (the material the dog is laying on seems more in focus), but it''s not working.', '2005-05-04 19:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
