(1361501, 172805, 13305, '<td valign="top">The man looks fairly serious, the woman looks fairly happy, and the kid seems withdrawn.  I understand this is a mixture of emotions, but I think it would be better to focus in on one rather than all of them.  Is this perhaps a parent-teacher conference?</td>', 'The man looks fairly serious, the woman looks fairly happy, and the kid seems withdrawn.  I understand this is a mixture of emotions, but I think it would be better to focus in on one rather than all of them.  Is this perhaps a parent-teacher conference?', '2005-05-04 21:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361503, 172536, 22340, '<td valign="top">that''s a hit, run, and be happy face if i ever saw one ... nicely done</td>', 'that''s a hit, run, and be happy face if i ever saw one ... nicely done', '2005-05-04 21:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361509, 172072, 13305, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if morning sickness is actually a mood, but the inversion certainly helps convey the feeling.  I''m not sure if the color version would indicate the feeling in the better.</td>', 'I don''t know if morning sickness is actually a mood, but the inversion certainly helps convey the feeling.  I''m not sure if the color version would indicate the feeling in the better.', '2005-05-04 21:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361514, 172737, 22340, '<td valign="top">tough to get clarity per depth of field costraints when shooting this close (or is this cropped?) ... in any case i think filling a bit less of the frame with the cute pup would have improved this</td>', 'tough to get clarity per depth of field costraints when shooting this close (or is this cropped?) ... in any case i think filling a bit less of the frame with the cute pup would have improved this', '2005-05-04 22:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361518, 172410, 13305, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how the melancholy could be any more apparent in this photo.  Good job!</td>', 'I don''t know how the melancholy could be any more apparent in this photo.  Good job!', '2005-05-04 22:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361523, 172845, 13305, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of a joyful dance.  You can tell, the couple is really having fun.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Excellent capture of a joyful dance.  You can tell, the couple is really having fun.  Keep up the good work.', '2005-05-04 22:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361532, 171504, 13305, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I don''t believe a museum exhibit can really convey a mood.</td>', 'I''m sorry, I don''t believe a museum exhibit can really convey a mood.', '2005-05-04 22:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361535, 173058, 22340, '<td valign="top">great execution in focus/exposure, great subject, great smile/eyes, composition good but maybe a hair off???</td>', 'great execution in focus/exposure, great subject, great smile/eyes, composition good but maybe a hair off???', '2005-05-04 22:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361537, 173028, 13305, '<td valign="top">I don''t think your picture indicates ecstasy, unless you''ve been taking it.  Focus more clearly on something and try again.</td>', 'I don''t think your picture indicates ecstasy, unless you''ve been taking it.  Focus more clearly on something and try again.', '2005-05-04 22:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361539, 171068, 22340, '<td valign="top">nice panning shot for movement ... a litlle weak on challenge intent for moods</td>', 'nice panning shot for movement ... a litlle weak on challenge intent for moods', '2005-05-04 22:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361542, 171885, 13305, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what this is enough to actually perceive a mood.  It looks like a marzipan or clay creature with a silly look on its face.  I think the problem is you''ve chosen a subject that''s far out enough that people are unable to evaluate it properly.</td>', 'I can''t tell what this is enough to actually perceive a mood.  It looks like a marzipan or clay creature with a silly look on its face.  I think the problem is you''ve chosen a subject that''s far out enough that people are unable to evaluate it properly.', '2005-05-04 22:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361546, 172764, 22340, '<td valign="top">very nicely exposed photo .. can''t go wrong with a boy and his dog ... i think shifting the subjects a little off center would have made photo a bit more interesting IMO</td>', 'very nicely exposed photo .. can''t go wrong with a boy and his dog ... i think shifting the subjects a little off center would have made photo a bit more interesting IMO', '2005-05-04 22:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361547, 173048, 13305, '<td valign="top">Sadness or boredom?  It''s hard to tell, focusing more closely on your subject.</td>', 'Sadness or boredom?  It''s hard to tell, focusing more closely on your subject.', '2005-05-04 22:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361548, 172866, 32754, '<td valign="top">good use of light and shadow...there is just enough light to define the subject''s face and for the observer to see his expression..8</td>', 'good use of light and shadow...there is just enough light to define the subject''s face and for the observer to see his expression..8', '2005-05-04 22:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361551, 173032, 13305, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand how the little girls pose conveys anxiousness.  I need more context to fully get the gist of your photo.  Perhaps the look on her face or something to indicate what she''s looking out the window for.</td>', 'I don''t understand how the little girls pose conveys anxiousness.  I need more context to fully get the gist of your photo.  Perhaps the look on her face or something to indicate what she''s looking out the window for.', '2005-05-04 22:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361554, 170880, 32754, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture of contentment..I love it..the angle of the shot down at the rock is really good; the lizard is almost smiling..haha...8</td>', 'Wonderful capture of contentment..I love it..the angle of the shot down at the rock is really good; the lizard is almost smiling..haha...8', '2005-05-04 22:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361558, 173046, 13305, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice place to fish early in the morning, or maybe just sit and contemplate.  Keep up the good work!</td>', 'Looks like a nice place to fish early in the morning, or maybe just sit and contemplate.  Keep up the good work!', '2005-05-04 22:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361559, 172441, 22340, '<td valign="top">very nicely done ... subject, monotone, and composition all very strong WRT to "Moods".<br/>may have like to have seen a little less light/clarity on the amp cords to better isolate man and his guitar</td>', 'very nicely done ... subject, monotone, and composition all very strong WRT to "Moods".may have like to have seen a little less light/clarity on the amp cords to better isolate man and his guitar', '2005-05-04 22:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361561, 173057, 32754, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot of young love!  The expression and angle of faces is well done; I like the soft low lighting also...8</td>', 'Excellent shot of young love!  The expression and angle of faces is well done; I like the soft low lighting also...8', '2005-05-04 22:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361565, 173060, 32754, '<td valign="top">great shot with a real expression of joy on the girl''s face..I like the placement of the subject in the frame and the counterpoint of the flowers; you can almost feel her running across the picture...8</td>', 'great shot with a real expression of joy on the girl''s face..I like the placement of the subject in the frame and the counterpoint of the flowers; you can almost feel her running across the picture...8', '2005-05-04 22:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361567, 172741, 32754, '<td valign="top">I like this but would have liked to see more of the wheelchair and rider..perhaps flipping it to landscape would have improved it..just an idea..good work..7</td>', 'I like this but would have liked to see more of the wheelchair and rider..perhaps flipping it to landscape would have improved it..just an idea..good work..7', '2005-05-04 22:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361574, 173022, 22340, '<td valign="top">nice concept and general composition altho a a lower f-stop (if it was available) to isolate girl from background via DOF would have improved shot IMO</td>', 'nice concept and general composition altho a a lower f-stop (if it was available) to isolate girl from background via DOF would have improved shot IMO', '2005-05-04 22:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
