(1361579, 172485, 18191, '<td valign="top">I think that the composition could be improved for thsi shot. If your focal point is near the center of the photograph, it should either be dead-center or not near the center at all IMHO.</td>', 'I think that the composition could be improved for thsi shot. If your focal point is near the center of the photograph, it should either be dead-center or not near the center at all IMHO.', '2005-05-04 22:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
