(1361647, 172929, 18191, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sharpness and bokeh here. Tack-on and technically superb. Might have cropped off the tiny bit of white off from the bottom left of the shot.</td>', 'Wonderful sharpness and bokeh here. Tack-on and technically superb. Might have cropped off the tiny bit of white off from the bottom left of the shot.', '2005-05-04 22:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361651, 172870, 18191, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped in closer as there are some distracting elements of this shot. The object in the top right corner and the yellow dandelion steal attention away from the focal point which is the dog and the boy.</td>', 'I would have cropped in closer as there are some distracting elements of this shot. The object in the top right corner and the yellow dandelion steal attention away from the focal point which is the dog and the boy.', '2005-05-04 22:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361666, 172388, 22340, '<td valign="top">best happy picture of challenge</td>', 'best happy picture of challenge', '2005-05-04 22:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361667, 173028, 18191, '<td valign="top">Hm... Interesting shots. Awesome colors in the trails and visually appealing.</td>', 'Hm... Interesting shots. Awesome colors in the trails and visually appealing.', '2005-05-04 22:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361669, 172203, 18191, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the pastels here. Beautiful image! 8.</td>', 'I LOVE the pastels here. Beautiful image! 8.', '2005-05-04 22:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361676, 172402, 34974, '<td valign="top">I love the tights crop and how you are able to see the creases of the face. The black and white was a great choice.  Great job, it''s a 10 for me!</td>', 'I love the tights crop and how you are able to see the creases of the face. The black and white was a great choice.  Great job, it''s a 10 for me!', '2005-05-04 22:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361681, 172960, 34974, '<td valign="top">The radial blur is very distracting and does noot seem to work for your subject. However, the expression on his face fits the title well, and we all know what that is like to get a great shot!</td>', 'The radial blur is very distracting and does noot seem to work for your subject. However, the expression on his face fits the title well, and we all know what that is like to get a great shot!', '2005-05-04 22:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361687, 172536, 34974, '<td valign="top">This shot is simple but great! It looks as though it is her first time at bat.</td>', 'This shot is simple but great! It looks as though it is her first time at bat.', '2005-05-04 22:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361692, 172118, 3214, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but it doesn''t express gloomy to me!  Moody, though.</td>', 'Nice image, but it doesn''t express gloomy to me!  Moody, though.', '2005-05-04 22:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361693, 173029, 34974, '<td valign="top">You can almost feel her pain! Great shot</td>', 'You can almost feel her pain! Great shot', '2005-05-04 22:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361702, 172615, 18191, '<td valign="top">Great concept! I like the lighting here and your composition. Gives the flower a personality.</td>', 'Great concept! I like the lighting here and your composition. Gives the flower a personality.', '2005-05-04 23:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361703, 173060, 34974, '<td valign="top">Great expression! This shot makes the viewer really want to know what she is running to.</td>', 'Great expression! This shot makes the viewer really want to know what she is running to.', '2005-05-04 23:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361709, 172737, 34974, '<td valign="top">Too tight, the face isn''t in complete focus but very cute puppy!</td>', 'Too tight, the face isn''t in complete focus but very cute puppy!', '2005-05-04 23:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361743, 172834, 36888, '<td valign="top">Terrific candid photo.</td>', 'Terrific candid photo.', '2005-05-04 23:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361746, 171408, 36888, '<td valign="top">What a smile!  great picture</td>', 'What a smile!  great picture', '2005-05-04 23:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361756, 172398, 24976, '<td valign="top">the black and white here is fantastic. i really like the cropping as well. direct and powerful. 9</td>', 'the black and white here is fantastic. i really like the cropping as well. direct and powerful. 9', '2005-05-04 23:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361759, 172203, 24976, '<td valign="top">the flower kinda sorta looks like it is underwater, dont know if thats what you were going for or not but thats what i see.</td>', 'the flower kinda sorta looks like it is underwater, dont know if thats what you were going for or not but thats what i see.', '2005-05-04 23:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361765, 172118, 24976, '<td valign="top">its starting to point towards gloom but imo is not yet there. This is a wonderful shot and has lots of potential. I would say that if you wanted this to be gloom then you will need a lot more dodge/burn and multiply layers.</td>', 'its starting to point towards gloom but imo is not yet there. This is a wonderful shot and has lots of potential. I would say that if you wanted this to be gloom then you will need a lot more dodge/burn and multiply layers.', '2005-05-04 23:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361773, 172612, 24976, '<td valign="top">excellently done panning. Ok I am going off topic but imo you should enter this for a Kodak  photo of the day and Steve''s digicam as well. I think you might have a winning shot here. Ok back to challenge...  i like it and this its effective and well done. Perhaps more of a smile from the kid would have really made this, but still very good.</td>', 'excellently done panning. Ok I am going off topic but imo you should enter this for a Kodak  photo of the day and Steve''s digicam as well. I think you might have a winning shot here. Ok back to challenge...  i like it and this its effective and well done. Perhaps more of a smile from the kid would have really made this, but still very good.', '2005-05-04 23:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361776, 172618, 24976, '<td valign="top">to be completely honest i dont get nervous at all from the photo. i see the bird more as the predator than a prey.</td>', 'to be completely honest i dont get nervous at all from the photo. i see the bird more as the predator than a prey.', '2005-05-04 23:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361791, 170488, 24976, '<td valign="top">she needs wings! nice shot though.</td>', 'she needs wings! nice shot though.', '2005-05-04 23:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
