(1361945, 172608, 21202, '<td valign="top">Really great tonal qualities.  It appears to me as if this picture was rotated ninety degrees to the right becaue o the leaves. I like the placement of the left hand.</td>', 'Really great tonal qualities.  It appears to me as if this picture was rotated ninety degrees to the right becaue o the leaves. I like the placement of the left hand.', '2005-05-05 00:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
