(1362724, 172935, 16266, '<td valign="top">pretty good contrast.  The yellow behind the girl is a bid distracting as well as the house thing on the lower left.</td>', 'pretty good contrast.  The yellow behind the girl is a bid distracting as well as the house thing on the lower left.', '2005-05-05 09:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
