(1362735, 171378, 35357, '<td valign="top">OMG, this brings back memories of bad moods. Very creative.   After nearly five years of playing this with my wife at the cottage and never winning a single game, only coming close, she finally admitted to me that she''d moved her ships every time I was close to winning!  Great lighting and dof on your shot!</td>', 'OMG, this brings back memories of bad moods. Very creative.   After nearly five years of playing this with my wife at the cottage and never winning a single game, only coming close, she finally admitted to me that she''d moved her ships every time I was close to winning!  Great lighting and dof on your shot!', '2005-05-05 09:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362740, 171516, 35357, '<td valign="top">Aw! :-(<br/>I hope she cheered up.  Great catch!</td>', 'Aw! :-(I hope she cheered up.  Great catch!', '2005-05-05 09:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362745, 172974, 35357, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful catch.  I hope granddad gets a print, what a great memory.</td>', 'What a wonderful catch.  I hope granddad gets a print, what a great memory.', '2005-05-05 09:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362746, 172820, 33515, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting</td>', 'Very nice lighting', '2005-05-05 09:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362750, 172402, 33515, '<td valign="top">OMG, this is wonderful</td>', 'OMG, this is wonderful', '2005-05-05 09:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362752, 172615, 35357, '<td valign="top">I love the framing &amp; story in your shot.  I hope I can come up with shots that tell a story someday.  Great creativity. [10]</td>', 'I love the framing & story in your shot.  I hope I can come up with shots that tell a story someday.  Great creativity. [10]', '2005-05-05 09:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
