(1363135, 173061, 36299, '<td valign="top">I like strength in the colours here (Red White and Blue) , how the focus is on the subject and the others are softened out of the photo.  The framing actually works here. 10</td>', 'I like strength in the colours here (Red White and Blue) , how the focus is on the subject and the others are softened out of the photo.  The framing actually works here. 10', '2005-05-05 12:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363140, 172417, 36299, '<td valign="top">The depth between black and white is excellent.  The white area shows excellent detail.  Cropping really worked well here. 10</td>', 'The depth between black and white is excellent.  The white area shows excellent detail.  Cropping really worked well here. 10', '2005-05-05 12:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
