(1363566, 172986, 13879, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing it was a fishing story!  - "it was TTTHHHHHIIIIISSSSS Big...honest!"<br/></td>', 'I''m guessing it was a fishing story!  - "it was TTTHHHHHIIIIISSSSS Big...honest!"', '2005-05-05 15:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
