(1364554, 172932, 18191, '<td valign="top">The use of direct flash here is evident, thus giving it the appearance of a snapshot. It meets the challenge well and the expression is very nice.</td>', 'The use of direct flash here is evident, thus giving it the appearance of a snapshot. It meets the challenge well and the expression is very nice.', '2005-05-05 20:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
