(1364935, 172805, 22340, '<td valign="top">creative point of view camera angle gets high points ...  lighting on  subject somewhat weak IMO</td>', 'creative point of view camera angle gets high points ...  lighting on  subject somewhat weak IMO', '2005-05-05 23:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364938, 172118, 29904, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot but the waters are just too pretty to be gloomy.  I would have liked this anywere else but this challenge.  Sad to say mine is the same way (lonely n blue) and getting scored so low for that.  Personally I only score down a point or two for not fitting a category.    Nice DOF, color, line, shapes, and textures.  There is a lack of sharpness, mostly in the clouds.</td>', 'This is a lovely shot but the waters are just too pretty to be gloomy.  I would have liked this anywere else but this challenge.  Sad to say mine is the same way (lonely n blue) and getting scored so low for that.  Personally I only score down a point or two for not fitting a category.    Nice DOF, color, line, shapes, and textures.  There is a lack of sharpness, mostly in the clouds.', '2005-05-05 23:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364939, 173051, 7810, '<td valign="top">very wierd reflection thing going on here... curious as to how you achieved this effect</td>', 'very wierd reflection thing going on here... curious as to how you achieved this effect', '2005-05-05 23:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364943, 172475, 22340, '<td valign="top">sometimes too close is too much especially if you introduce distracting out of focus elements (nose) not related to the intent of the photo (sleepy eyes); kind of looks like my golden .. bet he/she is a beauty</td>', 'sometimes too close is too much especially if you introduce distracting out of focus elements (nose) not related to the intent of the photo (sleepy eyes); kind of looks like my golden .. bet he/she is a beauty', '2005-05-05 23:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364944, 172787, 7810, '<td valign="top">Haha...These two guys look very happy together. I like this black and white and the contrast of moods that the boys are trying to convey. This shot will do well nice job</td>', 'Haha...These two guys look very happy together. I like this black and white and the contrast of moods that the boys are trying to convey. This shot will do well nice job', '2005-05-05 23:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364946, 172754, 7810, '<td valign="top">Hope this is staged.... I hate the feeling of being overwhelmed.  nice pic by the way...like the black and white   it adds to the dark mood</td>', 'Hope this is staged.... I hate the feeling of being overwhelmed.  nice pic by the way...like the black and white   it adds to the dark mood', '2005-05-05 23:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364948, 172930, 10261, '<td valign="top">The lipstick looks orange; I think that a rusty red lipstick would have better complemented the sepia-like tone of the rest of the image. The placement of the kiss is also somewhat hidden in shadow. It might have produced a stronger effect if it were on the cheek.</td>', 'The lipstick looks orange; I think that a rusty red lipstick would have better complemented the sepia-like tone of the rest of the image. The placement of the kiss is also somewhat hidden in shadow. It might have produced a stronger effect if it were on the cheek.', '2005-05-05 23:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364950, 172079, 29904, '<td valign="top">this is really beautiful!  (Tres belle!?)  A little overexposed and saturated perhaps.<br/>What is the mood?  It looks tranquil.  the white object on the right is unidentifiable and distracting.  7</td>', 'this is really beautiful!  (Tres belle!?)  A little overexposed and saturated perhaps.What is the mood?  It looks tranquil.  the white object on the right is unidentifiable and distracting.  7', '2005-05-05 23:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364955, 172833, 29904, '<td valign="top">The white thing in foreground, below his ear is quite distracting.  It could have used a tighter crop perhaps.  Lovely stonework/setting.  Nice contrast of old and new!</td>', 'The white thing in foreground, below his ear is quite distracting.  It could have used a tighter crop perhaps.  Lovely stonework/setting.  Nice contrast of old and new!', '2005-05-05 23:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364959, 171378, 10261, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh. Even if I did have a strong mood associated with losing a came of Battleship, this is quite a stretch. If the subject matter were inherently more emotionally charged (e.g. a picture of a cemetery), then you might be able to get away with something this far removed from a direct depiction of a mood. <br/></td>', 'Nice bokeh. Even if I did have a strong mood associated with losing a came of Battleship, this is quite a stretch. If the subject matter were inherently more emotionally charged (e.g. a picture of a cemetery), then you might be able to get away with something this far removed from a direct depiction of a mood. ', '2005-05-05 23:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364962, 172940, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks more like "frazzled" to me.</td>', 'This looks more like "frazzled" to me.', '2005-05-05 23:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364963, 172371, 22054, '<td valign="top">Nice compostion and lighting (9)</td>', 'Nice compostion and lighting (9)', '2005-05-05 23:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364966, 171230, 10261, '<td valign="top">Something about this shot makes it feel more like a snapshot than a candid.<br/></td>', 'Something about this shot makes it feel more like a snapshot than a candid.', '2005-05-05 23:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364967, 172412, 22054, '<td valign="top">Definately communicates a mood. I like the DOF nice job (10)</td>', 'Definately communicates a mood. I like the DOF nice job (10)', '2005-05-05 23:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364972, 172324, 22054, '<td valign="top">NIce lighting and framing, I like the star filters on the street lamps.</td>', 'NIce lighting and framing, I like the star filters on the street lamps.', '2005-05-05 23:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364974, 173038, 22054, '<td valign="top">Nice communication of mood. I like how the face takes up the whole frame, interesting shot (8)</td>', 'Nice communication of mood. I like how the face takes up the whole frame, interesting shot (8)', '2005-05-05 23:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364979, 172381, 22054, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, nice communication of mood, good lighting.</td>', 'Cool shot, nice communication of mood, good lighting.', '2005-05-05 23:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364994, 172754, 10261, '<td valign="top">The pose does a good job of communicating the intended mood. However, the soft focus, blush pillows and the elegant plant make this feel somewhat relaxing. Things would seem more overwhelming if he were framed by stacks of textbooks or there were collection notices on a table in front of him. Using harsher light to illuminate your model would have also given this a more on-edge feel. Rendering his surroundings somewhat out of focus is good, but if things seemed to be more chaotic (perhaps by zooming while the shutter is open) this would feel more overwhelming and less like a struggle between a peaceful environment and a stressed out model. You did a very nice job with the light here, it just fights with the mood you''re trying to convey.<br/></td>', 'The pose does a good job of communicating the intended mood. However, the soft focus, blush pillows and the elegant plant make this feel somewhat relaxing. Things would seem more overwhelming if he were framed by stacks of textbooks or there were collection notices on a table in front of him. Using harsher light to illuminate your model would have also given this a more on-edge feel. Rendering his surroundings somewhat out of focus is good, but if things seemed to be more chaotic (perhaps by zooming while the shutter is open) this would feel more overwhelming and less like a struggle between a peaceful environment and a stressed out model. You did a very nice job with the light here, it just fights with the mood you''re trying to convey.', '2005-05-05 23:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1365001, 172523, 10261, '<td valign="top">Although teenagers can be moody, rebelliousness is a attitude or a behavior pattern. The border seems a bit too think, a large border does offset him from the surroundings, reinforcing the separation he seems to try to create between himself and the viewer.<br/></td>', 'Although teenagers can be moody, rebelliousness is a attitude or a behavior pattern. The border seems a bit too think, a large border does offset him from the surroundings, reinforcing the separation he seems to try to create between himself and the viewer.', '2005-05-05 23:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1365012, 172410, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is a good candid, but it doesn''t convey a mood so much as a lack of emotion. Maybe it''s just the angle of the catchlight, but it looks like your model''s left eye is not focused in the same place as his right eye. The B&amp;W and the light diffused give this image a nice professional feel</td>', 'This is a good candid, but it doesn''t convey a mood so much as a lack of emotion. Maybe it''s just the angle of the catchlight, but it looks like your model''s left eye is not focused in the same place as his right eye. The B&W and the light diffused give this image a nice professional feel', '2005-05-05 23:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1365016, 172373, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the light on the posts and the waterfall, but the dead branches in front of the waterfall and in the bottom right are distracting.</td>', 'I like the light on the posts and the waterfall, but the dead branches in front of the waterfall and in the bottom right are distracting.', '2005-05-05 23:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1365021, 172968, 36469, '<td valign="top">love the tone of the skin against the dark blue and black</td>', 'love the tone of the skin against the dark blue and black', '2005-05-05 23:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1365022, 171048, 10261, '<td valign="top">The hotspot in the top corners are a bit distracting. The DOF seems a bit too narrow.<br/></td>', 'The hotspot in the top corners are a bit distracting. The DOF seems a bit too narrow.', '2005-05-05 23:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1365023, 171163, 36469, '<td valign="top">don''t like the angle much but its still a fun picture</td>', 'don''t like the angle much but its still a fun picture', '2005-05-05 23:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
