(1365047, 172805, 36469, '<td valign="top">would''ve liked it better if the girl in the tank top was looking up towards the sky or at an angle where she can look clearly disatisfied with what they''re talking about</td>', 'would''ve liked it better if the girl in the tank top was looking up towards the sky or at an angle where she can look clearly disatisfied with what they''re talking about', '2005-05-05 23:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1365050, 173020, 25397, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little but too much neat image, seems plasticy</td>', 'Maybe a little but too much neat image, seems plasticy', '2005-05-05 23:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1365051, 170482, 10261, '<td valign="top">The high contrast between the shirt and both the background and the subject''s face seems to dominate the image. If having him wear a different / no shirt is not an option, adjusting the curves or judicious cropping might eliminate this effect. The reddish cast underscores the theme, and the monotones do a good job of bringing out the visual textures in your model''s skin.</td>', 'The high contrast between the shirt and both the background and the subject''s face seems to dominate the image. If having him wear a different / no shirt is not an option, adjusting the curves or judicious cropping might eliminate this effect. The reddish cast underscores the theme, and the monotones do a good job of bringing out the visual textures in your model''s skin.', '2005-05-05 23:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1365052, 172514, 25397, '<td valign="top">Definatly gets the mood across</td>', 'Definatly gets the mood across', '2005-05-05 23:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1365053, 171965, 25397, '<td valign="top">I love your composition</td>', 'I love your composition', '2005-05-05 23:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
