(1365455, 172936, 37423, '<td valign="top">I had a Mrs. Robinson once too.  It brings me back to the good ''ol days.  This is so romantic and unashamed.  I love how there is a familiarity to it for all of us, almost like grade school when the girls were all taller than the boys.  It says so much without showing any facial expressions.  That is real talent.  It''s easy to show a mood using faces, but to show a mood using feet?  Now that is talent!</td>', 'I had a Mrs. Robinson once too.  It brings me back to the good ''ol days.  This is so romantic and unashamed.  I love how there is a familiarity to it for all of us, almost like grade school when the girls were all taller than the boys.  It says so much without showing any facial expressions.  That is real talent.  It''s easy to show a mood using faces, but to show a mood using feet?  Now that is talent!', '2005-05-06 00:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1365461, 170900, 37423, '<td valign="top">Now that is disturbing!  Good job with the lighting.  It''s mysterious and wicked.</td>', 'Now that is disturbing!  Good job with the lighting.  It''s mysterious and wicked.', '2005-05-06 00:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
