(1367569, 172933, 24846, '<td valign="top">"Restlessness and discontent are the necessities of progress". -T.Edison <br/>Artyste, this is great shot that imparts your mood to the viewer. I ove your lighting, almost a gradiant effect across the image. The skull is just too cool. A t first I wished it had been centered in the lens. But the more I look at it the better I like it, almost as if were about to pull off your shades. Good luck on this very fitting and I''m sure ribbon placing submission. -10-</td>', '"Restlessness and discontent are the necessities of progress". -T.Edison Artyste, this is great shot that imparts your mood to the viewer. I ove your lighting, almost a gradiant effect across the image. The skull is just too cool. A t first I wished it had been centered in the lens. But the more I look at it the better I like it, almost as if were about to pull off your shades. Good luck on this very fitting and I''m sure ribbon placing submission. -10-', '2005-05-06 15:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
