(1368460, 172849, 35804, '<td valign="top">LOVE the outfit! the outfit and title make this so nice.</td>', 'LOVE the outfit! the outfit and title make this so nice.', '2005-05-07 00:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368470, 172940, 34134, '<td valign="top">What a unique take on this challenge. DEFINITELY a mood. That broom is at it''s wit''s end! Great colors.  Very sharp and simple composition. A different point of view from outside the box. Good job.</td>', 'What a unique take on this challenge. DEFINITELY a mood. That broom is at it''s wit''s end! Great colors.  Very sharp and simple composition. A different point of view from outside the box. Good job.', '2005-05-07 00:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368832, 172888, 37413, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture!</td>', 'Beautiful picture!', '2005-05-07 02:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368888, 171514, 10261, '<td valign="top">I find the grass in the foreground distracting. Sometimes objects in the foreground add context and give greater significance to the focal point, but that doesn''t seem to be the case here.</td>', 'I find the grass in the foreground distracting. Sometimes objects in the foreground add context and give greater significance to the focal point, but that doesn''t seem to be the case here.', '2005-05-07 03:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368943, 172141, 10261, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this image. The wisp of hair that''s touching her right cheek is fine, but the hair covering her eye is a bit distracting. The bright blue collar of her shirt that''s peeking into the frame leads my eyes out of the image. I like the amount of space below her chin, so burning out the collar would probably be better than a tighter crop. It may just be a trick of the light, but it looks like she''s chewing on her bottom lip. The faint smile and speckled catchlight are great. You did a good job of using the available natural light. The illumination on the dark side of her face is just right (or so it seem on my non-color/brightness calibrated monitor). Did you have to use a reflector, or was this all done with light directly from the window?</td>', 'I really like the composition of this image. The wisp of hair that''s touching her right cheek is fine, but the hair covering her eye is a bit distracting. The bright blue collar of her shirt that''s peeking into the frame leads my eyes out of the image. I like the amount of space below her chin, so burning out the collar would probably be better than a tighter crop. It may just be a trick of the light, but it looks like she''s chewing on her bottom lip. The faint smile and speckled catchlight are great. You did a good job of using the available natural light. The illumination on the dark side of her face is just right (or so it seem on my non-color/brightness calibrated monitor). Did you have to use a reflector, or was this all done with light directly from the window?', '2005-05-07 03:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368955, 172736, 10261, '<td valign="top">Your model seems to have no discernible detail left on their face. I think that this image would have more tension if the person was standing above the steeper-looking edge of the boulder that''s closer to the water.<br/></td>', 'Your model seems to have no discernible detail left on their face. I think that this image would have more tension if the person was standing above the steeper-looking edge of the boulder that''s closer to the water.', '2005-05-07 03:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368968, 172935, 10261, '<td valign="top">The bright side of her face looks a bit overexposed. And the material in the background would be less distracting with a shallower DOF (but that won''t eliminate the door frame and the lamp from behind her head).<br/></td>', 'The bright side of her face looks a bit overexposed. And the material in the background would be less distracting with a shallower DOF (but that won''t eliminate the door frame and the lamp from behind her head).', '2005-05-07 03:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368979, 173046, 10261, '<td valign="top">Since this challenge used advanced editing rules, I probably would have cloned out the branch that''s sticking out of the water just right of center. I like the image, but I''d describe the mood as "calm". Solitude, in my mind, implies that some animal or person should be here enjoying the calm.</td>', 'Since this challenge used advanced editing rules, I probably would have cloned out the branch that''s sticking out of the water just right of center. I like the image, but I''d describe the mood as "calm". Solitude, in my mind, implies that some animal or person should be here enjoying the calm.', '2005-05-07 03:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368985, 172941, 10261, '<td valign="top">The dark color of the lipstick and the conversion to B&amp;W highlight your model''s mouth, which doesn''t seem to be her strongest attribute. The brim of her hat is pulled down too far for my tastes; I''d like to get a better view of her eyes. The catchlight does help to make her eyes stand out better.</td>', 'The dark color of the lipstick and the conversion to B&W highlight your model''s mouth, which doesn''t seem to be her strongest attribute. The brim of her hat is pulled down too far for my tastes; I''d like to get a better view of her eyes. The catchlight does help to make her eyes stand out better.', '2005-05-07 03:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368991, 172928, 10261, '<td valign="top">The poses complement one another, but somehow this still feels too much like a snapshot to me.</td>', 'The poses complement one another, but somehow this still feels too much like a snapshot to me.', '2005-05-07 04:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1368996, 173061, 10261, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually too opinionated about borders, but I find this one very distracting because both the frosted edge and the red box occlude the subject matter.</td>', 'I''m not usually too opinionated about borders, but I find this one very distracting because both the frosted edge and the red box occlude the subject matter.', '2005-05-07 04:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369007, 171542, 10261, '<td valign="top">Even if I considered hunger/desire for food to be a mood, this is still a stretch. The composition would have been stronger without the sink, coffee mug and whatever that brown thing in the bottom corner is.</td>', 'Even if I considered hunger/desire for food to be a mood, this is still a stretch. The composition would have been stronger without the sink, coffee mug and whatever that brown thing in the bottom corner is.', '2005-05-07 04:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369008, 173048, 10261, '<td valign="top">I would liked to have seen more of his eyes.</td>', 'I would liked to have seen more of his eyes.', '2005-05-07 04:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
