(1369242, 172960, 22011, '<td valign="top">How can you say chimping?  Be interestint to see how many people requested DQ on this...  I assume it''s zoom blur?<br/> <br/>The blown-out white jacket/top and sky dectract from an otherwise interesting idea..</td>', 'How can you say chimping?  Be interestint to see how many people requested DQ on this...  I assume it''s zoom blur? The blown-out white jacket/top and sky dectract from an otherwise interesting idea..', '2005-05-07 08:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369247, 172741, 22011, '<td valign="top">A really interesting crop you''ve made here.<br/> <br/>Classical composure technique says that you should space in the picture for a moving object to ''move into'' which you''ve done, but you''ve also lopped off your subject.<br/> <br/>If the person had looked up, and you used the full 640 pixel height allowed this would have been a great shot image..  As it is, only a 6 for me.</td>', 'A really interesting crop you''ve made here. Classical composure technique says that you should space in the picture for a moving object to ''move into'' which you''ve done, but you''ve also lopped off your subject. If the person had looked up, and you used the full 640 pixel height allowed this would have been a great shot image..  As it is, only a 6 for me.', '2005-05-07 08:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369251, 172940, 22011, '<td valign="top">Cool.<br/> <br/>I like it when I look a photo of an every day object and have that moment of ''What they heck?'' before I realise what I''m looking at.<br/> <br/>Great colour, and  focus/exposure.  A creative take on the challenge as well.  7</td>', 'Cool. I like it when I look a photo of an every day object and have that moment of ''What they heck?'' before I realise what I''m looking at. Great colour, and  focus/exposure.  A creative take on the challenge as well.  7', '2005-05-07 08:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
