(1370500, 173063, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photograph, but I fail to see how it conveys a specific mood.</td>', 'This is a nice photograph, but I fail to see how it conveys a specific mood.', '2005-05-08 00:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370518, 172695, 10261, '<td valign="top">The ''if George Lucas did stained glass windows'' perspective doesn''t really work for me. Because of the angle, most of the detail from the windows are so foreshortened that the figures are hard to make out. If you had softened the focus to make this look more abstract I think that I would have liked it better. Shooting something in the foreground (a praying nun, statue, crucifix, etc.) and letting the windows serve as the pallet for the resultant bokeh might have worked even better, as you''d both have a clear subject and still make good use of the colored glass.</td>', 'The ''if George Lucas did stained glass windows'' perspective doesn''t really work for me. Because of the angle, most of the detail from the windows are so foreshortened that the figures are hard to make out. If you had softened the focus to make this look more abstract I think that I would have liked it better. Shooting something in the foreground (a praying nun, statue, crucifix, etc.) and letting the windows serve as the pallet for the resultant bokeh might have worked even better, as you''d both have a clear subject and still make good use of the colored glass.', '2005-05-08 00:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370521, 172929, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks more like ''annoyed'' than ''overwhelmed'' to me.</td>', 'This looks more like ''annoyed'' than ''overwhelmed'' to me.', '2005-05-08 00:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370530, 172689, 10261, '<td valign="top">Although adolescents can certainly be moody, I don''t believe that ''puberty'' qualifies as a mood. A catchlight would have improved this image. As it is I can barely see a difference between his iris and his pupil.</td>', 'Although adolescents can certainly be moody, I don''t believe that ''puberty'' qualifies as a mood. A catchlight would have improved this image. As it is I can barely see a difference between his iris and his pupil.', '2005-05-08 00:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370533, 173066, 10261, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF. I like the detail on the wings. I was going to mark this down because dragonflys can''t smile, but it really does look like this one is.</td>', 'Nice DOF. I like the detail on the wings. I was going to mark this down because dragonflys can''t smile, but it really does look like this one is.', '2005-05-08 00:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370539, 172706, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the use of flesh tones throughout this image. The only thing I think that I''d change is to remove her bracelets; they seem to be the only thing in the picture that doesn''t look organic. There are discolorations on your model''s arms and legs which look like faded bruises. But because of the mood conveyed by the pose, this is probably an asset in this case.</td>', 'I like the use of flesh tones throughout this image. The only thing I think that I''d change is to remove her bracelets; they seem to be the only thing in the picture that doesn''t look organic. There are discolorations on your model''s arms and legs which look like faded bruises. But because of the mood conveyed by the pose, this is probably an asset in this case.', '2005-05-08 00:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370545, 172752, 10261, '<td valign="top">The light is a little bit harsh, and the hand sticking into the right side of the frame leads my eyes out of the image. Since advanced editing was allowed in this challenge and your background is a solid color you might have been better off burning out her hand.</td>', 'The light is a little bit harsh, and the hand sticking into the right side of the frame leads my eyes out of the image. Since advanced editing was allowed in this challenge and your background is a solid color you might have been better off burning out her hand.', '2005-05-08 00:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370546, 173051, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is a really powerful shot. The blurry hair in the foreground is quite distracting, but the subject exemplifies the challenge topic that I''m willing to overlook it. Very nicely done.</td>', 'This is a really powerful shot. The blurry hair in the foreground is quite distracting, but the subject exemplifies the challenge topic that I''m willing to overlook it. Very nicely done.', '2005-05-08 00:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370548, 172482, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks very posed, and therefore not particularly convincing.</td>', 'This looks very posed, and therefore not particularly convincing.', '2005-05-08 00:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370552, 172864, 10261, '<td valign="top">The background is quite distracting, particularly the bright blue thing that leads me to look outside the frame. With a shallower DOF this would have been a better image.</td>', 'The background is quite distracting, particularly the bright blue thing that leads me to look outside the frame. With a shallower DOF this would have been a better image.', '2005-05-08 00:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370554, 172878, 10261, '<td valign="top">It might just be the light, but it looks like the right side of her face is a little too soft, as though the DOF was too narrow.</td>', 'It might just be the light, but it looks like the right side of her face is a little too soft, as though the DOF was too narrow.', '2005-05-08 00:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370560, 172608, 10261, '<td valign="top">The mirror creates an interesting effect. The background is overexposed, but I suppose that that''s what the sky is supposed to look like under these circumstances.</td>', 'The mirror creates an interesting effect. The background is overexposed, but I suppose that that''s what the sky is supposed to look like under these circumstances.', '2005-05-08 00:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370563, 172517, 10261, '<td valign="top">I guess even superheroes have a bad day occasionally. Was there a gel over the lens / light, or was the color shift done in Photoshop?<br/></td>', 'I guess even superheroes have a bad day occasionally. Was there a gel over the lens / light, or was the color shift done in Photoshop?', '2005-05-08 00:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
