(1370574, 172437, 37302, '<td valign="top">This light is too harsh. The photos levels are not good. Hence it is hard to see distinction in the subtle shadows like in her pants. The contrast is weak and overall has a very unprofessional feel to it.</td>', 'This light is too harsh. The photos levels are not good. Hence it is hard to see distinction in the subtle shadows like in her pants. The contrast is weak and overall has a very unprofessional feel to it.', '2005-05-08 00:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
