(1370603, 172203, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is quite a bit softer than I like.</td>', 'This is quite a bit softer than I like.', '2005-05-08 01:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370608, 172437, 10261, '<td valign="top">That may be peaceful, but it certainly doesn''t look like it. The lotus position would have looked more serene. The light isn''t particularly good; I find the strong shadows on the wall behind your model distracting.</td>', 'That may be peaceful, but it certainly doesn''t look like it. The lotus position would have looked more serene. The light isn''t particularly good; I find the strong shadows on the wall behind your model distracting.', '2005-05-08 01:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370610, 173007, 10261, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the close crop of this image. The dark blob in the background behind his left eye is distracting, and leads my eyes out of the frame.</td>', 'I don''t like the close crop of this image. The dark blob in the background behind his left eye is distracting, and leads my eyes out of the frame.', '2005-05-08 01:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370612, 170488, 10261, '<td valign="top">The interesting perspective makes this stand out. The DOF seems a little shallow.</td>', 'The interesting perspective makes this stand out. The DOF seems a little shallow.', '2005-05-08 01:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370613, 171068, 36043, '<td valign="top">The moodes are schizophrenic together, perhaps a bit too busy - maybe a slightly longer shutter would help but you got low blur on the rider.   Like the use of opposites / contrast.  I wonder if this one would work better with the image steady and the rider blurred.  Still interesting and good composition</td>', 'The moodes are schizophrenic together, perhaps a bit too busy - maybe a slightly longer shutter would help but you got low blur on the rider.   Like the use of opposites / contrast.  I wonder if this one would work better with the image steady and the rider blurred.  Still interesting and good composition', '2005-05-08 01:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370621, 173041, 10261, '<td valign="top">Your subject isn''t very well lit. A reflector would have helped to recycle some of the available sunlight for inclusion in your photograph. Because of the angle her left arm actually occupies more area in the picture than her face does.</td>', 'Your subject isn''t very well lit. A reflector would have helped to recycle some of the available sunlight for inclusion in your photograph. Because of the angle her left arm actually occupies more area in the picture than her face does.', '2005-05-08 01:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370625, 172836, 10261, '<td valign="top">The use of a stuffed animal makes it feel as though there was relatively little effort involved in creating this image.  I like the reflection of his face in the piano.</td>', 'The use of a stuffed animal makes it feel as though there was relatively little effort involved in creating this image.  I like the reflection of his face in the piano.', '2005-05-08 01:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370634, 172933, 10261, '<td valign="top">The skull reflected in the glasses makes this seem needlessly contrived. Given the intended mood, using harsher lighting might have helped make your model look a bit more menacing.</td>', 'The skull reflected in the glasses makes this seem needlessly contrived. Given the intended mood, using harsher lighting might have helped make your model look a bit more menacing.', '2005-05-08 01:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370685, 172492, 36043, '<td valign="top">Wow, a lot going on behind the eyes.  Decisive moment! <br/>Just my opinion, but on this image getting the eyes a little closer to the thirds might make the image more cohesive and powerful (keeping the viewers eye roaming inside the image) - To do this seems like you''d best frame more space in front about 20% and a tad more above.  Definitely don''t want to lose the strong diagonals by cropping the bottom. <br/>Overall, great image.</td>', 'Wow, a lot going on behind the eyes.  Decisive moment! Just my opinion, but on this image getting the eyes a little closer to the thirds might make the image more cohesive and powerful (keeping the viewers eye roaming inside the image) - To do this seems like you''d best frame more space in front about 20% and a tad more above.  Definitely don''t want to lose the strong diagonals by cropping the bottom. Overall, great image.', '2005-05-08 01:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370690, 171851, 28070, '<td valign="top">I like the effect on the outside and the kind of darkness to it.</td>', 'I like the effect on the outside and the kind of darkness to it.', '2005-05-08 01:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370751, 173038, 31534, '<td valign="top">Has anyone mentioned this looks a bit like George Bush..&lt;G&gt;</td>', 'Has anyone mentioned this looks a bit like George Bush..<G>', '2005-05-08 02:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370819, 172746, 10261, '<td valign="top">I think that the original shot may have been good, but I dislike the editing that was done to it. I find the Photoshopped halo particularly distracting.</td>', 'I think that the original shot may have been good, but I dislike the editing that was done to it. I find the Photoshopped halo particularly distracting.', '2005-05-08 04:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370820, 172909, 10261, '<td valign="top">I think that if the kid had been more in focus this would have conveyed a stronger mood. Even so, this is still a solid entry.</td>', 'I think that if the kid had been more in focus this would have conveyed a stronger mood. Even so, this is still a solid entry.', '2005-05-08 04:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370861, 172746, 22011, '<td valign="top">This by itself is a nice photo, but I personally think you''ve got a little over the top with the dodge&amp;burn...<br/> <br/>Possibly some curves work, and using a flash to fill in the shadows in front of the boy would have worked better?</td>', 'This by itself is a nice photo, but I personally think you''ve got a little over the top with the dodge&burn... Possibly some curves work, and using a flash to fill in the shadows in front of the boy would have worked better?', '2005-05-08 06:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370862, 172554, 32161, '<td valign="top">beautiful. 9</td>', 'beautiful. 9', '2005-05-08 06:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370863, 173014, 22011, '<td valign="top">This is a really different point of view, and the exposure is bang on. My only gripe would be that it needs a bit of slective sharpening on the eye..  I know you''re title is nostalgic, and one might thing that older photos didn''t look tack sharp, but I htink it''d help the image quite a bit..  <br/> <br/>Still an interesting shot...  7</td>', 'This is a really different point of view, and the exposure is bang on. My only gripe would be that it needs a bit of slective sharpening on the eye..  I know you''re title is nostalgic, and one might thing that older photos didn''t look tack sharp, but I htink it''d help the image quite a bit..   Still an interesting shot...  7', '2005-05-08 06:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370864, 171447, 22011, '<td valign="top">Back to comment...  I really like this shot.  And an intersting title you''ve chosen as well.<br/> <br/>The composition is great, and the negative space really lifts the image when you consider your title.<br/> <br/>The only distraction I find is the complex strap/clothing on her shoulder.  The rest of the image is so gentle, quite almost, and that item is very fiddly and detailed.<br/> <br/>Well taken..  9</td>', 'Back to comment...  I really like this shot.  And an intersting title you''ve chosen as well. The composition is great, and the negative space really lifts the image when you consider your title. The only distraction I find is the complex strap/clothing on her shoulder.  The rest of the image is so gentle, quite almost, and that item is very fiddly and detailed. Well taken..  9', '2005-05-08 06:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370865, 171851, 22011, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the blurred border, but I really like this image...<br/> <br/>In the use of your editing, and the original lighting conditions you''ve given the statue a downtrodden feel that works really well with your title.<br/> <br/>I hope people vote for this image based on the image, and not on the religeous issues.  8</td>', 'Not a fan of the blurred border, but I really like this image... In the use of your editing, and the original lighting conditions you''ve given the statue a downtrodden feel that works really well with your title. I hope people vote for this image based on the image, and not on the religeous issues.  8', '2005-05-08 06:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370866, 172748, 22011, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait....<br/> <br/>This is nicely exposed, and the skin tone are great.<br/> <br/>I find the fingers a little distracting,  as they are lighter than the arm and face.  Also the dirtry nails are a little annoying, as you''ve gone to so much trouble with the face makeup.  How did this look withou the hand showing, just the head resting on her shoulder?  It might not have workedso well.<br/> <br/>Well done... 8<br/></td>', 'Nice portrait.... This is nicely exposed, and the skin tone are great. I find the fingers a little distracting,  as they are lighter than the arm and face.  Also the dirtry nails are a little annoying, as you''ve gone to so much trouble with the face makeup.  How did this look withou the hand showing, just the head resting on her shoulder?  It might not have workedso well. Well done... 8', '2005-05-08 06:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
