(1370978, 172413, 34192, '<td valign="top">love this image. my partiality to humans in B&amp;W could be the reason.  But I also think you did a great job with a very full background.  The black tree balances the white shirt.  The clutter in front of the man balances the clutter behind him.  A lot of depth in this image keeps it from being static.  The texture in the garbage bags in front even adds. Very well done. 9 from me and good luck!</td>', 'love this image. my partiality to humans in B&W could be the reason.  But I also think you did a great job with a very full background.  The black tree balances the white shirt.  The clutter in front of the man balances the clutter behind him.  A lot of depth in this image keeps it from being static.  The texture in the garbage bags in front even adds. Very well done. 9 from me and good luck!', '2005-05-08 09:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370981, 172974, 34192, '<td valign="top">love this image.  Probably the pure human emotion.  Hope this does well.  I could say crop here or change this or do this - but the moment you captured overwhelms everything else in the image and I think it should be just as it is. well done.9</td>', 'love this image.  Probably the pure human emotion.  Hope this does well.  I could say crop here or change this or do this - but the moment you captured overwhelms everything else in the image and I think it should be just as it is. well done.9', '2005-05-08 09:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
