(1371343, 171910, 34247, '<td valign="top">a 10 for me with sharper focus on the eyes, and a less "soft" look, which might work well in some portraits but in this particular case feels less effective for me. so overall, a 9.</td>', 'a 10 for me with sharper focus on the eyes, and a less "soft" look, which might work well in some portraits but in this particular case feels less effective for me. so overall, a 9.', '2005-05-08 16:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
