(1371347, 172468, 34247, '<td valign="top">whacky, brilliant colors, great focus on the eyes. light glare on left upper could be a bit of an issue. 8 at first pass, but bumping to 10.</td>', 'whacky, brilliant colors, great focus on the eyes. light glare on left upper could be a bit of an issue. 8 at first pass, but bumping to 10.', '2005-05-08 16:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371348, 172402, 34247, '<td valign="top">just what did ya do to the poor child? like the reflective tongue a lot, the tones and cast of the image works well. great expression. 8 at first pass, but the thumbnail grabs me for a second and third look, and bumping to 10 instead.</td>', 'just what did ya do to the poor child? like the reflective tongue a lot, the tones and cast of the image works well. great expression. 8 at first pass, but the thumbnail grabs me for a second and third look, and bumping to 10 instead.', '2005-05-08 16:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371350, 172517, 34247, '<td valign="top">very nice take, imho. the expression is clear, the focus on the eyes through the goggles is great, the dof is right on. perhaps a bit much light on the face? I do like the blue cast as well. 8 at first pass, going to 9.</td>', 'very nice take, imho. the expression is clear, the focus on the eyes through the goggles is great, the dof is right on. perhaps a bit much light on the face? I do like the blue cast as well. 8 at first pass, going to 9.', '2005-05-08 16:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371351, 173016, 34508, '<td valign="top">a bit unsharp + too much noise.  nice setup though.</td>', 'a bit unsharp + too much noise.  nice setup though.', '2005-05-08 16:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371352, 172141, 34247, '<td valign="top">crisp clear eyes, and that is a key positive attribute for me. the dof is very nice as well.</td>', 'crisp clear eyes, and that is a key positive attribute for me. the dof is very nice as well.', '2005-05-08 16:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371353, 172615, 34247, '<td valign="top">great sentiment, colors and lighting. 9</td>', 'great sentiment, colors and lighting. 9', '2005-05-08 16:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371355, 172514, 34247, '<td valign="top">i feel this would be more effective with the entire body, including feet showing, and a crop that shows a bit of blue sky to show higher elevation. the green of the tree poses a small distraction issue, imho. 8</td>', 'i feel this would be more effective with the entire body, including feet showing, and a crop that shows a bit of blue sky to show higher elevation. the green of the tree poses a small distraction issue, imho. 8', '2005-05-08 16:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371356, 172413, 34247, '<td valign="top">burning on the whites? if so, nice. 8 on first pass, but going to 9 on second.</td>', 'burning on the whites? if so, nice. 8 on first pass, but going to 9 on second.', '2005-05-08 16:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371359, 172787, 34247, '<td valign="top">feels a bit on the plastic side, perhaps with the use of noise reduction software? correct me if i''m wrong. I do like the pose and composition a lot. 8</td>', 'feels a bit on the plastic side, perhaps with the use of noise reduction software? correct me if i''m wrong. I do like the pose and composition a lot. 8', '2005-05-08 16:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371360, 171867, 35513, '<td valign="top">These are some of my favorite days!  When the sun breaks through parts in the cloud and just bathes the ground...I have always wanted to capture that, and you''ve done it very well!  I love the lighting in this photo and the different lines in the horizon.  Great shot!</td>', 'These are some of my favorite days!  When the sun breaks through parts in the cloud and just bathes the ground...I have always wanted to capture that, and you''ve done it very well!  I love the lighting in this photo and the different lines in the horizon.  Great shot!', '2005-05-08 16:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371362, 172554, 34247, '<td valign="top">nice serene mood enchanced by the playing with tones, colors and lighting. 8 on first pass, but going to 9 on second.</td>', 'nice serene mood enchanced by the playing with tones, colors and lighting. 8 on first pass, but going to 9 on second.', '2005-05-08 16:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371363, 172410, 35513, '<td valign="top">Poor little guy!  Great job on this shot though!!  The focus on the eyes is excellent...they reall pop out from the screen.  The expression on his face is well captured.  Lighting looks good, contrast looks good.  Nice job!</td>', 'Poor little guy!  Great job on this shot though!!  The focus on the eyes is excellent...they reall pop out from the screen.  The expression on his face is well captured.  Lighting looks good, contrast looks good.  Nice job!', '2005-05-08 16:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371368, 171844, 35513, '<td valign="top">A very serene photo.  Good lighting, nice contrast.  There''s a space between two of the stones that looks larger than  between the others, but I don''t think many other people will notice that :-)  They''ll be too busy looking at the model.  Great shot.</td>', 'A very serene photo.  Good lighting, nice contrast.  There''s a space between two of the stones that looks larger than  between the others, but I don''t think many other people will notice that :-)  They''ll be too busy looking at the model.  Great shot.', '2005-05-08 16:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371369, 171780, 34247, '<td valign="top">beautiful moody reflection. to my eyes, the stones on the right center seems a bit off, though. 7. bumping to 8</td>', 'beautiful moody reflection. to my eyes, the stones on the right center seems a bit off, though. 7. bumping to 8', '2005-05-08 16:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371372, 172402, 35513, '<td valign="top">This is priceless!  For anyone who''s ever seen this face on a child...you''ve just done a marvelous job capturing it.  Good focus on the eye area.</td>', 'This is priceless!  For anyone who''s ever seen this face on a child...you''ve just done a marvelous job capturing it.  Good focus on the eye area.', '2005-05-08 16:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371374, 172441, 34247, '<td valign="top">I like the overall shot. Nice enough lighting, except for the slight flare around the head. I feel the shadow on the bass body is a bit of a distraction, and a more lit face would be more effective. 6 but bumping to 8 on second pass, after finding myself liking this a lot more than 6.</td>', 'I like the overall shot. Nice enough lighting, except for the slight flare around the head. I feel the shadow on the bass body is a bit of a distraction, and a more lit face would be more effective. 6 but bumping to 8 on second pass, after finding myself liking this a lot more than 6.', '2005-05-08 16:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371375, 171918, 35513, '<td valign="top">I really like the lines and shadows in this shot.  The lighting totally sets the mood!  Well done!! :-)</td>', 'I really like the lines and shadows in this shot.  The lighting totally sets the mood!  Well done!! :-)', '2005-05-08 16:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371378, 172754, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of field in this shot.  The lighting from the window seems a little harsh at first....but after a moment it fits in perfectly with the mood of the shot.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the depth of field in this shot.  The lighting from the window seems a little harsh at first....but after a moment it fits in perfectly with the mood of the shot.  Well done.', '2005-05-08 16:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371380, 172790, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!!!  I love the small streak of sun along the top of the horizon.  The mist is just beautiful....simply a stunning photo.</td>', 'Beautiful colors!!!  I love the small streak of sun along the top of the horizon.  The mist is just beautiful....simply a stunning photo.', '2005-05-08 16:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371386, 172970, 35513, '<td valign="top">Definitely a mood amongst many cats!!!  I''m not sure if it''s because of the soft texture of the cat hair....but there are parts around the edges of the cat that look a little out of focus.  This is a very tight crop, almost portrait style...I wonder if we might have more to look at if the crop was a little less tight.  Good job being there at the right moment :-)  My cat gives me this look 5 times a day!</td>', 'Definitely a mood amongst many cats!!!  I''m not sure if it''s because of the soft texture of the cat hair....but there are parts around the edges of the cat that look a little out of focus.  This is a very tight crop, almost portrait style...I wonder if we might have more to look at if the crop was a little less tight.  Good job being there at the right moment :-)  My cat gives me this look 5 times a day!', '2005-05-08 16:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371390, 172679, 35513, '<td valign="top">This is a really good shot, technically.  Everything is crisp and clear, there are tons of textures, plenty of colors.  I love the spray of water around the car!  I''m not sure if it give me a sense of exhilarations as a mood.....but it IS a really well taken shot!  I love the road going off to the back right.  Everything is very well positioned.</td>', 'This is a really good shot, technically.  Everything is crisp and clear, there are tons of textures, plenty of colors.  I love the spray of water around the car!  I''m not sure if it give me a sense of exhilarations as a mood.....but it IS a really well taken shot!  I love the road going off to the back right.  Everything is very well positioned.', '2005-05-08 16:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371392, 173038, 35513, '<td valign="top">This shot is clearly in focus.  It is a VERY tight crop....I think it might work better if it weren''t quite so close up.  The eyes are a little off center from left to right.  Great focus though!  And the lighting is nice too.  Contrast/brightness looks good.</td>', 'This shot is clearly in focus.  It is a VERY tight crop....I think it might work better if it weren''t quite so close up.  The eyes are a little off center from left to right.  Great focus though!  And the lighting is nice too.  Contrast/brightness looks good.', '2005-05-08 16:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371394, 172179, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good colors, good focus and clarity.</td>', 'Good colors, good focus and clarity.', '2005-05-08 16:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371395, 171885, 35513, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure what this is.....hmmm.  The lighting is well done and Iike the background quite a bit.  Good focus and clarity.</td>', 'Not quite sure what this is.....hmmm.  The lighting is well done and Iike the background quite a bit.  Good focus and clarity.', '2005-05-08 16:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371398, 172759, 35513, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this shot is well done.  But I think that the filter distracts from setting the mood of this photo.  Placement of the subject looks good as well.</td>', 'The lighting on this shot is well done.  But I think that the filter distracts from setting the mood of this photo.  Placement of the subject looks good as well.', '2005-05-08 16:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371404, 172982, 35513, '<td valign="top">This shot is very clearly in focus...good job!  I think that I might like to see the face turned the other way, with the nose pointing down towards us.  It just seems like that might lead the eye better.  And at first I thought I might like to see it in color, but after looking more, the lighting comes out so nicely with the black and white.  And you have good contrast as well.</td>', 'This shot is very clearly in focus...good job!  I think that I might like to see the face turned the other way, with the nose pointing down towards us.  It just seems like that might lead the eye better.  And at first I thought I might like to see it in color, but after looking more, the lighting comes out so nicely with the black and white.  And you have good contrast as well.', '2005-05-08 16:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371406, 172878, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the placement of the subject.  Lighting looks pretty good, focus looks good as well.</td>', 'I like the placement of the subject.  Lighting looks pretty good, focus looks good as well.', '2005-05-08 16:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371413, 173051, 35513, '<td valign="top">This is a great expression captured!!  However, it seems a little distracting because it appears as though it was taken through a window.  The reflections casting back on the image which is your subject tends to blur.  She has such a great expression on her face, I just hate to see it marred by reflections!  Good focus and clarity!</td>', 'This is a great expression captured!!  However, it seems a little distracting because it appears as though it was taken through a window.  The reflections casting back on the image which is your subject tends to blur.  She has such a great expression on her face, I just hate to see it marred by reflections!  Good focus and clarity!', '2005-05-08 16:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371419, 171514, 35513, '<td valign="top">I am totally in love with sunset photos :-)  This one has some great colors.  I wonder if the depth of field was set to focus on the small stream, how that would change the mood of this shot.  I love the mist and clouds rolling over the hills.</td>', 'I am totally in love with sunset photos :-)  This one has some great colors.  I wonder if the depth of field was set to focus on the small stream, how that would change the mood of this shot.  I love the mist and clouds rolling over the hills.', '2005-05-08 16:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371425, 172935, 35513, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful girl!  I love her eyes, very expressive.  The lighting on the left side of her face seems a little bit harsh as compared with her right side.  The light on the right still shows all of the detail of her face without washing it out at all.</td>', 'What a beautiful girl!  I love her eyes, very expressive.  The lighting on the left side of her face seems a little bit harsh as compared with her right side.  The light on the right still shows all of the detail of her face without washing it out at all.', '2005-05-08 16:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371427, 172780, 35513, '<td valign="top">Placement of subject is good.  Lighting looks fine to me.  However, the image looks blurry and indistinct.  Perhaps it is a pixel issue rather than a moving camera issue.  I like the arm in the shot, but the top of the head is cut off, which is a bit distracting to me.</td>', 'Placement of subject is good.  Lighting looks fine to me.  However, the image looks blurry and indistinct.  Perhaps it is a pixel issue rather than a moving camera issue.  I like the arm in the shot, but the top of the head is cut off, which is a bit distracting to me.', '2005-05-08 16:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371431, 173041, 35513, '<td valign="top">A different angle might work better on this shot.  Here, it almost appears that the arm is the focus of the shot, though it''s clear that the head should be.  But because the head is farther away and smaller...our eye gets drawn to the arm.</td>', 'A different angle might work better on this shot.  Here, it almost appears that the arm is the focus of the shot, though it''s clear that the head should be.  But because the head is farther away and smaller...our eye gets drawn to the arm.', '2005-05-08 16:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371435, 171408, 35513, '<td valign="top">GREAT focus on the laugh!  There are only two things I would suggest about this photo.  1--I know the laugh is the focus, but it''s somewhat disturbing that the top of your model''s head is missing :-)  2--There is a reflection on the wall to the left of the subject, possibly from a lamp or the flash.  Not sure what can be done about this, but it makes a distracting spot.  The lighting is SO good on the face, I hate to have my eye drawn away!!!</td>', 'GREAT focus on the laugh!  There are only two things I would suggest about this photo.  1--I know the laugh is the focus, but it''s somewhat disturbing that the top of your model''s head is missing :-)  2--There is a reflection on the wall to the left of the subject, possibly from a lamp or the flash.  Not sure what can be done about this, but it makes a distracting spot.  The lighting is SO good on the face, I hate to have my eye drawn away!!!', '2005-05-08 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371436, 172899, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors in this photo....the longer I look at it, the more mood it evokes.  Great shillouette on the horse....bumping way up!</td>', 'Beautiful colors in this photo....the longer I look at it, the more mood it evokes.  Great shillouette on the horse....bumping way up!', '2005-05-08 16:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371438, 173032, 35513, '<td valign="top">I REALLY like the colors and lighting in this shot.  This is one of the better shots I''ve seen, but it distracts me that the focus appears to be on her feet, rather than on her head or even back.  The little toes are so clearly in focus!!  I think perhaps that it is a depth of field issue and that changing your aperture setting may help resolve it.  Great clear shot!!</td>', 'I REALLY like the colors and lighting in this shot.  This is one of the better shots I''ve seen, but it distracts me that the focus appears to be on her feet, rather than on her head or even back.  The little toes are so clearly in focus!!  I think perhaps that it is a depth of field issue and that changing your aperture setting may help resolve it.  Great clear shot!!', '2005-05-08 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371442, 172586, 35513, '<td valign="top">GREAT expression on the face of this young man.  However, the lighting seems a little bit harsh.  It''s ok to have some shadows...they''ll help show the lines of the face and express the mood.  What an adorable little fella though!!  Sure hope he found something to do!</td>', 'GREAT expression on the face of this young man.  However, the lighting seems a little bit harsh.  It''s ok to have some shadows...they''ll help show the lines of the face and express the mood.  What an adorable little fella though!!  Sure hope he found something to do!', '2005-05-08 16:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371449, 173055, 35513, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the colors in this photo.  Great job capturing a beautiful moment!!  The shillouette of the rock and the person are very strong, but not overpowering.  The reflections in the water are absolutely gorgeous.  Bumping up!</td>', 'I absolutely love the colors in this photo.  Great job capturing a beautiful moment!!  The shillouette of the rock and the person are very strong, but not overpowering.  The reflections in the water are absolutely gorgeous.  Bumping up!', '2005-05-08 16:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371452, 172846, 35513, '<td valign="top">The lighting for this shot is excellent.  And what a lovely model!  However, I think I would like it better if the veil covered either BOTH of the eyes, or just ONE of the eyes.  She has such beautiful eyes to begin with...I find it sad to not show them off.  But you''re going for veiled sadness, so that''s cool...the only thing that distracts me is the small portion of the right eye which is not behind the veil.</td>', 'The lighting for this shot is excellent.  And what a lovely model!  However, I think I would like it better if the veil covered either BOTH of the eyes, or just ONE of the eyes.  She has such beautiful eyes to begin with...I find it sad to not show them off.  But you''re going for veiled sadness, so that''s cool...the only thing that distracts me is the small portion of the right eye which is not behind the veil.', '2005-05-08 16:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371454, 173016, 35513, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting of this shot.  I also dig on the softness....some people might rip into you for it, but I think that it really helps set the mood here.  The texture of the blanket vs. the couch is great!</td>', 'I love the lighting of this shot.  I also dig on the softness....some people might rip into you for it, but I think that it really helps set the mood here.  The texture of the blanket vs. the couch is great!', '2005-05-08 16:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371460, 172398, 35513, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  Great lighting, great model.  Wonderful texture, focus, everything.  Good job.</td>', 'Love this shot.  Great lighting, great model.  Wonderful texture, focus, everything.  Good job.', '2005-05-08 16:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371462, 172941, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great expression and great shot!  The lighting seems a little strong in some areas, but other than that, extremely well shot!</td>', 'Great expression and great shot!  The lighting seems a little strong in some areas, but other than that, extremely well shot!', '2005-05-08 16:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371465, 172608, 35513, '<td valign="top">I really like this pic a lot!  What a lovely model!!!  I like how there''s a reflection underneath the surgace.  Lighting looks good, focus looks good!  Great shot!</td>', 'I really like this pic a lot!  What a lovely model!!!  I like how there''s a reflection underneath the surgace.  Lighting looks good, focus looks good!  Great shot!', '2005-05-08 16:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371468, 171540, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful serene colors!!!  I really like this shot quite a bit.  The softness that you''ve given it really helps to set the mood.</td>', 'Beautiful serene colors!!!  I really like this shot quite a bit.  The softness that you''ve given it really helps to set the mood.', '2005-05-08 16:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371472, 171068, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!  Not an easy shot to take, but you''ve done it well.  And it really does express the freedom of the rider.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice capture!  Not an easy shot to take, but you''ve done it well.  And it really does express the freedom of the rider.  Well done.', '2005-05-08 16:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371474, 172931, 35513, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photo.  It really sets the mood.  The lighting is beautiful...the movement of the water is fantastic!!  Bumping up even more!</td>', 'This is a wonderful photo.  It really sets the mood.  The lighting is beautiful...the movement of the water is fantastic!!  Bumping up even more!', '2005-05-08 16:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371477, 172536, 9581, '<td valign="top">Defanetly having fun, a good expression too... The things in the background are a bit distracting though they are a part of the game, I think this could be neat if you was to move slightly to the left and capture more of the side lines of the field or perhaps a tighter crop... Maybe even the pitcher and umpire included would be a good shot... 8</td>', 'Defanetly having fun, a good expression too... The things in the background are a bit distracting though they are a part of the game, I think this could be neat if you was to move slightly to the left and capture more of the side lines of the field or perhaps a tighter crop... Maybe even the pitcher and umpire included would be a good shot... 8', '2005-05-08 17:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371491, 172771, 31244, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I''m not sure whether I like the camoflauge textures of the birds or whether more contrast would help. But it still captures moods well. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice. I''m not sure whether I like the camoflauge textures of the birds or whether more contrast would help. But it still captures moods well. Good job.', '2005-05-08 17:15:20.000000', NULL, 1);
