(1371748, 172972, 8860, '<td valign="top">It''s gratifying to see someone use the challenge to make a powerful point. It may well be a natural forest fire, but most of them are man made. Worse still it good be an eroded climate or man-made destruction.<br/> <br/>Whatever the story, not only is this a great photo (technically and aesthetically) it is also a supreme piece of photojournalism and indeed a depressing one. I share your mood at this scene and hope you win this challenge. [10]</td>', 'It''s gratifying to see someone use the challenge to make a powerful point. It may well be a natural forest fire, but most of them are man made. Worse still it good be an eroded climate or man-made destruction. Whatever the story, not only is this a great photo (technically and aesthetically) it is also a supreme piece of photojournalism and indeed a depressing one. I share your mood at this scene and hope you win this challenge. [10]', '2005-05-08 20:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371753, 171999, 8860, '<td valign="top">It''s a great star isn''t it - the sun? Billions of hydrogen bombs going off every second, whiplashes of blazing magnetic tornados larger than the earth, whirling nuclear storms of unfathomable violence - and yet here it all looks so serene! Always delivering suprises, wonderment and celestial glory that ball of fire - I love it. <br/> <br/>Good rays (perhaps a tad over-smoothed) and definitely the kind of scene that humbles me too.</td>', 'It''s a great star isn''t it - the sun? Billions of hydrogen bombs going off every second, whiplashes of blazing magnetic tornados larger than the earth, whirling nuclear storms of unfathomable violence - and yet here it all looks so serene! Always delivering suprises, wonderment and celestial glory that ball of fire - I love it.  Good rays (perhaps a tad over-smoothed) and definitely the kind of scene that humbles me too.', '2005-05-08 20:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371766, 172401, 8860, '<td valign="top">Always calming for me. Surrounding rocks a re a touch gloomy but it''s still a very attractive scene.</td>', 'Always calming for me. Surrounding rocks a re a touch gloomy but it''s still a very attractive scene.', '2005-05-08 20:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371770, 172939, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great capture (if a tad small) and he does look moody too! Wonderful creature.</td>', 'Great capture (if a tad small) and he does look moody too! Wonderful creature.', '2005-05-08 20:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371777, 172857, 8860, '<td valign="top">So is this a silly mood then? Because it looks like my normal mood to me - and a perfect reflection of me at work. A nice twist on the mood thing (ie, a kind of lack of overt, defined mood but a rather daft one nonetheless). Entertaining photo.</td>', 'So is this a silly mood then? Because it looks like my normal mood to me - and a perfect reflection of me at work. A nice twist on the mood thing (ie, a kind of lack of overt, defined mood but a rather daft one nonetheless). Entertaining photo.', '2005-05-08 20:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
