(1371821, 173055, 9668, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. Looks like a shot of Zoomdak''s...or maybe a shot of Zoomdak! ;D Nice capture you got, way to take advantage of the situation. The title bothers me, would be better if it were "Looking Out to Sea" or something like that, lol. The quality of the save might be better, there is a bit of bitmapping/noise (like in the cloud). Nice composition, sits well on the rule of thirds. Overall: Well, what can I say? It is a picture of me in my "natural habitat" lol.</td>', 'Interesting subject. Looks like a shot of Zoomdak''s...or maybe a shot of Zoomdak! ;D Nice capture you got, way to take advantage of the situation. The title bothers me, would be better if it were "Looking Out to Sea" or something like that, lol. The quality of the save might be better, there is a bit of bitmapping/noise (like in the cloud). Nice composition, sits well on the rule of thirds. Overall: Well, what can I say? It is a picture of me in my "natural habitat" lol.', '2005-05-08 21:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
