(1371844, 172079, 9668, '<td valign="top">It seems like I have seen this elsewhere =). The french title, the vailidation, the lillies, the glowing, the off color. The question is? Is this the work of our suspect...or an imposter? (from a Gary Larson comic).  I love the beams of light coming out of the one. The composition is beautiful with the 3 lillies, great job!</td>', 'It seems like I have seen this elsewhere =). The french title, the vailidation, the lillies, the glowing, the off color. The question is? Is this the work of our suspect...or an imposter? (from a Gary Larson comic).  I love the beams of light coming out of the one. The composition is beautiful with the 3 lillies, great job!', '2005-05-08 21:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371845, 173007, 37529, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  He is certainly a happy Samurai.</td>', 'I like this shot.  He is certainly a happy Samurai.', '2005-05-08 21:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371846, 172986, 9668, '<td valign="top">You have really capture the charecter in this shot! Awesome job.</td>', 'You have really capture the charecter in this shot! Awesome job.', '2005-05-08 21:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371847, 172525, 9668, '<td valign="top">Emotive capture! I''m guessing DPC won''t really like it: little bit blurry, grainy. I really like it though. The emotion is very strong, the eye speaks deeply, the title fits into it all. Great job!</td>', 'Emotive capture! I''m guessing DPC won''t really like it: little bit blurry, grainy. I really like it though. The emotion is very strong, the eye speaks deeply, the title fits into it all. Great job!', '2005-05-08 21:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371848, 171068, 37529, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  The blur around the bike rider sets the motion but the rider is in perfect focus.  Good effect.</td>', 'Nice job.  The blur around the bike rider sets the motion but the rider is in perfect focus.  Good effect.', '2005-05-08 21:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371850, 172713, 37529, '<td valign="top">Striking! I like this shot.  Very effective for mood.</td>', 'Striking! I like this shot.  Very effective for mood.', '2005-05-08 21:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371857, 172508, 37529, '<td valign="top">The contract between the B&amp;W and colour is a good effect.  Sets the mood nicely I think.  The bright Yellow flowers is a good focal point too.</td>', 'The contract between the B&W and colour is a good effect.  Sets the mood nicely I think.  The bright Yellow flowers is a good focal point too.', '2005-05-08 21:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371858, 172787, 37529, '<td valign="top">Happy and sad.  Both eyes say happy but that''s a good thing.  Good shot.</td>', 'Happy and sad.  Both eyes say happy but that''s a good thing.  Good shot.', '2005-05-08 21:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371861, 172885, 37529, '<td valign="top">Vibrant colours.  Kind of Norman Rockwell like.</td>', 'Vibrant colours.  Kind of Norman Rockwell like.', '2005-05-08 22:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371863, 172443, 37529, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  Brother and sister says it all.</td>', 'I like this shot.  Brother and sister says it all.', '2005-05-08 22:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371865, 172739, 37529, '<td valign="top">No happy faces here.</td>', 'No happy faces here.', '2005-05-08 22:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
