(1371913, 172931, 30861, '<td valign="top">One of the few shots that integrates person and landscape into an effective mood capture, as opposed to modd-evoker. Good work!</td>', 'One of the few shots that integrates person and landscape into an effective mood capture, as opposed to modd-evoker. Good work!', '2005-05-08 22:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371914, 173028, 30861, '<td valign="top">I like this abstract approach very much, although it evokes a mood more than it captures one, IMO.</td>', 'I like this abstract approach very much, although it evokes a mood more than it captures one, IMO.', '2005-05-08 22:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371916, 172536, 37529, '<td valign="top">Lots of joy in this shot.  Good job.</td>', 'Lots of joy in this shot.  Good job.', '2005-05-08 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371917, 172754, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nicely gritty, real feeling</td>', 'Nicely gritty, real feeling', '2005-05-08 22:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371918, 172888, 37529, '<td valign="top">Nice close up and excellent focus.</td>', 'Nice close up and excellent focus.', '2005-05-08 22:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371920, 173035, 37529, '<td valign="top">Light at the end of the tunnel comes to mind.  Doesn''t seem haunted to me but I like the shot.</td>', 'Light at the end of the tunnel comes to mind.  Doesn''t seem haunted to me but I like the shot.', '2005-05-08 22:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371922, 173066, 6519, '<td valign="top">Everytime I look at this guy, I go through a number of moods/emotions... I am fascinated, repulsed, amazed, intrigued etc...... but I always end up smiling with him/her. Awesome closeup - detail, light and colors are stunning.</td>', 'Everytime I look at this guy, I go through a number of moods/emotions... I am fascinated, repulsed, amazed, intrigued etc...... but I always end up smiling with him/her. Awesome closeup - detail, light and colors are stunning.', '2005-05-08 22:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371924, 173058, 37529, '<td valign="top">A childs happy face is always a winner.  This shot is no exception.  Nice shot.</td>', 'A childs happy face is always a winner.  This shot is no exception.  Nice shot.', '2005-05-08 22:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371926, 172079, 6519, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light. The noise (for want of a better word) adds to it. Love it</td>', 'Wonderful light. The noise (for want of a better word) adds to it. Love it', '2005-05-08 22:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371929, 171514, 37529, '<td valign="top">Lots of  blur.  Sharper focus may have served this shot better?</td>', 'Lots of  blur.  Sharper focus may have served this shot better?', '2005-05-08 22:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371935, 172752, 37529, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Makes me smile too.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Makes me smile too.', '2005-05-08 22:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371943, 172381, 37529, '<td valign="top">Lots of atmosphere in this shot.  Very romantic too.  Dinner for two!</td>', 'Lots of atmosphere in this shot.  Very romantic too.  Dinner for two!', '2005-05-08 22:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371946, 172805, 37529, '<td valign="top">Nice perpective from the ground looking up.</td>', 'Nice perpective from the ground looking up.', '2005-05-08 22:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371952, 172437, 6519, '<td valign="top">I like the inclusion of the yoga poster, but I don''t care for the harsh flash shadow.</td>', 'I like the inclusion of the yoga poster, but I don''t care for the harsh flash shadow.', '2005-05-08 22:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371953, 172834, 37529, '<td valign="top">This shot will come back to haunt her in twenty years.  Very amuzing, makes me smile.</td>', 'This shot will come back to haunt her in twenty years.  Very amuzing, makes me smile.', '2005-05-08 22:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371954, 173067, 37529, '<td valign="top">Makes me laugh.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Makes me laugh.  Nice shot.', '2005-05-08 22:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371962, 172748, 6519, '<td valign="top">This is so much more than just a person with a sad face. The make-up is lovely, the sad-puppy-dog face is priceless, the dark hair/clothes/background and careful lighting set the scene very well.</td>', 'This is so much more than just a person with a sad face. The make-up is lovely, the sad-puppy-dog face is priceless, the dark hair/clothes/background and careful lighting set the scene very well.', '2005-05-08 22:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371970, 172435, 37529, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  The colors and set-up with the candels, neglige and  flowers says it all.</td>', 'Nicely done.  The colors and set-up with the candels, neglige and  flowers says it all.', '2005-05-08 22:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371983, 173066, 37529, '<td valign="top">Different.  I see the happy face.  Good Macro shot.  The intricacies of the wing reallystand out.</td>', 'Different.  I see the happy face.  Good Macro shot.  The intricacies of the wing reallystand out.', '2005-05-08 22:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372015, 172684, 33947, '<td valign="top">That''s expectant, alright. Captures it perfectly.</td>', 'That''s expectant, alright. Captures it perfectly.', '2005-05-08 23:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372025, 173014, 10261, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better without the title. Nothing in this image looks particularly nostalgic to me.</td>', 'I would have liked this better without the title. Nothing in this image looks particularly nostalgic to me.', '2005-05-08 23:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372028, 172846, 10261, '<td valign="top">I think that this may have been stronger if the model had been looking down rather than at the camera.</td>', 'I think that this may have been stronger if the model had been looking down rather than at the camera.', '2005-05-08 23:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372031, 172741, 10261, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that I like the crop. The biker''s of the movement is obviously horizontal, so I''d have liked to see a less vertical composition. I like the tension created by him emerging from the side of the frame, but I believe that seeing a bit more of him would have made the image more interesting.</td>', 'I''m not sure that I like the crop. The biker''s of the movement is obviously horizontal, so I''d have liked to see a less vertical composition. I like the tension created by him emerging from the side of the frame, but I believe that seeing a bit more of him would have made the image more interesting.', '2005-05-08 23:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372033, 172381, 10261, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the star effect around every point of light.</td>', 'I don''t care for the star effect around every point of light.', '2005-05-08 23:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372045, 172972, 27789, '<td valign="top">Great B&amp;W work, the only problem i have with it is that while the subject-matter says depression, the execution of the picture is very beautiful.  this is the rare photograph that has grabbed my attention and won''t let it go, i imagine because of the lines, good job.</td>', 'Great B&W work, the only problem i have with it is that while the subject-matter says depression, the execution of the picture is very beautiful.  this is the rare photograph that has grabbed my attention and won''t let it go, i imagine because of the lines, good job.', '2005-05-08 23:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372047, 172843, 25787, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2005-05-08 23:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372049, 173055, 10261, '<td valign="top">The figure crouched in the foreground doesn''t seem to contribute anything positive to the image.</td>', 'The figure crouched in the foreground doesn''t seem to contribute anything positive to the image.', '2005-05-08 23:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372054, 171514, 10818, '<td valign="top">This one probably get voted down pretty bad because people will think it does not meet the contest.<br/> <br/>But I really like it, and it says mood to me.</td>', 'This one probably get voted down pretty bad because people will think it does not meet the contest. But I really like it, and it says mood to me.', '2005-05-08 23:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372055, 172615, 10261, '<td valign="top">The color balance looks odd here.</td>', 'The color balance looks odd here.', '2005-05-08 23:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372056, 172828, 25397, '<td valign="top">Hurray graphicfunk<br/>Great pose, makeup and lighting<br/>Good luck in this challenge man</td>', 'Hurray graphicfunkGreat pose, makeup and lightingGood luck in this challenge man', '2005-05-08 23:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372057, 172508, 10261, '<td valign="top">I don;t really care for the selective desaturation in this case.</td>', 'I don;t really care for the selective desaturation in this case.', '2005-05-08 23:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372060, 172410, 25397, '<td valign="top">Aw, I love the burning at the edges here<br/>Reminds me of a younger version of myself</td>', 'Aw, I love the burning at the edges hereReminds me of a younger version of myself', '2005-05-08 23:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372061, 172939, 10261, '<td valign="top">This image is too small to make out much detail.</td>', 'This image is too small to make out much detail.', '2005-05-08 23:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372062, 172468, 10818, '<td valign="top">That is just so cool !  The facial expression is just too wild.<br/> <br/>Great shot.  10</td>', 'That is just so cool !  The facial expression is just too wild. Great shot.  10', '2005-05-08 23:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372063, 172612, 10261, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Did you use a filter to pull this off? The high saturation adds a little extra kick to an already solid image.<br/></td>', 'Very nicely done. Did you use a filter to pull this off? The high saturation adds a little extra kick to an already solid image.', '2005-05-09 00:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372067, 171163, 10261, '<td valign="top">Something about the expanse of empty gray surrounding this slide and the lack of fine detail makes the entire scene look like a miniature.</td>', 'Something about the expanse of empty gray surrounding this slide and the lack of fine detail makes the entire scene look like a miniature.', '2005-05-09 00:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372068, 172514, 18799, '<td valign="top">While I feel the "joy" in this image, there are a few things that could be improved on to make this a better image.  First, I would have cropped closer, removing much of the sky. 2nd, a fill flash would have reduced the deep shadows on her face, and third, I don''t think you should have cut her feet off.  One "rule" in photography - if you must cut, never do it at a joint.</td>', 'While I feel the "joy" in this image, there are a few things that could be improved on to make this a better image.  First, I would have cropped closer, removing much of the sky. 2nd, a fill flash would have reduced the deep shadows on her face, and third, I don''t think you should have cut her feet off.  One "rule" in photography - if you must cut, never do it at a joint.', '2005-05-09 00:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372071, 172838, 10261, '<td valign="top">The back of daddy''s head and ear occupy far too much of this image.</td>', 'The back of daddy''s head and ear occupy far too much of this image.', '2005-05-09 00:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372072, 172915, 22734, '<td valign="top">A wonder of a shot. Bump.</td>', 'A wonder of a shot. Bump.', '2005-05-09 00:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372074, 173020, 18799, '<td valign="top">A lovely model, but I''m not crazy about your choice of crop.  To me, the left side of the image has nothing to offer... so why leave it in?  6</td>', 'A lovely model, but I''m not crazy about your choice of crop.  To me, the left side of the image has nothing to offer... so why leave it in?  6', '2005-05-09 00:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372076, 172588, 22734, '<td valign="top">A great action capture with that ideal background with nothing to interfere. Bump.</td>', 'A great action capture with that ideal background with nothing to interfere. Bump.', '2005-05-09 00:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372080, 172706, 22734, '<td valign="top">The composition and colors are great. Bump.</td>', 'The composition and colors are great. Bump.', '2005-05-09 00:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372081, 172746, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I think the dodging is too obvious and unnatural looking though.</td>', 'Good idea.  I think the dodging is too obvious and unnatural looking though.', '2005-05-09 00:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372083, 171918, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great masterful lighting by a very promising member who is exploiting the best in lighting and poses with variable moods. Bump.</td>', 'Great masterful lighting by a very promising member who is exploiting the best in lighting and poses with variable moods. Bump.', '2005-05-09 00:08:37.000000', NULL, 1);
