(1372654, 172864, 32848, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments!<br/> <br/>This was a snapshot of my daughter having just had a "disagreement" with her brother.  She came over to the picnic table and sat down opposite me looking like the photo.  My camera was on the table and I just picked up and took the picture.  It was one of those moments when the brain says "DPC...MOODS".  I did not check settings and just fired a shot off, hence the rather uninspiring background.  I would have done some work on the background, but I did not want to lose the blowing hair and, not yet being good enough with PS, left it as it was.  If we had sat the other way around, a glorious view across the estuary of the River Severn would have been behind her.  That''s just the luck of the draw though, isn''t it!<br/> <br/>Thanks for the various ideas regarding the background and burning it in, blurring it etc.  I havent'' played with it yet, but will do.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments! This was a snapshot of my daughter having just had a "disagreement" with her brother.  She came over to the picnic table and sat down opposite me looking like the photo.  My camera was on the table and I just picked up and took the picture.  It was one of those moments when the brain says "DPC...MOODS".  I did not check settings and just fired a shot off, hence the rather uninspiring background.  I would have done some work on the background, but I did not want to lose the blowing hair and, not yet being good enough with PS, left it as it was.  If we had sat the other way around, a glorious view across the estuary of the River Severn would have been behind her.  That''s just the luck of the draw though, isn''t it! Thanks for the various ideas regarding the background and burning it in, blurring it etc.  I havent'' played with it yet, but will do.', '2005-05-09 05:40:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1372658, 171408, 35044, '<td valign="top">I liked this photo a lot - very surprised to see it place so low.  Underrated - the flash was a distraction, but should not have been critical to this great capture.  The unprocessed look of this photograph shone through for me.  However, in advanced editing challenges, I suppose that people expect any distractions to be cloned out. Cheers.</td>', 'I liked this photo a lot - very surprised to see it place so low.  Underrated - the flash was a distraction, but should not have been critical to this great capture.  The unprocessed look of this photograph shone through for me.  However, in advanced editing challenges, I suppose that people expect any distractions to be cloned out. Cheers.', '2005-05-09 06:02:32.000000', NULL, 0),
