(1372696, 172381, 18655, '<td valign="top">Exellent capture of mood in this picture.<br/> <br/>The only thing I would have done differently is perhaps to rotate the picture slightly towards to the left (about 3 degrees maybe) so that the table edge is completely horizontal.<br/> <br/>While I really like the reflections of light on the closest plate, I think I would have done without the starts on the candles.<br/> <br/>-are</td>', 'Exellent capture of mood in this picture. The only thing I would have done differently is perhaps to rotate the picture slightly towards to the left (about 3 degrees maybe) so that the table edge is completely horizontal. While I really like the reflections of light on the closest plate, I think I would have done without the starts on the candles. -are', '2005-05-09 07:29:48.000000', NULL, 0),
