(1372845, 172924, 34481, '<td valign="top">I just wanted to say this is great photo that expresses an emotion very well. The DPC voters don''t know a good photo when they see one.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'I just wanted to say this is great photo that expresses an emotion very well. The DPC voters don''t know a good photo when they see one.  Keep up the good work.', '2005-05-09 09:14:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1372867, 171632, 11800, '<td valign="top">Well look at this. You won! Congrats on your first.</td>', 'Well look at this. You won! Congrats on your first.', '2005-05-09 09:23:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1372897, 172888, 12253, '<td valign="top">I didn''t have time to vote moods but I''m going through the results and ran across this gem.  This is a very underrated photo.  Perhaps it''s the definition of moods (I didn''t enter because I was only thinking of moods involving shots of people).  But that aside, you''ve captured, in a non-effect photo a wonderful range of colors in the water that add a painterly effect.  My only suggestion is perhaps a bit more contrast on the black side of the histogram might have give it a bit more pop, just a touch so you don''t lose the lovely painterly effect.</td>', 'I didn''t have time to vote moods but I''m going through the results and ran across this gem.  This is a very underrated photo.  Perhaps it''s the definition of moods (I didn''t enter because I was only thinking of moods involving shots of people).  But that aside, you''ve captured, in a non-effect photo a wonderful range of colors in the water that add a painterly effect.  My only suggestion is perhaps a bit more contrast on the black side of the histogram might have give it a bit more pop, just a touch so you don''t lose the lovely painterly effect.', '2005-05-09 09:32:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1372908, 173051, 20018, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the comments.  I took a number of shots of this little beauty while she was upset that her dad had to leave for a honeymoon with his new wife. This was the only one shot through the glass door. I thought about using the other "cleaner" shots without the reflection  that many people didn''t seem to like, but I love the reflection of the people looking on and it transfers the idea to the viewer...that while you can appreciate the image, you''re still very removed from this very sincere and emotion filled moment by the glass involved, in the door and also the lens.</td>', 'Thank you for the comments.  I took a number of shots of this little beauty while she was upset that her dad had to leave for a honeymoon with his new wife. This was the only one shot through the glass door. I thought about using the other "cleaner" shots without the reflection  that many people didn''t seem to like, but I love the reflection of the people looking on and it transfers the idea to the viewer...that while you can appreciate the image, you''re still very removed from this very sincere and emotion filled moment by the glass involved, in the door and also the lens.', '2005-05-09 09:43:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1372947, 171632, 24951, '<td valign="top">Your work is incredible. You also prove that one doesn''t need a 5 megapixel camera to take professional quality photos.</td>', 'Your work is incredible. You also prove that one doesn''t need a 5 megapixel camera to take professional quality photos.', '2005-05-09 10:21:27.000000', NULL, 0),
