(1373051, 170900, 14386, '<td valign="top">this calls for a celebration amigo!!!  21 faves as I type this.  i am a rank higher than you but i am quite positive  that you will beat me on faves.  well-deserved.  congrats.<br/> <br/>manny</td>', 'this calls for a celebration amigo!!!  21 faves as I type this.  i am a rank higher than you but i am quite positive  that you will beat me on faves.  well-deserved.  congrats. manny', '2005-05-09 11:20:29.000000', NULL, 0),
