(1373110, 171447, 14386, '<td valign="top">after a bad day yesterday, today headed to an extreme twist.  first off...this win!  i didn''t expect to ribbon as i thought my style has been so predictably boring.  but a red....wooooo... this is really great!  this is an added "uplift" to my day as I submitted my last 7 spreads for the yearbook to my publisher today.  now i have to wait for the digital proof and final proof, respectively and this will give me more time to try something different in my photography.  what a way to end my day (it''s 9:00 pm now here).<br/> <br/>many thanks to all who never get bored of my style of photography.<br/> <br/>manny</td>', 'after a bad day yesterday, today headed to an extreme twist.  first off...this win!  i didn''t expect to ribbon as i thought my style has been so predictably boring.  but a red....wooooo... this is really great!  this is an added "uplift" to my day as I submitted my last 7 spreads for the yearbook to my publisher today.  now i have to wait for the digital proof and final proof, respectively and this will give me more time to try something different in my photography.  what a way to end my day (it''s 9:00 pm now here). many thanks to all who never get bored of my style of photography. manny', '2005-05-09 11:34:50.000000', NULL, 0),
