(1411188, 173057, 30049, '<td valign="top">I checked your profile after a forum post (figured you were in Fairfax after the ''large school system'' comment)...took a peek at some of your challenge entries.  Isn''t it interesting how commenters during a challenge say you should change this or that (hat, no hat - lighting on back of neck, etc...) when it''s quite obvious this is a candid shot (well captured I might add) and had you tried to ''fix'' the pose the candid moment would have been lost.  Some validity perhaps to the post-processing comments but overall a very nice job for your what, third challenge?  Keep shooting and having fun.  Keep ''finding'' shots like this one and you''ll do well...  ;^)</td>', 'I checked your profile after a forum post (figured you were in Fairfax after the ''large school system'' comment)...took a peek at some of your challenge entries.  Isn''t it interesting how commenters during a challenge say you should change this or that (hat, no hat - lighting on back of neck, etc...) when it''s quite obvious this is a candid shot (well captured I might add) and had you tried to ''fix'' the pose the candid moment would have been lost.  Some validity perhaps to the post-processing comments but overall a very nice job for your what, third challenge?  Keep shooting and having fun.  Keep ''finding'' shots like this one and you''ll do well...  ;^)', '2005-05-25 11:02:10.000000', NULL, 0),
